msgid "Supply Chain"
msgstr "Forsyningskæde"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode.rst:8
msgid "Barcode"
msgstr "Stregkode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Odoo Barcode** allows users to assign barcodes to individual products and "
"product packagings, and track inventory movements using those barcodes. By "
"connecting a barcode scanner, certain inventory processes can be triggered "
"by scanning barcodes."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo Stregkode** giver brugere mulighed for at tildele stregkoder til "
"individuelle produkter og produktemballager og spore lagerbevægelser ved "
"hjælp af disse stregkoder. Ved at tilslutte en stregkodescanner kan visse "
"lagerprocesser udløses ved scanning af stregkoder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode.rst:15
msgid ""
"The **Barcode** app is one of the apps available to light users. Light users "
"can only access the **Barcode** app (or other apps available to light "
"users). Light users do not have access to the **Inventory** app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode.rst:20
msgid "`Odoo Tutorials: Barcode <https://www.odoo.com/slides/barcode-30>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo Tutorials: Barcode <https://www.odoo.com/slides/barcode-30>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations.rst:5
msgid "Daily operations"
msgstr "Daglige operationer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:3
msgid "Adjust inventory with barcodes"
msgstr "Justér lager med stregkoder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:5
msgid ""
"An *inventory adjustment*, or inventory audit, is the process of verifying "
"the physical stock of products against the quantities recorded in the "
"database. Regular audits ensure accurate inventory records, prevent stock "
"discrepancies, and maintain efficient operations. In a warehouse setting, "
"managers typically assign inventory counts to employees, who then walk to "
"designated locations, scan product barcodes, and adjust quantities as needed."
msgstr ""
"En *lagerjustering*, eller lagerrevision, er processen med at verificere den "
"fysiske lagerbeholdning af produkter mod de mængder, der er registreret i "
"databasen. Regelmæssige revisioner sikrer nøjagtige lagerregistreringer, "
"forhindrer lagerafvigelser og opretholder effektive operationer. I en "
"lagerindstilling tildeler ledere typisk lageroptællinger til medarbejdere, "
"som derefter går til udpegede lokationer, scanner produktstregkoder og "
"justerer mængder efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:11
msgid ""
"Inventory adjustments can be completed through the **Barcode** application "
"using a compatible scanner, or the Odoo mobile app."
msgstr ""
"Lagerjusteringer kan gennemføres via applikationen **Stregkode** ved hjælp "
"af en kompatibel scanner eller Odoo-mobilappen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:15
msgid ""
"For a list of Odoo-compatible barcode mobile scanners, and other hardware "
"for the **Inventory** and **Barcode** apps, refer to the `Odoo Inventory • "
"Hardware page <https://www.odoo.com/app/inventory-hardware>`_."
msgstr ""
"For en liste over Odoo-kompatible stregkode-mobilscannere og andet hardware "
"til applikationerne **Lager** og **Stregkode**, se `Odoo Inventory • "
"Hardware-siden <https://www.odoo.com/app/inventory-hardware>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:20
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/sub_assemblies.rst:143
msgid ""
":doc:`../../inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/count_products`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`../../inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/count_products`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:23
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Barcode** application provides demo data with barcodes to explore "
"the features of the app. These can be used for testing purposes, and can be "
"printed from the home screen of the app."
msgstr ""
"Odoos **Stregkode**-applikation leverer demodata med stregkoder til at "
"udforske appens funktioner. Disse kan bruges til testformål og kan printes "
"fra appens startskærm."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:26
msgid ""
"To access this demo data, navigate to the :menuselection:`Barcode app` and "
"click :guilabel:`demo data sheet` or :guilabel:`barcodes` in the banner "
"above the scanner."
msgstr ""
"For at få adgang til disse demodata skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Stregkode-appen` og klikke på :guilabel:`demodata-ark` "
"eller :guilabel:`stregkoder` i banneret over scanneren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:29
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/transfers_scratch.rst:191
msgid "Demo data prompt pop-up on Barcode app main screen."
msgstr "Pop-up med demodata-prompt på Stregkode-appens hovedskærm."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:33
msgid "Assigning inventory counts"
msgstr "Tildeling af lageroptællinger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:35
msgid ""
"Before performing an inventory count, managers can :ref:`assign <inventory/"
"plan-counts>` counting tasks to employees. This can be done "
"through :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Operations --> Physical Inventory` "
"by selecting specific locations and products for counting, and assigning "
"a :guilabel:`User` to them. Once assigned, users will see pending counts "
"when they open the **Barcode** app."
msgstr ""
"Før en lageroptælling udføres, kan ledere :ref:`tildele <inventory/plan-"
"counts>` optællingsopgaver til medarbejdere. Dette kan gøres "
"via :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Operationer --> Fysisk lager` ved at vælge "
"specifikke lokationer og produkter til optælling og tildele "
"en :guilabel:`Bruger` til dem. Når de er tildelt, vil brugere se afventende "
"optællinger, når de åbner **Stregkode**-appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:41
msgid ""
"To view a requested inventory count, navigate to the :menuselection:`Barcode "
"app` dashboard. If a count has been requested, the number of products to be "
"counted is listed on the :guilabel:`Count Inventory` button."
msgstr ""
"For at se en anmodet lageroptælling skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Stregkode-appen` dashboard. Hvis der er anmodet om en "
"optælling, vises antallet af produkter, der skal tælles, på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Tæl lager`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/adjustments.rst:45
msgid "The Barcode dashboard with an assigned count."
msgstr "Stregkode-dashboardet med en tildelt optælling."

