"list>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Odoos standard GS1-regler <barcode/operations/default-gs1-nomenclature-"
"list>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/operations/gs1_nomenclature.rst:27
msgid ""
