#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2323
msgid ""
"Open :menuselection:`Inventory --> Reporting --> Stock` to view your current "
"inventory level and valuation for each product, or to review historical data "
"as of a previous date."
msgstr ""
"Åbn :menuselection:`Lager --> Rapportering --> Lager` for at se dit "
"nuværende lagerniveau og værdiansættelse for hvert produkt, eller for at "
"gennemgå historiske data pr. en tidligere dato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2332
msgid "Unit cost"
msgstr "Enhedspris"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2334
msgid ""
"To check a product's existing unit price updates and their origins, click on "
"the product's :guilabel:`Unit Cost`. In :abbr:`AVCO (average cost)` this "
"allows you to understand how the currently used value was calculated."
msgstr ""
"For at kontrollere et produkts eksisterende enhedsprisopdateringer og deres "
"oprindelse skal du klikke på produktets :guilabel:`Enhedspris`. "
"I :abbr:`AVCO (gennemsnitspris)` giver dette dig mulighed for at forstå, "
"hvordan den aktuelt anvendte værdi blev beregnet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2344
msgid "Total value"
msgstr "Samlet værdi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2346
msgid ""
"To see all incoming quantities for which you still have a remaining quantity "
"and the value used for their valuation, click on a "
"product's :guilabel:`Total Value`."
msgstr ""
"For at se alle indgående mængder, som du stadig har en resterende mængde af, "
"og den værdi, der bruges til deres værdiansættelse, skal du klikke på et "
"produkts :guilabel:`Samlet værdi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2349
msgid ""
"In AVCO or standard cost, the used value is always the current average unit "
"cost."
msgstr ""
"I AVCO eller standardpris er den anvendte værdi altid den aktuelle "
"gennemsnitlige enhedspris."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2350
msgid ""
"In FIFO, remaining units from each previous incoming move retain their own "
"individual valuation."
msgstr ""
"I FIFO bevarer resterende enheder fra hver tidligere indgående bevægelse "
"deres egen individuelle værdiansættelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2352
msgid ""
"In FIFO or AVCO, remaining quantities from a previous incoming move can have "
"their value adjusted if necessary: Select the incoming moves to be adjusted, "
"click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and then click :guilabel:`Adjust "
"Valuation`. Enter the new :guilabel:`Value` and, optionally, "
"a :guilabel:`Description`."
msgstr ""
"I FIFO eller AVCO kan resterende mængder fra en tidligere indgående "
"bevægelse få justeret deres værdi, hvis det er nødvendigt: Vælg de indgående "
"bevægelser, der skal justeres, klik på :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Handlinger`, og klik derefter på :guilabel:`Juster "
"værdiansættelse`. Indtast den nye :guilabel:`Værdi` og eventuelt "
"en :guilabel:`Beskrivelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2363
msgid "In Accounting"
msgstr "I Regnskab"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2365
msgid ""
"To view the difference between the accounting stock value and the current "
"inventory value recorded thanks to the incoming moves with a remaining "
"quantity, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> Inventory "
"Valuation`."
msgstr ""
"For at se forskellen mellem den regnskabsmæssige lagerværdi og den aktuelle "
"lagerværdi, der er registreret takket være de indgående bevægelser med en "
"resterende mængde, skal du gå til :menuselection:`Regnskab --> Gennemse --> "
"Lagerværdi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2369
msgid ""
"To generate a new accounting entry to review and post, "
"click :guilabel:`Generate Entry`."
msgstr ""
"For at generere en ny regnskabspostering, der skal gennemses og bogføres, "
"skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Opret postering`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2375
msgid ""
"To view a list of sales and purchase orders for which accrual entries should "
"be encoded, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review` and select the "
"relevant menu item (:guilabel:`Bill To Receive`, :guilabel:`Invoices To Be "
"Issued`, :guilabel:`Billed Not Received` and :guilabel:`Invoiced Not "
"Delivered`). Select the desired lines and click :guilabel:`Create Accrual "
"Entries`."
msgstr ""
"For at se en liste over salgs- og indkøbsordrer, for hvilke "
"periodiseringsbilag bør registreres, gå til :menuselection:`Regnskab --> "
"Gennemse` og vælg det relevante menupunkt (:guilabel:`Fakturaer at "
"modtage`, :guilabel:`Fakturaer der skal udstedes`, :guilabel:`Faktureret "
"ikke modtaget` og :guilabel:`Faktureret ikke leveret`). Vælg de ønskede "
"linjer og klik på :guilabel:`Opret periodiseringsbilag`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2380
msgid ""
"With Anglo-Saxon perpetual accounting, this will also help to distribute "
"recorded inventory variations to accounts such as Bills to "
"Receive/:abbr:`GRNI (goods received not invoiced)` or :abbr:`COGS (cost of "
"goods sold)` as shown in the :ref:`Accounting Entries <accounting-entries>` "
"and :ref:`Journal Entries Configuration <journal-entries>` sections."
msgstr ""
"Med angelsaksisk løbende regnskabsføring vil dette også hjælpe med at "
"fordele registrerede lagervariationer til konti såsom fakturaer at "
"modtage/:abbr:`GRNI (varer modtaget ikke faktureret)` eller :abbr:`COGS "
"(vareforbrug)`, som vist i afsnittene :ref:`Regnskabsposteringer <accounting-"
"entries>` og :ref:`Kassebogskonfiguration <journal-entries>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2396
msgid "Changes in Odoo 19"
msgstr "Ændringer i Odoo 19"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2398
msgid ""
"Before Odoo 19, the Perpetual accounting method was implemented by posting "
"real-time accounting entries at each stock movement. That created a lot of "
"journal items in accounting, which was an issue for performance, general "
"ledger clarity and auditability."
msgstr ""
"Før Odoo 19 blev den løbende regnskabsmetode implementeret ved at bogføre "
"realtidsregnskabsposteringer ved hver lagerbevægelse. Det skabte mange "
"kassebogsposter i regnskabet, hvilket var et problem for performance, "
"hovedbogsklarhed og reviderbarhed."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet.rst:2402
msgid ""
"Since Odoo 19, the Perpetual method impacts the stock valuation account at "
"the invoice level. The closing entry is then used to manage bills to "
"receive, invoices to issue, deferred revenues, prepaid expenses, and other "
"gaps between inventory values and accounting ones."
msgstr ""
"Siden Odoo 19 påvirker den løbende metode lagervurderingskontoen på "
"fakturaniveau. Afslutningsposten bruges derefter til at håndtere fakturaer "
"at modtage, fakturaer der skal udstedes, udskudte indtægter, forudbetalte "
"udgifter og andre forskelle mellem lagerværdier og regnskabsmæssige værdier."

