"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/count_products>` tildeler samme "
"værdi som kostprisen på produktformularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:113
msgid ""
"To make an inventory adjustment, and assign a lot number, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Operations --> Physical Inventory`. "
"Then, click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"For at lave en lagerregulering og tildele et lotnummer skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Handlinger --> Fysisk lager`. Klik "
"derefter på :guilabel:`Ny`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:116
msgid ""
"In the new inventory adjustment line that appears, set "
"the :guilabel:`Product`, create the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number`, set "
"the :guilabel:`Counted Quantity`, and click :icon:`fa-floppy-"
"o` :guilabel:`Apply`."
msgstr ""
"I den nye lagerreguleringslinjen, der vises, skal du "
"indstille :guilabel:`Produkt`, oprette :guilabel:`Lot-/serienummer`, "
"indstille :guilabel:`Optalt antal` og klikke på :icon:`fa-floppy-"
"o` :guilabel:`Anvend`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:120
msgid ""
"To view the valuation layer, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Reporting --> Valuation`. The :guilabel:`Total Value` per unit matches the "
"*Cost* on the product form."
msgstr ""
"For at se værdiansættelseslaget skal du gå til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> "
"Rapportering --> Værdiansættelse`. :guilabel:`Samlet værdi` pr. enhed "
"matcher *Kostpris* på produktformularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:124
msgid ""
"Continuing the example in the table above, when the product cost is `$15`, "
"the valuation for a newly-created `LOT3` is also be `$15`."
msgstr ""
"For at fortsætte eksemplet i tabellen ovenfor, når produktprisen er `$15`, "
"er værdiansættelsen for et nyoprettet `LOT3` også `$15`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:127
msgid "Show inventory adjustment valuation."
msgstr "Vis værdiansættelse af lagerregulering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:133
msgid "Existing lot/serial number"
msgstr "Eksisterende lot-/serienummer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:135
msgid ""
"When adjusting the quantity of an existing lot/serial number, the value is "
"based on the most recent valuation layer for that specific lot/serial number."
msgstr ""
"Når antallet af et eksisterende lot-/serienummer reguleres, er værdien "
"baseret på det seneste værdiansættelseslag for det specifikke lot-/"
"serienummer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:139
msgid ""
"Continuing the example in the table above, the value for `LOT 1` is `$10`."
msgstr ""
"For at fortsætte eksemplet i tabellen ovenfor er værdien for `LOT 1` `$10`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:141
msgid ""
"So, when the quantity is updated from `1.00` to `2.00`, the additional "
"quantity is also valued at `$10`, reflecting the latest valuation layer for "
"`LOT 1`."
msgstr ""
"Så når antallet opdateres fra `1,00` til `2,00`, værdiansættes den ekstra "
"mængde også til `$10`, hvilket afspejler det seneste værdiansættelseslag for "
"`LOT 1`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:144
msgid "Show valuation of LOT 1 getting updated."
msgstr "Vis opdatering af værdiansættelsen af LOT 1."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:147
msgid ""
"The inventory adjustment (top line) is valued the same as LOT 1 (bottom "
"line)."
msgstr ""
"Lagerreguleringen (øverste linje) værdiansættes på samme måde som LOT 1 "
"(nederste linje)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:152
msgid "View valuation"
msgstr "Vis værdiansættelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:154
msgid ""
"To find the average cost of a specific lot/serial number, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Lots/Serial Numbers`, and "
"select the desired record."
msgstr ""
"For at finde den gennemsnitlige kostpris for et specifikt lot-/serienummer "
