"og vælge den ønskede post."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:157
msgid ""
"Both the :guilabel:`Cost` and :guilabel:`Average Cost` fields show a unit's "
"average cost. The :guilabel:`Total Value` reflects the total on-hand value "
"for that lot/serial number."
msgstr ""
"Både feltet :guilabel:`Kostpris` og :guilabel:`Gennemsnitlig kostpris` viser "
"en enheds gennemsnitlige kostpris. :guilabel:`Samlet værdi` afspejler den "
"samlede lagerværdi for det pågældende lot-/serienummer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:161
msgid ""
"Ensure the costing method is set to *First In First Out (FIFO)* or *Average "
"Cost (AVCO)* to display the cost on this page."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at omkostningsmetoden er indstillet til *First In First Out "
"(FIFO)* eller *Gennemsnitlig kostpris (AVCO)* for at vise kostprisen på "
"denne side."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:164
msgid "Show cost of the lot/serial number."
msgstr "Vis kostpris for lot-/serienumret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:167
msgid ""
"Lot form, displaying **Cost** field. The **Valuation** smart button is in "
"the top-right."
msgstr ""
"Lotformular, der viser feltet **Kostpris**. Den smarte knap "
"**Værdiansættelse** er i øverste højre hjørne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:169
msgid ""
"Valuation layers of a lot/serial number can be viewed through "
"the :ref:`valuation report <inventory/product_management/valuation-report>`, "
"or by clicking the lot/serial number's :guilabel:`Valuation` smart button. "
"These detailed, line-by-line records can help determine how each inventory "
"move of the specific lot/serial number affects its valuation."
msgstr ""
"Værdiansættelseslag for et lot-/serienummer kan ses "
"gennem :ref:`værdiansættelsesrapporten <inventory/product_management/"
"valuation-report>` eller ved at klikke på lot-/serienumrets smarte "
"knap :guilabel:`Værdiansættelse`. Disse detaljerede linje-for-linje-poster "
"kan hjælpe med at bestemme, hvordan hver lagerbevægelse af det specifikke "
"lot-/serienummer påvirker dets værdiansættelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:177
msgid "Valuation report"
msgstr "Værdiansættelsesrapport"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:179
msgid ""
"Display the valuation of lots and serial numbers in the database by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Reporting --> Valuation`."
msgstr ""
"Vis værdiansættelsen af lots og serienumre i databasen ved at gå "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Rapportering --> Værdiansættelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:182
msgid ""
"On the resulting :guilabel:`Stock Valuation` report, click the search bar, "
"and in the :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Group By` section of the resulting "
"drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`Lot/Serial number`."
msgstr ""
"På den resulterende rapport :guilabel:`Lagerværdiansættelse` skal du klikke "
"på søgefeltet, og i sektionen :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`Grupper efter` i "
"den resulterende rullemenu skal du vælge :guilabel:`Lot/Serienummer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:187
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon to the right of a "
"collapsed lot number line to manually modify the cost."
msgstr ""
"Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` til højre for en "
"sammenfoldet partinummerlinje for manuelt at ændre kostprisen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:190
msgid ""
"This is useful for adjusting individual lot prices when a purchase order or "
"bill includes multiple lots/serial numbers, as initial prices are identical "
"upon reception."
msgstr ""
"Dette er nyttigt til at justere individuelle lotpriser, når en indkøbsordre "
"eller faktura omfatter flere lots/serienumre, da de oprindelige priser er "
"identiske ved modtagelsen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:193
msgid "Show valuation report, by lots."
msgstr "Vis værdiansættelsesrapport efter lots."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:197
msgid "Valuation smart button"
msgstr "Værdiansættelse smart-knap"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:199
msgid ""
"To access a filtered part of the *Stock Valuation* report, specific to a lot "
"or serial number, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Lots/"
"Serial Numbers`, and select the desired item."
msgstr ""
"For at få adgang til en filtreret del af rapporten *Lagerværdiansættelse*, "
"specifik for et lot eller serienummer, gå til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> "
"Produkter --> Lots/Serienumre`, og vælg det ønskede element."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:202
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Numbers` page, click the :guilabel:`Valuation` "
"smart button."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Lot/Serienumre` skal du klikke på smart-"
"knappen :guilabel:`Værdiansættelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:204
msgid "All stock moves relating to `LOT 1`."
msgstr "Alle lagerbevægelser relateret til `LOT 1`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:207
