":doc:`Units of measure (UoM) <configure/uom>`: a standard quantity for "
"specifying product amounts (e.g., meters, yards, kilograms). Enables "
"automatic conversion between measurement systems in Odoo, such as "
"centimeters to feet."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Måleenheder (UoM) <configure/uom>`: en standardmængde til "
"specificering af produktmængder (f.eks. meter, yards, kilogram). Muliggør "
"automatisk konvertering mellem målesystemer i Odoo, såsom centimeter til fod."

