msgid ""
":doc:`configure/packaging`: groups the *same* products together to receive "
"or sell them in specified quantities."
msgstr ""
":doc:`configure/packaging`: grupperer de *samme* produkter sammen for at "
"modtage eller sælge dem i angivne mængder."

