#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:102
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/forecast.rst:125
msgid "Use cases"
msgstr "Brugstilfælde"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:104
msgid ""
"After comparing the various features, consider how these businesses, with "
"various inventory management and logistics workflows, came to their decision."
msgstr ""
"Efter sammenligning af de forskellige funktioner kan du overveje, hvordan "
"disse virksomheder med forskellige lagerstyring- og logistikworkflows kom "
"frem til deres beslutning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:108
msgid "Pallets of items using packaging"
msgstr "Paller af varer ved hjælp af pakkeemballage"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:110
msgid ""
"A warehouse receives shipments of soap organized on physical pallets, each "
"containing 96 bars. These pallets are used for internal transfers and are "
"also sold as standalone units. For logistical purposes, the pallet's weight "
"must be included in the total shipping weight for certain deliveries. "
"Additionally, the pallet requires a barcode to facilitate tracking, and the "
"number of individual bars of soap must be included in the stock count when "
"the pallet is received."
msgstr ""
"Et lager modtager forsendelser af sæbe organiseret på fysiske paller, hver "
"indeholdende 96 stykker. Disse paller bruges til interne overførsler og "
"sælges også som selvstændige enheder. Af logistikmæssige årsager skal "
"pallens vægt inkluderes i den samlede forsendelsens vægt for visse "
"leveringer. Derudover kræver pallen en stregkode for at lette sporing, og "
"antallet af individuelle stykker sæbe skal inkluderes i lagerantallet, når "
"pallen modtages."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:116
msgid ""
"After evaluating various options, *product packaging* was the most suitable "
"solution. Packaging enables assigning a barcode to a pallet, identifying it "
"as a \"pallet type\" containing 96 soap bars. This barcode streamlines "
"operations by automatically registering the grouped quantity. Key "
"distinctions include:"
msgstr ""
"Efter evaluering af forskellige muligheder var *produktpakkeemballage* den "
"mest velegnede løsning. Pakkeemballage gør det muligt at tildele en "
"stregkode til en palle, identificere den som en \"palletype\", der "
"indeholder 96 stykker sæbe. Denne stregkode strømliner operationer ved "
"automatisk at registrere den grupperede mængde. Vigtige forskelle inkluderer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:121
msgid ""
"**Warehouse tracking limitations**: Odoo tracks only the total quantity, not "
"the number of packagings. For instance, if a pallet with 12 and 24 "
"quantities is received, Odoo records 36 quantities, not the pallet details."
msgstr ""
"**Begrænsninger i lagersporing**: Odoo sporer kun den samlede mængde, ikke "
"antallet af pakkeemballager. For eksempel, hvis en palle med 12 og 24 "
"mængder modtages, registrerer Odoo 36 mængder, ikke palledetaljer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:124
msgid ""
"**Packaging barcodes are type-specific, not unique**: Barcodes represent "
"packaging types (e.g., \"pallet of 96 soap bars\") but do not uniquely "
"identify individual pallets, such as Pallet #1 or Pallet #2."
msgstr ""
"**Pakkeemballagers stregkoder er typespecifikke, ikke unikke**: Stregkoder "
"repræsenterer pakkeemballagetyper (f.eks. \"palle med 96 stykker sæbe\"), "
"men identificerer ikke entydigt individuelle paller, såsom Palle #1 eller "
"Palle #2."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:129
msgid "Capture product information using barcode"
msgstr "Registrer produktinformation ved hjælp af stregkode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:131
msgid ""
"An Odoo user expects the **Barcode** app to display the typical storage "
"location of a product by scanning a barcode for a container."
msgstr ""
"Odoo-bruger forventer, at appen **Stregkode** viser den typiske "
"lagringsplacering for et produkt ved at scanne en stregkode for en container."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:134
msgid ""
"*Packages* was the most suitable. When the :ref:`appropriate setting is "
"enabled <inventory/warehouses_storage/enable-package>`, scanning a package "
"barcode displays its contents in the **Barcode** app."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Når den relevante indstilling er aktiveret <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/enable-package>`, viser scanning af en pakkestregkode "
"dens indhold i appen **Stregkode**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:138
msgid ""
"Packages represent physical containers, enabling detailed tracking of the "
"items they hold. Scanning a package provides visibility into its contents "
"and facilitates operations, like inventory moves."
msgstr ""
"Pakker repræsenterer fysiske containere, der muliggør detaljeret sporing af "
"de varer, de indeholder. Scanning af en pakke giver synlighed af dens "
"indhold og letter operationer som lagerbevægelser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:145
msgid "Track different units of measure in storage"
msgstr "Spore forskellige måleenheder på lager"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:147
msgid "A fruit juice distributor tracks multiple |UoMs| for their operations:"
msgstr "En frugtjuicedistributør sporer flere |UoMs| til deres operationer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:149
msgid "Fruits are purchased in tons."
msgstr "Frugt købes i tons."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:150
msgid "Juice is produced and stored in kilograms."
msgstr "Juice produceres og opbevares i kilogram."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:151
msgid "Small samples are stored in grams for recipe testing."
msgstr "Små prøver opbevares i gram til opskriftstest."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:153
msgid ""
"*Unit of Measure* was most suitable. Odoo automatically converts tons to "
"kilograms during receipts. However, since Odoo tracks only one |UoM| per "
"product in the database, the company uses lot numbers to differentiate |"
"UoMs|:"
msgstr ""
"*Måleenhed* var mest egnet. Odoo konverterer automatisk tons til kilogram "
"under modtagelser. Men da Odoo kun sporer én |UoM| pr. produkt i databasen, "
"bruger virksomheden lotnumre til at differentiere |UoMs|:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:157
msgid "LOT1: Grams (g)"
msgstr "LOT1: Gram (g)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:158
msgid "LOT2: Kilograms (kg)"
msgstr "LOT2: Kilogram (kg)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure.rst:160
msgid ""
"Manual inventory adjustments are required to convert between lots, such as "
"subtracting 1 kg from LOT2 to add 1,000 g to LOT1. While functional, this "
"workaround can be time-consuming and prone to errors."
msgstr ""
"Manuelle lagerjusteringer er nødvendige for at konvertere mellem lots, såsom "
"at trække 1 kg fra LOT2 for at tilføje 1.000 g til LOT1. Selvom det er "
"funktionelt, kan denne løsning være tidskrævende og fejltilbøjelig."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:3
msgid "Pack-in-pack"
msgstr "Pakke-i-pakke"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:5
msgid ""
"In more complex warehouse operations, it is sometimes necessary to handle "
"groups of containers (for example, grouping pallets together). These "
"containers may be physically combined or logically grouped at the database "
"level, allowing them to be treated as a single unit for certain stock "
"movements while still retaining visibility into their internal structure. "
"This makes it possible to move the entire group with a single scan, rather "
"than scanning each pallet individually."
msgstr ""
"I mere komplekse lageroperationer er det nogle gange nødvendigt at håndtere "
"grupper af containere (f.eks. gruppering af paller sammen). Disse containere "
"kan være fysisk kombineret eller logisk grupperet på databaseniveau, hvilket "
"gør det muligt at behandle dem som en enkelt enhed for visse "
"lagerbevægelser, samtidig med at synligheden i deres interne struktur "
"bevares. Dette gør det muligt at flytte hele gruppen med en enkelt scanning "
"i stedet for at scanne hver palle individuelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:14
msgid ""
"Before working with the pack-in-pack settings, "
"open :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Enable "
"the :guilabel:`Packages` setting. Be sure to click :guilabel:`Save` before "
"exiting this page."
msgstr ""
"Før du arbejder med pakke-i-pakke-indstillingerne, skal du "
"åbne :menuselection:`Lager-appen --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`. "
"Aktiver indstillingen :guilabel:`Pakker`. Sørg for at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Gem`, før du forlader denne side."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:18
msgid "Enable Packages in the Inventory configuration settings."
msgstr "Aktivér Pakker i Lager-konfigurationsindstillingerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:22
msgid "Set package type"
msgstr "Indstil pakketype"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:24
msgid ""
"The *Set Package Type* setting must be enabled for all operations that "
"require pack-in-pack functionality."
msgstr ""
"Indstillingen *Indstil pakketype* skal være aktiveret for alle operationer, "
"der kræver pakke-i-pakke-funktionalitet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:27
msgid ""
"Open :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Operation Types`. "
"The :guilabel:`Operation Types` page opens. Open an operation type."
msgstr ""
"Åbn :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Konfiguration --> Operationstyper`. "
"Siden :guilabel:`Operationstyper` åbnes. Åbn en operationstype."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:30
msgid ""
"On the operation type form, in the :guilabel:`Packages` section, "
"select :guilabel:`Set Package Type`."
msgstr ""
"I operationstypeformularen skal du i afsnittet :guilabel:`Pakker` "
"vælge :guilabel:`Angiv pakketype`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Set Package Type` is enabled for the `Receipts` operation type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Angiv pakketype` er aktiveret for operationstypen `Modtagelser`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:36
msgid "Update the Set Package Type setting on the operation type form."
msgstr "Opdater indstillingen Angiv pakketype i operationstypeformularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:40
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:125
msgid "Create package types"
msgstr "Opret pakketyper"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:127
msgid ""
"Create package types by navigating to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Package Types`, in order to set custom dimensions and "
"weight limits. This feature is mainly used to calculate package weights for "
"shipping costs."
msgstr ""
"Opret pakketyper ved at navigere til :menuselection:`Lager-appen --> "
"Konfiguration --> Pakketyper` for at indstille brugerdefinerede dimensioner "
"og vægtgrænser. Denne funktion bruges hovedsageligt til at beregne "
"pakkevægte til forsendelsesomkostninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:46
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Package Types` list, clicking :guilabel:`New` opens a "
"blank package type form. The fields of the form are as follows:"
msgstr ""
"På listen :guilabel:`Pakketyper` åbner et klik på :guilabel:`Ny` en tom "
"pakketypeformular. Felterne i formularen er som følger:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:49
msgid ":guilabel:`Package Type` (required): Define the package type's name."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Pakketype` (påkrævet): Definer pakketypens navn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Size`: Define the package dimensions in millimeters (mm). The "
"fields, from left to right, define the Length, Width, and Height."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Størrelse`: Definer pakkedimensionerne i millimeter (mm). "
"Felterne definerer fra venstre mod højre længde, bredde og højde."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Weight`: weight of an empty package (e.g., an empty box, pallet)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Vægt`: vægt af en tom pakke (f.eks. en tom kasse, palle)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:55
msgid ""
"Odoo calculates the package's weight by adding the weight of the empty "
"package plus the weight of the items, which can be found in "
"the :guilabel:`Weight` field, in the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab, of each "
"product form."
msgstr ""
"Odoo beregner pakkens vægt ved at lægge vægten af den tomme pakke sammen med "
"vægten af varerne, som kan findes i feltet :guilabel:`Vægt` under "
"fanen :guilabel:`Lager` i hver produktformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:59
msgid ":guilabel:`Max Weight`: maximum shipping weight allowed in the package."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Maks. vægt`: maksimal tilladte forsendelsevægt i pakken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:60
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:144
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Barcode`: Define a barcode to identify the package type from a "
"scan."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Stregkode`: Definer en stregkode til at identificere pakketypen "
"fra en scanning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sequence Prefix`: Specify a prefix to use when a new package name "
"is created by Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sekvenspræfiks`: Angiv et præfiks, der skal bruges, når et nyt "
"pakkenavn oprettes af Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:64
msgid ""
"Use `PAL` for the `Pallet` package type. When the first package of the "
"`Pallet` type is created, it is named `PAL0000001`."
msgstr ""
"Brug `PAL` til pakketypen `Palle`. Når den første pakke af typen `Palle` "
"oprettes, får den navnet `PAL0000001`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Specify a company to make the package type available "
"only within that company. Leave the field blank if it is available at all "
"companies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Virksomhed`: Angiv en virksomhed for at gøre pakketypen "
"tilgængelig kun inden for den pågældende virksomhed. Lad feltet stå tomt, "
"hvis den skal være tilgængelig i alle virksomheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:69
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:157
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Carrier`: Specify the intended shipping carrier for this package "
"type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fragtmand`: Angiv den påtænkte fragtmand for denne pakketype."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:70
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:158
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Carrier Code`: Define a code that is linked to the package type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fragtmandskode`: Definer en kode, der er knyttet til pakketypen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:72
msgid "Create a custom package type."
msgstr "Opret en brugerdefineret pakketype."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:76
msgid "Pack-in-pack process"
msgstr "Pakke-i-pakke-proces"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:78
msgid ""
"After :guilabel:`Set Package Type` is enabled in the operation type form, "
"pack-in-pack can be used from that operation type."
msgstr ""
"Når :guilabel:`Angiv pakketype` er aktiveret i operationstypeformularen, kan "
"pakke-i-pakke bruges fra den pågældende operationstype."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:81
msgid ""
"Open the operation type from the :guilabel:`Operations` menu. The list of "
"operations for that operation type displays. Open an operation from that "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Åbn operationstypen fra menuen :guilabel:`Operationer`. Listen over "
"operationer for den pågældende operationstype vises. Åbn en operation fra "
"den liste."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:84
msgid ""
"To put the contents of a line into a single package, click "
"the :guilabel:`Details` link on the far right of the product line."
msgstr ""
"For at lægge indholdet af en linje i en enkelt pakke skal du klikke på "
"linket :guilabel:`Detaljer` yderst til højre på produktlinjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:87
msgid ""
"Use the Details link to open the Detailed Operations window and specify a "
"package."
msgstr ""
"Brug linket Detaljer til at åbne vinduet Detaljerede operationer og angive "
"en pakke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:90
msgid ""
"The *Detailed Operations* window opens. In this window, specify "
"a :guilabel:`Store to` location, the name of the :guilabel:`Destination "
"Package`, and the :guilabel:`Quantity` of items to be put in that package. "
"To break the inventory into multiple packages, click the :guilabel:`Add a "
"line` link; be sure that the :guilabel:`Quantity` of each line adds up to "
"the total :guilabel:`Demand`. Click :guilabel:`Save` to create the package "
"in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Vinduet *Detaljerede operationer* åbnes. I dette vindue skal du angive "
"en :guilabel:`Opbevar til`-lokation, navnet på :guilabel:`Destinationspakke` "
"og :guilabel:`Antal` varer, der skal lægges i den pågældende pakke. For at "
"opdele lagerbeholdningen i flere pakker skal du klikke på "
"linket :guilabel:`Tilføj en linje`; sørg for, at :guilabel:`Antal` for hver "
"linje summerer til den samlede :guilabel:`Efterspørgsel`. Klik "
"på :guilabel:`Gem` for at oprette pakken i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:96
msgid "Specify a Destination Package in the Detailed Operations form."
msgstr "Angiv en destinationspakke i formularen Detaljerede operationer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:99
msgid "Repeat this process for all product lines on the operation form."
msgstr "Gentag denne proces for alle produktlinjer i operationsformularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:101
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click the :guilabel:`Put in Pack` button on the operation "
"form to put all items with a :guilabel:`Quantity` greater than `0.00` into a "
"package. The *Put in Pack* pop-up window opens."
msgstr ""
"Alternativt kan du klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Læg i pakke` på "
"operationsformularen for at lægge alle varer med et :guilabel:`Antal` større "
"end `0,00` i en pakke. Pop op-vinduet *Læg i pakke* åbnes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:104
msgid ""
"In the *Put in Pack* window, specify a :guilabel:`Package Type` "
"and :guilabel:`Package`, or leave the :guilabel:`Package` field blank to "
"create a new package. Then click the :guilabel:`Put in Pack` button. The "
"package name appears in the product line's :guilabel:`Packages` field."
msgstr ""
"I vinduet *Læg i pakke* skal du angive en :guilabel:`Pakketype` "
"og :guilabel:`Pakke`, eller lad feltet :guilabel:`Pakke` være tomt for at "
"oprette en ny pakke. Klik derefter på knappen :guilabel:`Læg i pakke`. "
"Pakkenavnet vises i produktlinjens felt :guilabel:`Pakker`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:108
msgid "Specify a Package Type and, optionally, a package name."
msgstr "Angiv en pakketype og eventuelt et pakkenavn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:112
msgid ""
"A business has placed an order for `20` units each of `Apple Juice Cans`, "
"`Orange Juice Cans`, `Sparkling Water Cans`, and `Soda Cans`. When the order "
"arrives, each product arrives in its own box of 20 cans."
msgstr ""
"En virksomhed har afgivet en ordre på `20` enheder af hver `Æblejuicedåser`, "
"`Appelsinjuicedåser`, `Danskvandsdåser` og `Sodavandsdåser`. Når ordren "
"ankommer, ankommer hvert produkt i sin egen kasse med 20 dåser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:116
msgid ""
"The warehouse manager specifies a separate package for each product line on "
"the receipt."
msgstr ""
"Lagerlederen angiver en separat pakke for hver produktlinje på modtagelsen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:118
msgid "Four packages are created on the receipt form."
msgstr "Fire pakker oprettes på modtagelsesformularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:121
msgid ""
"Then, to organize all packages into a single larger unit (for example, to "
"package multiple cases of soda into a pallet), click the :guilabel:`Put in "
"Pack` button. After closing the *Put in Pack* window, "
"the :guilabel:`Packages` field for the product lines in the greater package "
"updates with the new package name."
msgstr ""
"For derefter at organisere alle pakker i en enkelt større enhed (for "
"eksempel for at pakke flere kasser sodavand på en palle) skal du klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Læg i pakke`. Efter lukning af vinduet *Læg i pakke* "
"opdateres feltet :guilabel:`Pakker` for produktlinjerne i den større pakke "
"med det nye pakkenavn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:127
msgid ""
"Continuing the example from above, the warehouse manager wants to package "
"all of the products onto a single pallet for storage in the warehouse. They "
"click the :guilabel:`Put in Pack` button, then in the *Put in Pack* window, "
"they specify `Pallet` as the :guilabel:`Package Type`. "
"The :guilabel:`Packages` field for all product lines updates to show the "
"pallet package name, `PAL0000001`."
msgstr ""
"I fortsættelse af eksemplet ovenfor ønsker lagerlederen at pakke alle "
"produkterne på en enkelt palle til opbevaring på lageret. De klikker på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Læg i pakke`, og i vinduet *Læg i pakke* angiver de "
"`Palle` som :guilabel:`Pakketype`. Feltet :guilabel:`Pakker` for alle "
"produktlinjer opdateres for at vise pallepakkenavnet, `PAL0000001`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:133
msgid "The Packages field updates with a new package name."
msgstr "Feltet Pakker opdateres med et nyt pakkenavn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:136
msgid ""
"Be sure to :guilabel:`Validate` the operation to process its move in "
"inventory."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for at :guilabel:`Validere` operationen for at behandle dens flytning i "
"lagerbeholdningen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:139
msgid "Viewing the packages in an operation"
msgstr "Visning af pakkerne i en operation"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:141
msgid ""
"To view the packages created from an operation, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cubes` :guilabel:`Packages` smart button at the top of the operation form. "
"By default, this list is filtered by the :guilabel:`Main Packages`, or the "
"largest package assigned to the operation. To view all packages, remove "
"the :guilabel:`Main Packages` filter."
msgstr ""
"For at se de pakker, der er oprettet fra en operation, skal du klikke på "
"smart-knappen :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`Pakker` øverst på "
"operationsformularen. Som standard er denne liste filtreret "
"efter :guilabel:`Hovedpakker`, eller den største pakke, der er tildelt "
"operationen. For at se alle pakker skal du fjerne "
"filteret :guilabel:`Hovedpakker`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:146
msgid "Show all packages on the Packages list."
msgstr "Vis alle pakker på listen Pakker."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:150
msgid "Removing packages from parent packages"
msgstr "Fjernelse af pakker fra overordnede pakker"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:152
msgid ""
"To remove packages from parent packages, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cubes` :guilabel:`Packages` smart button at the top of the operation form. "
"By default, this list is filtered by the :guilabel:`Main Packages`, or the "
"largest package assigned to the operation. To view all packages, remove "
"the :guilabel:`Main Packages` filter."
msgstr ""
"For at fjerne pakker fra overordnede pakker skal du klikke på smart-"
"knappen :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`Pakker` øverst på operationsformularen. "
"Som standard er denne liste filtreret efter :guilabel:`Hovedpakker`, eller "
"den største pakke, der er tildelt operationen. For at se alle pakker skal du "
"fjerne filteret :guilabel:`Hovedpakker`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:157
msgid ""
"Select the check boxes next to the packages that you want to remove, then "
"click the :guilabel:`Remove` button."
msgstr ""
"Marker afkrydsningsfelterne ud for de pakker, du vil fjerne, og klik "
"derefter på knappen :guilabel:`Fjern`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:161
msgid "Viewing packages in inventory"
msgstr "Visning af pakker i lagerbeholdning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:163
msgid ""
"Open :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Packages`. All packages "
"in inventory are listed here."
msgstr ""
"Åbn :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Produkter --> Pakker`. Alle pakker i "
"lagerbeholdningen er anført her."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:166
msgid ""
"To view the contents of a package, open the package from the list of "
"packages. The products in the package, including the child packages they are "
"stored in, are listed on the package form."
msgstr ""
"For at se indholdet af en pakke skal du åbne pakken fra listen over pakker. "
"Produkterne i pakken, inklusive de underordnede pakker, de er opbevaret i, "
"er anført på pakkeformularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/pack_in_pack.rst:169
msgid "Child packages are listed on the package reference form."
msgstr "Underordnede pakker er anført på pakkereferencens formular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:7
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/least_packages.rst:32
msgid ""
"A *package* is a physical container holding one or more products. Packages "
"can also be used to store items in bulk."
msgstr ""
"En *pakke* er en fysisk container, der indeholder et eller flere produkter. "
"Pakker kan også bruges til at opbevare varer i bulk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:10
msgid "Packages are commonly used for the following purposes:"
msgstr "Pakker bruges almindeligvis til følgende formål:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:12
msgid ""
":ref:`Grouping products to move them in bulk <inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"pack>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Gruppere produkter for at flytte dem i bulk <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/pack>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:13
msgid ""
":ref:`Shipping to customers <inventory/warehouses_storage/package-type>`: "
"configure package types to align with shipping carriers' size and weight "
"requirements, streamlining the packing process, and ensuring compliance with "
"carrier shipping specifications."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Forsendelse til kunder <inventory/warehouses_storage/package-type>`: "
"konfigurer pakketyper, så de passer til fragtfirmaers størrelses- og "
"vægtkrav, hvilket strømliner pakkeprocessen og sikrer overholdelse af "
"fragtspecifikationer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:16
msgid "Storing items in bulk."
msgstr "Opbevare varer i bulk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:18
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Use` is a field on the package type form in Odoo that is "
"only visible by enabling the :guilabel:`Batch, Wave & Cluster Transfers` "
"and :guilabel:`Packages` features (:menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pakkeanvendelse` er et felt på pakketypeformularen i Odoo, som "
"kun er synligt ved at aktivere funktionerne :guilabel:`Batch-, bølge- og "
"klyngeoverførsler` og :guilabel:`Pakker` (:menuselection:`Appen Lager --> "
"Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:22
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Package Use` field on a package type form is set "
"to :guilabel:`Disposable Box`. **Only** change this field "
"to :guilabel:`Reusable Box` when configuring packages for :ref:`cluster "
"pickings <inventory/warehouses_storage/cluster-pack>`."
msgstr ""
"Som standard er feltet :guilabel:`Pakkeanvendelse` på en pakketypeformular "
"indstillet til :guilabel:`Engangskasse`. Skift **kun** dette felt "
"til :guilabel:`Genanvendelig kasse`, når der konfigureres pakker "
"til :ref:`klyngeplukninger <inventory/warehouses_storage/cluster-pack>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Type` is a feature most often used for :doc:`calculating "
"shipping cost <../../shipping_receiving/setup_configuration>`, based on real "
"shipping weight. Create package types to include the weight of the package "
"itself (e.g. boxes, pallets, other shipping containers) in shipping cost "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pakketype` er en funktion, der oftest bruges til :doc:`beregning "
"af forsendelsesomkostninger <../../shipping_receiving/setup_configuration>` "
"baseret på faktisk forsendelsesvægt. Opret pakketyper for at medregne vægten "
"af selve pakken (f.eks. kasser, paller, andre forsendelsescontainere) i "
"beregningen af forsendelsesomkostninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:32
msgid ""
"While packages are commonly used in the :doc:`three-step delivery route "
"<../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/delivery_three_steps>`, they can "
"be used in any workflow involving products tracked by quantity, lots, or "
"serial numbers."
msgstr ""
"Selvom pakker ofte bruges i :doc:`tre-trins leveringsruten <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/delivery_three_steps>`, kan de bruges i "
"enhver arbejdsgang, der involverer produkter, som spores efter antal, "
"partier eller serienumre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:41
msgid ""
"To use packages, first go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration "
"--> Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Operations` heading, activate "
"the :guilabel:`Packages` feature. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"For at bruge pakker skal du først gå til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> "
"Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`. Under overskriften :guilabel:`Operationer` "
"skal du aktivere funktionen :guilabel:`Pakker`. Klik derefter "
"på :guilabel:`Gem`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:45
msgid ""
"Activate the *Packages* setting in Inventory > Configuration > Settings."
msgstr ""
"Aktivér indstillingen *Pakker* i Lager > Konfiguration > Indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:50
msgid ""
"When moving packages internally, the *Move Entire Packages* feature can be "
"enabled on an operation type to update a package's contained item's location "
"upon updating the package's location."
msgstr ""
"Når pakker flyttes internt, kan funktionen *Flyt hele pakker* aktiveres på "
"en operationstype for at opdatere placeringen af en pakkes indeholdte varer "
"ved opdatering af pakkens placering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:53
msgid ""
"To do that, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Operations Types` and select the desired operation this feature will apply "
"to (may have to set it for multiple)."
msgstr ""
"For at gøre dette skal du gå til :menuselection:`Lager-appen --> "
"Konfiguration --> Operationstyper` og vælge den ønskede operation, som denne "
"funktion skal gælde for (skal muligvis indstilles for flere)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:56
msgid ""
"Open the :guilabel:`Barcode App` tab, then select the :guilabel:`Move Entire "
"Packages` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Åbn fanen :guilabel:`Stregkode-app`, og marker derefter "
"afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Flyt hele pakker`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/package.rst:58
msgid "Enable \"Move Entire Packages\" on the Operation Type."
msgstr "Aktiver \"Flyt hele pakker\" på operationstypen."

