"Depending on the warehouse configuration, Odoo can also generate the "
"following warehouse route:"
msgstr ""
"Afhængigt af lagerkonfigurationen kan Odoo også generere følgende lagerrute:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:122
msgid ""
"*Resupply Subcontractor*: Sends components from |ST| to subcontractors. "
"Generated when :guilabel:`Resupply Subcontractors` is enabled on the "
"warehouse."
msgstr ""
"*Resupply Subcontractor*: Sender komponenter fra |ST| til underleverandører. "
"Genereres, når :guilabel:`Resupply Subcontractors` er aktiveret på lageret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:126
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:423
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:159
msgid ":doc:`../../warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:131
msgid "Advanced: how routes work"
msgstr "Avanceret: hvordan ruter fungerer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:133
msgid ""
":ref:`Standard routes <inventory/routes/warehouse-routes>` work without any "
"rule configurations. For more advanced users, the following section provides "
"information about routes and their rules and operations."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Standardruter <inventory/routes/warehouse-routes>` fungerer uden nogen "
"regelkonfigurationer. For mere avancerede brugere giver følgende afsnit "
"oplysninger om ruter samt deres regler og handlinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:137
msgid ""
"*Routes* are combinations of :ref:`push <inventory/routes/overview/push-"
"rules>` and :ref:`pull <inventory/routes/overview/pull-rules>` rules that "
"determine how products move between locations."
msgstr ""
"*Ruter* er kombinationer af :ref:`push <inventory/routes/overview/push-"
"rules>`- og :ref:`pull <inventory/routes/overview/pull-rules>`-regler, der "
"bestemmer, hvordan produkter flyttes mellem lokationer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:143
msgid "Push rules"
msgstr "Pravidla posunutí"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:145
msgid ""
"Push rules move products from a source location to a destination location. "
"These rules are triggered as soon as products arrive at the source location."
msgstr ""
"Push-regler flytter produkter fra en kildelokation til en "
"destinationslokation. Disse regler udløses, så snart produkter ankommer til "
"kildelokationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:149
msgid ""
"Push rules can only be triggered once a product transfer has already been "
"generated."
msgstr ""
"Push-regler kan kun udløses, når en produktoverførsel allerede er oprettet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:152
msgid ""
"Different products arrive from |VEND| at |IN|. Push rules are configured on "
"some products to move directly to |ST| as soon as they arrive at |IN|, while "
"other products are pushed to |QC|."
msgstr ""
"Forskellige produkter ankommer fra |VEND| til |IN|. Push-regler er "
"konfigureret på nogle produkter til at flytte direkte til |ST|, så snart de "
"ankommer til |IN|, mens andre produkter skubbes til |QC|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:155
msgid "View of a generic push to rule when receiving products."
msgstr "Pohled na obecné pravidlo posunutí při příjmu produktů."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:161
msgid "Pull rules"
msgstr "Pravidla tahu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:163
msgid ""
"Pull rules define product transfer flows from a source location to a "
"destination location. These rules are demand-driven, triggered only when "
"demand (e.g., sales orders or reordering needs) is confirmed at the "
"destination location."
msgstr ""
"Pull-regler definerer overførselsflows for produkter fra en kildelokation "
"til en destinationslokation. Disse regler er efterspørgselsdrevne og udløses "
"kun, når efterspørgsel (f.eks. salgsordrer eller genbestillingsbehov) "
"bekræftes på destinationslokationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:168
msgid ""
"For multi-step routes, pull rules are often used along with push rules. When "
"there are multiple locations in the transfer flow, the pull rule specifies "
"the final destination of the product and generates the first transfer in the "
"route. Push rules are required to move the product through the rest of the "
"transfer flow."
msgstr ""
"Ved flertrinsruter bruges pull-regler ofte sammen med push-regler. Når der "
"er flere lokationer i overførselsflowet, angiver pull-reglen produktets "
"endelige destination og genererer den første overførsel i ruten. Push-regler "
"er nødvendige for at flytte produktet gennem resten af overførselsflowet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:174
msgid ""
"For example, a warehouse is configured with a 3-step delivery route. A pull "
"rule is configured to move products from the |ST| as soon as they are needed "
"at |CUST|. The rule also creates the first transfer in the flow, a *Pick* "
"operation that moves products from |ST| to the |PACK|. Then, push rules move "
"the products from |PACK| to |OUT|, then finally from |OUT| to |CUST|."
msgstr ""
"For eksempel er et lager konfigureret med en 3-trins leveringsrute. En pull-"
"regel er konfigureret til at flytte produkter fra |ST|, så snart der er "
"behov for dem på |CUST|. Reglen opretter også den første overførsel i "
"flowet, en *Pluk*-operation, der flytter produkter fra |ST| til |PACK|. "
"Derefter flytter push-regler produkterne fra |PACK| til |OUT|, og endelig "
"fra |OUT| til |CUST|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:179
msgid "View of a generic pull from rule when preparing deliveries."
msgstr "Pohled na obecné pravidlo tahu při přípravě dodávek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:185
msgid "Additional routes"
msgstr "Yderligere ruter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:187
msgid ""
"In addition to the standard warehouse flows, the following optional routes "
"are available in Odoo. Unlike standard warehouse routes, these routes are "
"**not** applied automatically. They must be manually :ref:`applied "
"<inventory/routes/apply>` to individual products, product categories, or "
"other records."
msgstr ""
"Ud over standardlagerflows er følgende valgfrie ruter tilgængelige i Odoo. I "
"modsætning til standardlagerruter anvendes disse ruter **ikke** automatisk. "
"De skal :ref:`anvendes <inventory/routes/apply>` manuelt på individuelle "
"produkter, produktkategorier eller andre poster."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:193
msgid ""
"By default, the *Buy* and *Manufacture* routes are automatically applied "
"under the following conditions:"
msgstr ""
"Som standard anvendes ruterne *Buy* og *Manufacture* automatisk under "
"følgende betingelser:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:196
msgid ""
"*Buy*: The product has a specified :ref:`vendor <purchase/manage_deals/"
"vendor-pricelist>`."
msgstr ""
"*Buy*: Produktet har en angivet :ref:`leverandør <purchase/manage_deals/"
"vendor-pricelist>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:197
msgid ""
"*Manufacture*: The product has a :doc:`Bill of Materials <../../../"
"manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"*Manufacture*: Produktet har en :doc:`stykliste <../../../manufacturing/"
"basic_setup/bill_configuration>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:200
msgid "These routes, however, can still be made selectable."
msgstr "Disse ruter kan dog stadig gøres valgbare."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:208
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:249
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beskrivelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:209
msgid ""
":doc:`Replenish on Order (MTO) <../../warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Genbestil på ordre (MTO) <../../warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:210
msgid ""
"Triggers a replenishment for each order instead of using existing stock. "
"Used together with the *Buy* or *Manufacture* route."
msgstr ""
"Udløser en genopfyldning for hver ordre i stedet for at bruge det "
"eksisterende lager. Bruges sammen med ruten *Buy* eller *Manufacture*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:212
msgid "Buy"
msgstr "Køb"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:213
msgid ""
"Creates an |RfQ| when products need to be replenished. Requires the "
"**Purchase** app."
msgstr ""
"Opretter en |RfQ|, når produkter skal genopfyldes. Kræver appen **Indkøb**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:214
msgid "Manufacture"
msgstr "Producer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:215
msgid ""
"Creates an |MO| when products need to be replenished. Requires the "
"**Manufacturing** app."
msgstr ""
"Opretter en |MO|, når produkter skal genopfyldes. Kræver appen "
"**Produktion**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:216
msgid ":doc:`Dropship <dropshipping>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Dropship <dropshipping>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:217
msgid ""
"Has a vendor ship products directly to the customer or to a subcontractor, "
"if applicable."
msgstr ""
"Får en leverandør til at sende produkter direkte til kunden eller eventuelt "
"til en underleverandør."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:218
msgid ""
":doc:`Resupply Subcontractor on Order <../../../manufacturing/subcontracting/"
"subcontracting_resupply>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Genforsyn underleverandør på ordre <../../../manufacturing/"
"subcontracting/subcontracting_resupply>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:220
msgid ""
"Sends components to the subcontractor when a subcontracted product is "
"ordered. The components are sent from stock through the warehouse's "
"*Resupply Subcontractor* route."
msgstr ""
"Sender komponenter til underleverandøren, når et underleverandørprodukt "
"bestilles. Komponenterne sendes fra lager via lagerets rute *Genforsyn "
"underleverandør*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:226
msgid "Applying routes"
msgstr "Anvendelse af ruter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:228
msgid ""
"Routes can be manually assigned to products, product categories, package "
"types, shipping methods, and sales order lines. This is only required "
"for :ref:`additional routes <inventory/routes/reference>`, such as "
"*Replenish on Order (MTO)*, *Buy*, *Manufacture*, or *Dropship*."
msgstr ""
"Ruter kan tildeles manuelt til produkter, produktkategorier, emballagetyper, "
"forsendelsesmetoder og salgsordrelinjer. Dette er kun påkrævet "
"for :ref:`yderligere ruter <inventory/routes/reference>`, såsom *Replenish "
"on Order (MTO)*, *Buy*, *Manufacture* eller *Dropship*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:234
msgid ""
"In order to apply routes on these forms, they must first be :ref:`made "
"selectable <inventory/routes/manage/visibility>`."
msgstr ""
"For at anvende ruter på disse formularer skal de først :ref:`gøres valgbare "
"<inventory/routes/manage/visibility>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:237
msgid ""
"When routes are applied in multiple places, Odoo selects the route that can "
"handle the product's next step. It checks routes in the following order:"
msgstr ""
"Når ruter anvendes flere steder, vælger Odoo den rute, der kan håndtere "
"produktets næste trin. Den kontrollerer ruter i følgende rækkefølge:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:240
msgid ""
":ref:`On the sales order line <inventory/routes/apply/so-lines>`. If none, "
"check the order's :ref:`shipping method <inventory/routes/apply/shipping-"
"methods>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`På salgsordrelinjen <inventory/routes/apply/so-lines>`. Hvis der ikke "
"er nogen, tjekkes ordrens :ref:`forsendelsesmetode <inventory/routes/apply/"
"shipping-methods>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:242
msgid ""
":ref:`On the package type <inventory/routes/apply/package-types>` of the "
"order line's selected packaging unit."
msgstr ""
":ref:`På emballagetypen <inventory/routes/apply/package-types>` for "
"ordrelinjens valgte emballageenhed."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:244
msgid ""
":ref:`On the product <inventory/routes/apply/products>` and/or on "
"its :ref:`product category <inventory/routes/apply/product-categories>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`På produktet <inventory/routes/apply/products>` og/eller på "
"dets :ref:`produktkategori <inventory/routes/apply/product-categories>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:246
msgid "On the warehouse."
msgstr "På lageret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:249
msgid ""
"A warehouse uses 3-step deliveries. The *Pallet* package type has a route "
"that ships directly from stock. A sales order for two *Pallets* of a product "
"ships in one step, using the package type's route. A sales order for twelve "
"*Units* of the same product follows the warehouse's 3-step route."
msgstr ""
"Et lager anvender 3-trins leveringer. Emballagetypen *Pallet* har en rute, "
"der afsender direkte fra lageret. En salgsordre på to *Pallets* af et "
"produkt afsendes i ét trin ved hjælp af emballagetypens rute. En salgsordre "
"på tolv *Units* af det samme produkt følger lagerets 3-trinsrute."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:257
msgid "On products"
msgstr "På produkter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:259
msgid ""
"To assign routes directly to a product, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Products --> Products` and select the "
"product. On the product form, select the *Inventory* tab, then select one or "
"more :guilabel:`Routes` in the *Operations* section."
msgstr ""
"For at tildele ruter direkte til et produkt skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-appen --> Produkter --> Produkter` og vælge "
"produktet. Vælg fanen *Lager* på produktformularen, og vælg derefter en "
"eller flere :guilabel:`Ruter` i sektionen *Operationer*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:264
msgid ""
"To see which routes and rules apply to a product without modifying them, "
"click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`View Diagram` next to "
"the :guilabel:`Routes` field."
msgstr ""
"For at se, hvilke ruter og regler der gælder for et produkt uden at ændre "
"dem, skal du klikke på :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Vis diagram` ved "
"siden af feltet :guilabel:`Ruter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:267
msgid "Routes on a product form."
msgstr "Ruter på en produktformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:273
msgid "On product categories"
msgstr "På produktkategorier"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:275
msgid ""
"To assign routes to a product category, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Product Categories` "
"and select the product category. In the *Logistics* section, select one or "
"more :guilabel:`Routes`."
msgstr ""
"For at tildele ruter til en produktkategori skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Appen Lager --> Konfiguration --> Produktkategorier` og "
"vælge produktkategorien. I sektionen *Logistik* vælges en eller "
"flere :guilabel:`Ruter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:279
msgid "Routes on a product category form."
msgstr "Ruter på en produktkategoriformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:285
msgid "On package types"
msgstr "På emballagetyper"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:287
msgid ""
"To assign routes to a package type, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Configuration --> Package Types` and select the package type. On the "
"*Configuration* tab, select one or more :guilabel:`Routes`."
msgstr ""
"For at tildele ruter til en emballagetype skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Appen Lager --> Konfiguration --> Emballagetyper` og "
"vælge emballagetypen. Vælg en eller flere :guilabel:`Ruter` under fanen "
"*Konfiguration*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:291
msgid ""
"Any packagings configured with this package type also inherit its routes. "
"These :guilabel:`Packagings` can be selected in the *Sales* tab of a product "
"form. When this product appears on a sales or purchase order line, its "
"transfer flow follows the selected routes on the package type."
msgstr ""
"Enhver emballage, der er konfigureret med denne emballagetype, arver også "
"dens ruter. Disse :guilabel:`Emballager` kan vælges under fanen *Salg* på en "
"produktformular. Når dette produkt vises på en salgs- eller "
"indkøbsordrelinje, følger overførselsforløbet de valgte ruter på "
"emballagetypen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:296
msgid ""
"When this packaging is selected as the :guilabel:`Unit` on a sales or "
"purchase order line, the transfer follows the package type's routes."
msgstr ""
"Når denne emballage vælges som :guilabel:`Enhed` på en salgs- eller "
"indkøbsordrelinje, følger overførslen pakketypens ruter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:300
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Package Type` field on a packaging requires "
"the :guilabel:`Packages` and :guilabel:`Units of Measure & Packagings` "
"settings. Routes on package types require the :guilabel:`Multi-Step Routes` "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`Pakketype` på en emballage kræver "
"indstillingerne :guilabel:`Pakker` og :guilabel:`Måleenheder og emballager`. "
"Ruter på pakketyper kræver indstillingen :guilabel:`Flertrinsruter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:305
msgid ":doc:`../../product_management/configure/packaging`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../product_management/configure/packaging`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:310
msgid "On shipping methods"
msgstr "På leveringsmetoder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:312
msgid ""
"To assign routes to a shipping method, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Configuration --> Delivery Methods` and select the shipping method. "
"On the form, select one or more :guilabel:`Routes`."
msgstr ""
"For at tildele ruter til en leveringsmetode skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-appen --> Konfiguration --> Leveringsmetoder` og "
"vælge leveringsmetoden. På formularen vælges en eller "
"flere :guilabel:`Ruter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:316
msgid "Routes on a delivery method form."
msgstr "Ruter på en leveringsmetodeformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:320
msgid ":ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/shipping-route`"
msgstr ":ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/shipping-route`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:325
msgid "On sales order lines"
msgstr "På salgsordrelinjer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:327
msgid ""
"To assign routes to a sales order line, open the **Sales** app and select "
"the sales quotation. Existing lines are listed in the *Order Lines* tab. By "
"default, the route column is hidden. To enable it, click the :icon:`oi-"
"settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(Optional Columns)` icon, then "
"select :guilabel:`Routes`."
msgstr ""
"For at tildele ruter til en salgsordrelinje skal du åbne appen **Salg** og "
"vælge salgstilbuddet. Eksisterende linjer er angivet under fanen "
"*Ordrelinjer*. Som standard er rutekolonnen skjult. For at aktivere den skal "
"du klikke på ikonet :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(Valgfrie "
"kolonner)` og derefter vælge :guilabel:`Ruter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:332
msgid "In the newly-added column, select one or more routes on an order line."
msgstr ""
"Vælg en eller flere ruter på en ordrelinje i den nyligt tilføjede kolonne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:334
msgid "Routes on a sales order line."
msgstr "Ruter på en salgsordrelinje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:340
msgid "Advanced: managing routes"
msgstr "Avanceret: administration af ruter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:343
msgid ""
"The following section is intended for advanced users needing configurations "
"for custom flows. Standard 1-step, 2-step, and 3-step flows require no route "
"or rule changes."
msgstr ""
"Det følgende afsnit er beregnet til avancerede brugere, der har brug for "
"konfigurationer til tilpassede flows. Standard 1-trins-, 2-trins- og 3-"
"trinsflows kræver ingen rute- eller regelændringer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:346
msgid ""
"Access a dashboard of routes by navigating to :menuselection:`Inventory app "
"--> Configuration --> Routes`. This opens the *Routes* page, displaying a "
"list of all available routes across all warehouses."
msgstr ""
"Få adgang til et dashboard over ruter ved at navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-appen --> Konfiguration --> Ruter`. Dette åbner "
"siden *Ruter*, som viser en liste over alle tilgængelige ruter på tværs af "
"alle lagre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:351
msgid ""
"To access a specific warehouse's routes, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Warehouses`. Select "
"the warehouse, then click the :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Routes` smart "
"button."
msgstr ""
"For at få adgang til et specifikt lagers ruter skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-appen --> Konfiguration --> Lagre`. Vælg lageret, "
"og klik derefter på den intelligente knap :icon:`fa-"
"refresh` :guilabel:`Ruter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:355
msgid ""
"To view additional settings, click the desired route in the list. This opens "
"the route's form."
msgstr ""
"For at se yderligere indstillinger skal du klikke på den ønskede rute på "
"listen. Dette åbner rutens formular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:357
msgid "Route form in Odoo Inventory."
msgstr "Ruteformular i Odoo Lager."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:363
msgid "Define route visibility"
msgstr "Definer rutesynlighed"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:365
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Company` field allows users to restrict the route to specific "
"companies (if using a multi-company environment)."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`Virksomhed` gør det muligt for brugere at begrænse ruten "
"til specifikke virksomheder (hvis der anvendes et miljø med flere "
"virksomheder)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:368
msgid ""
"In the *Applicable On* section, specify any forms on which the route can be "
"made selectable via the following options:"
msgstr ""
"I sektionen *Gælder for* kan du angive de formularer, hvor ruten kan gøres "
"valgbar, via følgende muligheder:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:371
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Categories`: Allow routes to be selectable on a *Product "
"Categories* form. When configured with a route, every product in the "
"category inherits the route's rules."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produktkategorier`: Gør det muligt at vælge ruter på en formular "
"for *Produktkategorier*. Når den konfigureres med en rute, arver hvert "
"produkt i kategorien rutens regler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:373
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Products`: Allow routes to be selectable on a *Products* form. "
"The configured product inherits the route's rules."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produkter`: Gør det muligt at vælge ruter på en formular for "
"*Produkter*. Det konfigurerede produkt arver rutens regler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:375
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Type`: Allow routes to be selectable on a *Package Type* "
"form. All products configured with this packaging type inherit the route's "
"rules."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pakketype`: Gør det muligt at vælge ruter på en formular for "
"*Pakketype*. Alle produkter, der er konfigureret med denne emballagetype, "
"arver rutens regler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:377
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shipping Methods`: Allow routes to be selectable on a *Delivery "
"Methods* form. When applied on a carrier, all orders with the chosen "
"shipping method inherit the route's rules."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leveringsmetoder`: Gør det muligt at vælge ruter på en formular "
"for *Leveringsmetoder*. Når den anvendes på et fragtfirma, arver alle ordrer "
"med den valgte leveringsmetode rutens regler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:379
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Warehouses`: Select the warehouses for which this route should be "
"used as the default route."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lagre`: Vælg de lagre, som denne rute skal bruges til som "
"standardrute."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:381
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Order Lines`: Allow routes to be selectable on sales order "
"lines. When applied on individual sales order lines, the chosen routes "
"override the corresponding product's routes for the specific order **only**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salgsordrelinjer`: Gør det muligt at vælge ruter på "
"salgsordrelinjer. Når de anvendes på individuelle salgsordrelinjer, "
"tilsidesætter de valgte ruter det tilsvarende produkts ruter **udelukkende** "
"for den specifikke ordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:386
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Applying routes <inventory/routes/apply>` section to see how "
"routes are applied on these forms."
msgstr ""
"Se afsnittet :ref:`Anvendelse af ruter <inventory/routes/apply>` for at se, "
"hvordan ruter anvendes på disse formularer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:392
msgid "Viewing rules"
msgstr "Visning af regler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:394
msgid "The *Rules* section lists any rules defining the route."
msgstr "Sektionen *Regler* viser alle regler, der definerer ruten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:397
msgid ""
"Modifying Odoo's default rules may cause unexpected errors in the database "
"and is therefore **not** recommended."
msgstr ""
"Ændring af Odoos standardregler kan forårsage uventede fejl i databasen og "
"anbefales derfor **ikke**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:400
msgid ""
"Each rule has an :guilabel:`Action`, an :guilabel:`Operation Type`, "
"a :guilabel:`Source Location`, and a :guilabel:`Destination Location`."
msgstr ""
"Hver regel har en :guilabel:`Handling`, en :guilabel:`Operationstype`, "
"en :guilabel:`Kildelokation` og en :guilabel:`Destinationslokation`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:403
msgid "The following actions are defined in Odoo:"
msgstr "Følgende handlinger er defineret i Odoo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:405
msgid ""
"`Pull From`: When demand (e.g., from sales or manufacturing orders) appears "
"at the *Destination Location*, a picking of the specified *Operation Type* "
"is created from the *Source Location* to fulfill the demand."
msgstr ""
"`Pull From`: Når der opstår efterspørgsel (f.eks. fra salgs- eller "
"produktionsordrer) på *Destinationslokationen*, oprettes en plukning af den "
"angivne *Operationstype* fra *Kildelokationen* for at opfylde efterspørgslen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:408
msgid ""
"`Push To`: When products arrive at the *Source Location*, a picking of the "
"specified *Operation Type* is created to send them to the *Destination "
"Location*."
msgstr ""
"`Push To`: Når der ankommer produkter til *Kildelokationen*, oprettes en "
"plukning af den angivne *Operationstype* for at sende dem til "
"*Destinationslokationen*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:410
msgid ""
"`Pull & Push`: Create both a `Pull From` and `Push To` rule with the "
"selected *Operation Type*, *Source Location*, and *Destination Location*."
msgstr ""
"`Pull & Push`: Opret både en `Pull From`- og en `Push To`-regel med den "
"valgte *Operationstype*, *Kildelokation* og *Destinationslokation*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:412
msgid ""
"`Manufacture`: When products are needed at the *Destination Location*, a "
"manufacturing order (MO) is created to fulfill the demand, taking any "
"required components from the *Source Location*."
msgstr ""
"`Manufacture`: Når der er behov for produkter på *Destinationslokationen*, "
"oprettes en produktionsordre (MO) for at dække efterspørgslen, hvor "
"eventuelle nødvendige komponenter tages fra *Kildelokationen*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:414
msgid ""
"`Buy`: When products are needed at the *Destination Location*, a request for "
"quotation (RfQ) is created to fulfill the need."
msgstr ""
"`Buy`: Når der er behov for produkter på *Destinationslokationen*, oprettes "
"en tilbudsanmodning (RFQ) for at dække behovet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:418
msgid ""
"The `Buy` action is only available with the **Purchase** app installed, and "
"`Manufacture` with the **Manufacturing** app."
msgstr ""
"Handlingen `Buy` er kun tilgængelig, hvis appen **Indkøb** er installeret, "
"og `Manufacture` med appen **Produktion**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:422
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:160
msgid ":doc:`../../warehouses_storage/inventory_management/operation_type`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../warehouses_storage/inventory_management/operation_type`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:3
msgid "Batch picking"
msgstr "Batchplukning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:7
msgid ""
"*Batch picking* enables a single picker to handle multiple orders at once, "
"reducing the number of times needed to navigate to a warehouse location. "
"When picking in batches, orders are grouped and consolidated into a picking "
"list. After the picking, the batch is taken to an output location, where the "
"products are sorted into their respective delivery packages."
msgstr ""
"*Batchplukning* gør det muligt for en enkelt plukkere at håndtere flere "
"ordrer på én gang, hvilket reducerer antallet af gange, det er nødvendigt at "
"navigere til en lagerplacering. Ved plukning i batches grupperes ordrer og "
"konsolideres til en plukningsliste. Efter plukningen bringes batchen til en "
"udgangslokation, hvor produkterne sorteres i deres respektive "
"leveringspakker."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:12
msgid ""
"Since orders *must* be sorted at the output location after being picked, "
"this picking method suits businesses with a few products that are ordered "
"often. Storing high-demand items in easily accessible locations can increase "
"the number of orders that are fulfilled efficiently."
msgstr ""
"Da ordrer *skal* sorteres på udgangslokationen efter at være plukket, passer "
"denne plukningsmetode til virksomheder med få produkter, der ofte bestilles. "
"Opbevaring af efterspurgte varer på let tilgængelige placeringer kan øge "
"antallet af ordrer, der opfyldes effektivt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:16
msgid ""
"Batch picking is ideal for industries or warehouses that handle high order "
"volumes with a stable demand. This method increases efficiency by allowing "
"workers to pick items for multiple orders in one trip through the warehouse, "
"reducing travel time and boosting productivity."
msgstr ""
"Batchplukning er ideel for brancher eller lagre, der håndterer høje "
"ordrevolumener med en stabil efterspørgsel. Denne metode øger effektiviteten "
"ved at give medarbejdere mulighed for at plukke varer til flere ordrer i én "
"tur gennem lageret, hvilket reducerer rejsetid og øger produktiviteten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:23
msgid ""
"To activate the batch picking option, begin by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Operations` section, check the :guilabel:`Batch, Wave & "
"Cluster Transfers` box."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere batchplukningsindstillingen skal du starte med at gå "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`. Under "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Operationer` skal du markere feltet :guilabel:`Batch-, "
"bølge- og klyngeoverførsler`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:27
msgid "Enable the batch transfers in Inventory Settings."
msgstr "Aktivér batchoverførsler i Lagerindstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:30
msgid ""
"Since batch picking is a method to optimize the *pick* operation in Odoo, "
"the :guilabel:`Storage Locations` and :guilabel:`Multi-Step Routes` options "
"under the :guilabel:`Warehouse` heading must also be checked on this "
"settings page. When finished, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Da batchplukning er en metode til at optimere *pluk*-operationen i Odoo, "
"skal indstillingerne :guilabel:`Lagerplaceringer` "
"og :guilabel:`Flertrinruter` under overskriften :guilabel:`Lager` også være "
"markeret på denne indstillingsside. Når du er færdig, skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Gem`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:34
msgid ""
"Enable Storage Locations and Multi-Step Routes in the Inventory Settings."
msgstr "Aktivér Lagersteder og Flertrinsruter i lagerindstillingerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/batch.rst:38
