msgstr ""
"Registrer dette i Odoo ved hjælp af feltet :guilabel:`Destinationspakke` i "
"fanen :guilabel:`Detaljerede operationer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods/cluster.rst:166
