"ønskede produktkategori. Angiv derefter :guilabel:`First Expiry First Out "
"(FEFO)` i feltet :guilabel:`Gennemtving fjernelsesstrategi`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:86
