"Før denne dato angives, skal det sikres, at feltet :guilabel:`Sporing` er "
"indstillet til :guilabel:`Efter partier` eller :guilabel:`Efter unikt "
"serienummer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fefo.rst:102
msgid ""
"Set this number of days by navigating to the product "
"form's :guilabel:`Inventory` tab. Next, select the :guilabel:`Expiration "
"Date` option, which makes the :guilabel:`Removal Date` field (and other date "
"fields) appear."
msgstr ""
