#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:3
msgid "FIFO removal"
msgstr "Vyskladnění FIFO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *First In, First Out* (FIFO) removal strategy selects products with the "
"earliest arrival dates. This method is useful for companies selling products "
"that have short demand cycles, like clothes. By using :abbr:`FIFO (First In, "
"First Out)`, companies can prevent prolonged stock retention of specific "
"styles."
msgstr ""
"*First In, First Out* (FIFO) fjernelsesstrategien vælger produkter med de "
"tidligste ankomstdatoer. Denne metode er nyttig for virksomheder, der sælger "
"produkter med korte efterspørgselscyklusser, som tøj. Ved at "
"bruge :abbr:`FIFO (First In, First Out)` kan virksomheder forhindre "
"langvarig lagerføring af specifikke stilarter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:11
msgid ""
"Different shipments of t-shirts, tracked by lot numbers, arrive in a "
"business's warehouse between August 1st and August 25th. When a customer "
"makes an order on September 1st, the :abbr:`FIFO (First In, First Out)` "
"removal strategy prioritizes lots that have been in stock the longest. So, "
"products received on August 1st are selected first for picking."
msgstr ""
"Forskellige forsendelser af t-shirts, sporet ved lotnumre, ankommer til en "
"virksomheds lager mellem 1. august og 25. august. Når en kunde afgiver en "
"ordre den 1. september, prioriterer :abbr:`FIFO (First In, First Out)` "
"fjernelsesstrategien lots, der har været på lager længst. Så produkter "
"modtaget den 1. august vælges først til plukning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:16
msgid "Illustration of FIFO selecting the oldest products in stock."
msgstr "Illustration af FIFO, der vælger de ældste produkter på lager."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:22
msgid "Enabling the FIFO removal strategy"
msgstr "Aktivering af FIFO fjernelsesstrategien"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:24
msgid ""
"Lots and serial numbers differentiate identical products and track "
"information like arrival or expiration dates. To enable this feature, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Traceability` section, check the box beside :guilabel:`Lots & "
"Serial Numbers`."
msgstr ""
"Lot- og serienumre adskiller identiske produkter og sporer information som "
"ankomst- eller udløbsdatoer. For at aktivere denne funktion skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`. Under "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`Sporbarhed` skal du markere boksen ved siden "
"af :guilabel:`Lots og serienumre`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/removal_strategies/fifo.rst:32
msgid ""
"Next, ensure the intended product is tracked by lots or serial numbers by "
"navigating to the product form through :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Products --> Products` and selecting the desired product. On the product "
"form, open the :guilabel:`General Information` tab. In "
"the :guilabel:`Tracking` field, select either :guilabel:`By Unique Serial "
"Number` or :guilabel:`By Lots`."
msgstr ""
"Sørg derefter for, at det ønskede produkt spores via partier eller "
"serienumre ved at navigere til produktformularen via :menuselection:`Lager --"
"> Produkter --> Produkter` og vælge det ønskede produkt. På "
"produktformularen åbnes fanen :guilabel:`Generelle oplysninger`. I "
"feltet :guilabel:`Sporing` vælges enten :guilabel:`Efter unikt serienummer` "
"eller :guilabel:`Efter partier`."

