msgid ":doc:`ups_credentials`"
msgstr ":doc:`ups_credentials`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:26
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:25
msgid "Account setup"
msgstr "Kontoopsætning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:25
msgid ""
"To begin, go to the `Bpost website <https://parcel.bpost.be/en/home/"
"business>`_ to create, or log into, the company's Bpost business account. "
"When creating the Bpost account, have the company's VAT number and mobile "
"phone number ready."
msgstr ""
"For at begynde skal du gå til `Bpost-hjemmesiden <https://parcel.bpost.be/en/"
"home/business>`_ for at oprette eller logge ind på virksomhedens Bpost-"
"erhvervskonto. Når du opretter Bpost-kontoen, skal du have virksomhedens "
"momsnummer og mobiltelefonnummer klar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:29
msgid ""
"Follow the website's steps to complete registration, and sign up for "
"shipping services. Doing so submits a request to enter a contractual "
"business relationship between the company and Bpost."
msgstr ""
"Følg hjemmesidens trin for at gennemføre registreringen og tilmelde dig "
"forsendelsestjenester. Dette indsender en anmodning om at indgå et "
"kontraktligt forretningsforhold mellem virksomheden og Bpost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:33
msgid ""
"Odoo **cannot** be integrated with `non-business Bpost <https://www.odoo.com/"
"r/Z4wZ>`_ accounts."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **kan ikke** integreres med `ikke-erhvervs Bpost <https://www.odoo.com/"
"r/Z4wZ>`_-konti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:35
msgid ""
"After completing the setup, get the Bpost account ID and passphrase, by "
"navigating to the :guilabel:`Shipping Manager` menu item."
msgstr ""
"Efter gennemførelse af opsætningen skal du hente Bpost-konto-id'et og "
"adgangskoden ved at navigere til menupunktet :guilabel:`Shipping Manager`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:40
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Shipping Manager` page, go to the :guilabel:`Admin` tab, "
"then the :guilabel:`General Settings` tab, to find the :guilabel:`Account "
"ID` and :guilabel:`Passphrase` needed to configure Odoo's shipping method."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Shipping Manager` skal du gå til fanen :guilabel:`Admin` "
"og derefter fanen :guilabel:`General Settings` for at "
"finde :guilabel:`Account ID` og :guilabel:`Passphrase`, der er nødvendige "
"for at konfigurere Odoos forsendelsesmetode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:44
msgid "In the *Admin* tab, show the Account ID and Passphrase."
msgstr "I fanen *Admin* skal du vise konto-id og adgangskode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:50
msgid "Shipping method configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration af forsendelsesmetode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:52
msgid ""
"With those necessary credentials, configure the Bpost shipping method in "
"Odoo by going to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Shipping Methods`."
msgstr ""
"Med disse nødvendige legitimationsoplysninger kan du konfigurere Bpost-"
"forsendelsesmetoden i Odoo ved at gå til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> "
"Konfiguration --> Forsendelsesmetoder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:55
msgid "On the :guilabel:`Shipping Methods` page, click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Forsendelsesmetoder` skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Opret`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:57
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Provider` field, select :guilabel:`Bpost` from the drop-"
"down menu. Doing so reveals the :guilabel:`Bpost Configuration` tab at the "
"bottom of the form, where the Bpost credentials can be entered."
msgstr ""
"I feltet :guilabel:`Udbyder` skal du vælge :guilabel:`Bpost` fra "
"rullemenuen. Dette viser fanen :guilabel:`Bpost-konfiguration` nederst i "
"formularen, hvor Bpost-legitimationsoplysningerne kan indtastes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:61
msgid ""
"For details on configuring the other fields on the shipping method, such "
"as :guilabel:`Delivery Product`, refer to the :doc:`Configure third-party "
"carrier <third_party_shipper>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"For detaljer om konfiguration af de andre felter i forsendelsesmetoden, "
"såsom :guilabel:`Leveringsprodukt`, se dokumentationen :doc:`Konfigurer "
"tredjepartsfragtmand <third_party_shipper>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:65
msgid ""
"To generate Bpost :doc:`shipping labels <labels>` through Odoo, ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Integration Level` option is set to :guilabel:`Get Rate and "
"Create Shipment`."
msgstr ""
"For at generere Bpost :doc:`forsendelsesetiketter <labels>` gennem Odoo skal "
"du sikre dig, at indstillingen :guilabel:`Integrationsniveau` er sat "
"til :guilabel:`Hent pris og opret forsendelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:68
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Bpost Configuration` tab, complete the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"I fanen :guilabel:`Bpost-konfiguration` skal du udfylde følgende felter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bpost Account Number` (required field): enter the company's "
"unique :ref:`account ID <inventory/shipping_receiving/bpost-account>` from "
"the Bpost website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bpost-kontonummer` (obligatorisk felt): indtast virksomhedens "
"unikke :ref:`konto-id <inventory/shipping_receiving/bpost-account>` fra "
"Bpost-hjemmesiden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Passphrase` (required field): enter the :ref:`passphrase "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/bpost-account>` from the Bpost website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Adgangskode` (obligatorisk felt): indtast :ref:`adgangskoden "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/bpost-account>` fra Bpost-hjemmesiden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/bpost.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bpost Delivery Nature`: select either :guilabel:`Domestic` "
"or :guilabel:`International` shipping services. "
"Choosing :guilabel:`Domestic` shows the :guilabel:`Options` section, "
"while :guilabel:`International` enables the :guilabel:`Bpost Shipment Type` "
"and :guilabel:`Bpost Parcel Return Instructions` fields."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bpost-leveringstype`: vælg enten :guilabel:`Indenlandsk` "
"eller :guilabel:`International` forsendelseservice. Valg "
"af :guilabel:`Indenlandsk` viser afsnittet :guilabel:`Indstillinger`, "
"mens :guilabel:`International` aktiverer felterne :guilabel:`Bpost-"
