msgid ""
"To enable DHL delivery methods, :ref:`install <general/install>` the **DHL "
"Express Shipping** module. DHL delivery methods can be configured and added "
"as a line item to sales orders, which allows for automatic computation of "
"shipping rates and generation of shipping labels."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere DHL leveringsmetoder skal du :ref:`installere <general/"
"install>` modulet **DHL ekspres fragt**. DHL leveringsmetoder kan "
"konfigureres og tilføjes som en linjepost til salgsordrer, hvilket muliggør "
"automatisk beregning af forsendelsessatser og generering af "
"forsendelsesetiketter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:19
msgid ""
"To create a DHL shipping method, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --"
"> Configuration --> Delivery Methods`, then click :guilabel:`New` to open a "
"delivery method form. If a shipping method has already been created, it can "
"be selected from this screen."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en DHL forsendelsesmetode skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Konfiguration --> Leveringsmetoder`, og "
"derefter klikke :guilabel:`Ny` for at åbne en leveringsmetodeformular. Hvis "
"en forsendelsesmetode allerede er oprettet, kan den vælges fra denne skærm."

