"Til sammenligning er her et eksempel på en FedEx-etiket til nederste halvdel:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/label_type.rst:71
msgid "Half page letter size FedEx shipping label."
msgstr "Halvsidet FedEx-fragtetiket i brevstørrelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:3
msgid "Print shipping labels"
msgstr "Udskriv fragtlabels"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:8
msgid ""
"Integrate Odoo with :doc:`third-party shipping carriers <../"
"setup_configuration/third_party_shipper>` to automatically generate shipping "
"labels that includes prices, destination addresses, tracking numbers, and "
"barcodes."
msgstr ""
"Integrer Odoo med :doc:`tredjepartsfragtfirmaer <../setup_configuration/"
"third_party_shipper>` for automatisk at generere fragtlabels, der inkluderer "
"priser, destinationsadresser, sporingsnumre og stregkoder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:13
msgid ""
":ref:`Automatically print shipping carrier labels <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/carrier-labels>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Udskriv automatisk fragtlabels fra fragtfirmaer <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/carrier-labels>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:18
msgid ""
"To generate labels for a third-party shipping carrier, first :doc:`install "
"the third-party shipping connector <../setup_configuration/"
"third_party_shipper>`. Then, configure and activate the :ref:`delivery "
"method <inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-delivery-method>`, being sure "
"to set the :guilabel:`Integration Level` to :guilabel:`Get Rate and Create "
"Shipment` to generate shipping labels. Finally, provide the "
"company's :ref:`source address <inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-"
"source-address>` and :ref:`product weights <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"configure-weight>`."
msgstr ""
"For at generere etiketter til et tredjepartsfragtfirma skal du "
"først :doc:`installere tredjepartsforsendelseskonnektoren <../"
"setup_configuration/third_party_shipper>`. Konfigurer og aktiver "
"derefter :ref:`leveringsmetoden <inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-"
"delivery-method>`, og sørg for at indstille :guilabel:`Integrationsniveau` "
"til :guilabel:`Hent pris og opret forsendelse` for at generere fragtlabels. "
"Angiv til sidst virksomhedens :ref:`kildeadresse <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-source-address>` og :ref:`produktvægte "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-weight>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:29
msgid "Set the \"Get Rate and Create Shipment\" option."
msgstr "Indstil muligheden \"Hent pris og opret forsendelse\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:36
msgid "Labels for multi-step"
msgstr "Etiketter til flertrinslevering"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:38
msgid ""
"For companies using :doc:`two <../daily_operations/"
"receipts_delivery_two_steps>` or :doc:`three step delivery <../"
"daily_operations/delivery_three_steps>`, labels can be triggered to print "
"after validating the picking or packing operation. To do that, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Operations Types`, "
"and choose the desired operation."
msgstr ""
"For virksomheder, der bruger :doc:`to <../daily_operations/"
"receipts_delivery_two_steps>` eller :doc:`tretrinslevering <../"
"daily_operations/delivery_three_steps>`, kan etiketter udløses til at blive "
"printet efter validering af pluknings- eller pakkeoperationen. For at gøre "
"dette skal du gå til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Konfiguration --> "
"Operationstyper` og vælge den ønskede operation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:43
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Operation Type` configuration page, tick "
"the :guilabel:`Print Label` checkbox. Enabling this feature ensures that the "
"third-party shipping label is printed upon validating this operation."
msgstr ""
"På konfigurationssiden for :guilabel:`Operationstype` skal du markere "
"afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Udskriv etiket`. Aktivering af denne funktion "
"sikrer, at tredjepartsfragtetiketten udskrives ved validering af denne "
"operation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:48
msgid ""
"For :doc:`two-step delivery <../daily_operations/"
"receipts_delivery_two_steps>`, where products are placed directly in "
"packages during picking, companies can print shipping labels during picking "
"instead of delivery. Odoo allows users to enable the :guilabel:`Print Label` "
"feature on the `Pick` operation itself to achieve this flexibility."
msgstr ""
"For :doc:`totrinlevering <../daily_operations/receipts_delivery_two_steps>`, "
"hvor produkter placeres direkte i pakker under plukning, kan virksomheder "
"udskrive fragtetiketter under plukning i stedet for levering. Odoo giver "
"brugere mulighed for at aktivere funktionen :guilabel:`Udskriv etiket` på "
"selve `Pick`-operationen for at opnå denne fleksibilitet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:53
msgid "Enable the \"Print Label\" feature."
msgstr "Aktivér funktionen \"Udskriv etiket\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:58
msgid "Print tracking labels"
msgstr "Udskriv sporingsetiketter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:60
msgid ""
"Tracking labels are printed when specific operations are validated. By "
"default, validating a delivery order (DO) generates a tracking label in the "
"chatter."
msgstr ""
"Sporingsetiketter udskrives, når specifikke operationer valideres. Som "
"standard genererer validering af en leveringsordre (DO) en sporingsetiket i "
"beskeder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:64
msgid ""
"For companies using two or three step delivery, refer to the :ref:`printing "
"labels for multi-step delivery <inventory/shipping_receiving/picking-"
"config>` section to learn how to print the label after validating a picking "
"or packing operation."
msgstr ""
"For virksomheder, der bruger to- eller tretrinsleveringer, se "
"afsnittet :ref:`udskrivning af etiketter til flertrinslevering <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/picking-config>` for at lære, hvordan etiketten udskrives "
"efter validering af en pluknings- eller pakkeoperation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:68
msgid ""
"When both the *Sales* and *Inventory* apps are installed, begin in "
"the :menuselection:`Sales` app, and proceed to the desired quotation or "
"sales order (SO). There, and :ref:`add the shipping cost <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/add-shipping-quote>` to the order. Then, navigate to the "
"linked |DO| — or another operation type when using multi-step delivery — to "
"validate the operation and print the label."
msgstr ""
"Når både *Salg*- og *Lager*-appene er installeret, skal du starte "
"i :menuselection:`Salg`-appen og gå til det ønskede tilbud eller salgsordre "
"(SO). Der skal du :ref:`tilføje fragtomkostningen <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/add-shipping-quote>` til ordren. Gå derefter til den "
"tilknyttede |DO| — eller en anden operationstype ved brug af "
"flertrinslevering — for at validere operationen og udskrive etiketten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:74
msgid ""
"If only the *Inventory* app is installed, create :abbr:`DOs (Delivery "
"Orders)` directly in the :menuselection:`Inventory` app, :ref:`add the third-"
"party carrier <inventory/shipping_receiving/validate-print-label>` in "
"the :guilabel:`Carrier` field, and validate the |DO|."
msgstr ""
"Hvis kun *Lager*-appen er installeret, skal du "
"oprette :abbr:`leveringsordrer (Delivery Orders)` direkte "
"i :menuselection:`Lager`-appen, :ref:`tilføje tredjepartsfragtmanden "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/validate-print-label>` i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Fragtmand` og validere |DO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:82
msgid "Add shipping on quotation"
msgstr "Tilføj fragt på tilbud"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:84
msgid ""
"To generate a tracking label for an order, begin by creating a quotation "
"in :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations`, "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`, and filling out the quotation form. Then, click "
"the :guilabel:`Add Shipping` button in the bottom-right corner of the "
"quotation."
msgstr ""
"For at generere en sporingsetiket til en ordre skal du starte med at oprette "
"et tilbud i :menuselection:`Salg-app --> Ordrer --> Tilbud`, klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Ny` og udfylde tilbudsformularen. Klik derefter på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Tilføj fragt` i nederste højre hjørne af tilbuddet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:88
msgid "Show the \"Add Shipping\" button on the quotation."
msgstr "Vis knappen \"Tilføj fragt\" på tilbuddet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:92
msgid ""
"In the resulting pop-up window, select the intended carrier from "
"the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` drop-down menu. The :guilabel:`Total Order "
"Weight` field is automatically populated, based on the :ref:`weight of "
"products in the order <inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-weight>`. "
"Modify this field to overwrite the predicted weight, and use this weight to "
"estimate the cost of shipping."
msgstr ""
"I det resulterende pop op-vindue skal du vælge den ønskede fragtmand fra "
"rullemenuen :guilabel:`Fragtmetode`. Feltet :guilabel:`Samlet ordrevægt` "
"udfyldes automatisk baseret på :ref:`vægten af produkter i ordren <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-weight>`. Redigér dette felt for at overskrive "
"den forudsagte vægt og brug denne vægt til at estimere fragtomkostningen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:97
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Get Rate` to display the shipping cost for the "
"customer, via the third-party carrier in the :guilabel:`Cost` field."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Få pris` for at vise fragtomkostningen for "
"kunden via tredjepartsfragtmanden i feltet :guilabel:`Omkostning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:101
msgid ""
"If clicking :guilabel:`Get Rate` results in an error, ensure "
"the :ref:`warehouse's address <inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-source-"
"address>` and :ref:`weight of products in the order <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-weight>` are properly configured."
msgstr ""
"Hvis klik på :guilabel:`Få pris` resulterer i en fejl, skal du sikre, "
"at :ref:`lagerets adresse <inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-source-"
"address>` og :ref:`vægten af produkter i ordren <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-weight>` er korrekt konfigureret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:105
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add` to add the cost to the quotation, which is listed as "
"the :ref:`configured delivery product <inventory/shipping_receiving/delivery-"
"product>`. Finally, click :guilabel:`Confirm` on the quotation, and click "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button to access the |DO|."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Tilføj` for at tilføje omkostningen til tilbuddet, som er "
"anført som det :ref:`konfigurerede leveringsprodukt <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/delivery-product>`. Klik til sidst på :guilabel:`Bekræft` "
"på tilbuddet, og klik på smart-knappen :guilabel:`Levering` for at få adgang "
"til |DO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:110
msgid "Show \"Get rate\" pop-up window."
msgstr "Vis pop op-vinduet \"Få pris\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:115
msgid ""
"For users who do not have the *Sales* app installed, specify "
"the :guilabel:`Carrier` by going to the :menuselection:`Inventory` app, "
"navigating to the |DO|, and going to the :guilabel:`Additional Info` tab."
msgstr ""
"For brugere, der ikke har *Salg*-appen installeret, skal du "
"angive :guilabel:`Fragtmand` ved at gå til :menuselection:`Lager`-appen, "
"navigere til |DO| og gå til fanen :guilabel:`Yderligere info`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:119
msgid "Show the \"Additional Info\" tab of a delivery order."
msgstr "Vis fanen \"Yderligere info\" på en leveringsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:126
msgid "Validate delivery order"
msgstr "Valider leveringsordre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:128
msgid ""
"On a delivery order form, navigate to the :guilabel:`Additional Info` tab to "
"ensure the third-party shipping carrier has been added to "
"the :guilabel:`Carrier` field."
msgstr ""
"På en leveringsordreformular skal du navigere til "
"fanen :guilabel:`Yderligere info` for at sikre, at tredjepartsfragtfirmaet "
"er blevet tilføjet til feltet :guilabel:`Fragtfirma`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:132
msgid ""
"If the *Sales* app is not installed, the third-party carrier is set in "
"the :guilabel:`Carrier` field."
msgstr ""
"Hvis appen *Salg* ikke er installeret, angives tredjepartsfragtfirmaet i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Fragtfirma`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:135
msgid ""
"After the items in the order have been packed, click :guilabel:`Validate` to "
"get the shipping carrier's tracking number, and generate the shipping label."
msgstr ""
"Efter varerne i ordren er pakket, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Valider` for "
"at få fragtfirmaets sporingsnummer og generere fragtlabelen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:139
msgid ""
"Create or select an existing delivery order by going to "
"the :menuselection:`Inventory` app, and selecting the :guilabel:`Delivery "
"Orders` card."
msgstr ""
"Opret eller vælg en eksisterende leveringsordre ved at gå til "
"appen :menuselection:`Lager` og vælge kortet :guilabel:`Leveringsordrer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:142
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tracking Reference` number is generated in "
"the :guilabel:`Additional Info` tab of the delivery order. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Tracking` smart button to access the tracking link from the "
"shipping carrier's website."
msgstr ""
"Nummeret :guilabel:`Sporingsreference` genereres i "
"fanen :guilabel:`Yderligere info` på leveringsordren. Klik på smart-"
"knappen :guilabel:`Sporing` for at få adgang til sporingslinket fra "
"fragtfirmaets hjemmeside."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:146
msgid "The tracking label is found in PDF format in the chatter."
msgstr "Sporingslabelen findes i PDF-format i chatten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:148
msgid "Show generated shipping label in the chatter."
msgstr "Vis genereret fragtlabel i chatten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:153
msgid ""
"For multi-package shipping, one label is generated per package. Each label "
"appears in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"Ved forsendelse med flere pakker genereres én label pr. pakke. Hver label "
"vises i chatten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:156
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/labels.rst:160
msgid "Sample label generated from Odoo's shipping connector with FedEx."
msgstr "Eksempel på label genereret fra Odoos fragtconnector med FedEx."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:3
msgid "Multi-package shipments"
msgstr "Forsendelser med flere pakker"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:5
msgid ""
"In some cases, a delivery order with multiple items may need to be shipped "
"in more than one package. This may be necessary if the items are too large "
"to ship in a single package, or if certain items cannot be packaged "
"together. Shipping a single delivery order in multiple packages provides "
"flexibility for how each item is packaged, without the need to create "
"multiple delivery orders."
msgstr ""
"I nogle tilfælde kan en leveringsordre med flere varer skulle sendes i mere "
"end én pakke. Dette kan være nødvendigt, hvis varerne er for store til at "
"sende i en enkelt pakke, eller hvis visse varer ikke kan pakkes sammen. "
"Afsendelse af en enkelt leveringsordre i flere pakker giver fleksibilitet "
"med hensyn til, hvordan hver vare pakkes, uden behov for at oprette flere "
"leveringsordrer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:13
msgid ""
"To split a delivery order across multiple packages, the *Packages* setting "
"must be enabled. To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, then in the *Operations* section, select "
"the :guilabel:`Packages` checkbox. Click :guilabel:`Save` to confirm the "
"change."
msgstr ""
"For at opdele en leveringsordre på tværs af flere pakker skal indstillingen "
"*Pakker* være aktiveret. For at gøre dette skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`, derefter i "
"sektionen *Operationer* skal du markere "
"afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Pakker`. Klik på :guilabel:`Gem` for at "
"bekræfte ændringen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:17
msgid "The Packages setting on the Inventory app settings page."
msgstr "Indstillingen Pakker på indstillingssiden for appen Lager."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:23
msgid "Ship items in multiple packages"
msgstr "Send varer i flere pakker"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:25
msgid ""
"To split items in the same delivery order across multiple packages, begin by "
"navigating to the :menuselection:`Inventory` app. On the *Inventory "
"Overview* page, click the :guilabel:`# to Deliver` button on the *Delivery "
"Orders* card. Finally, select a delivery order that has multiple items, "
"multiple quantities of the same item, or both."
msgstr ""
"For at opdele varer i den samme leveringsordre på tværs af flere pakker skal "
"du først navigere til appen :menuselection:`Lager`. På siden *Lageroversigt* "
"skal du klikke på knappen :guilabel:`# at levere` på kortet "
"*Leveringsordrer*. Vælg endelig en leveringsordre, der har flere varer, "
"flere mængder af den samme vare eller begge dele."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:30
msgid ""
"On the *Operations* tab, select the :guilabel:`Details` link for the product "
"that will be shipped in the first package."
msgstr ""
"På fanen *Operations* skal du vælge linket :guilabel:`Details` for det "
"produkt, der skal sendes i den første pakke."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:33
msgid "The Details link for a product in a delivery order."
msgstr "Linket Details for et produkt i en leveringsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:36
msgid ""
"This opens the *Detailed Operations* pop-up window. In the table of the pop-"
"up window, the :guilabel:`Quantity` column shows the total quantity of the "
"product included in the delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Dette åbner pop op-vinduet *Detailed Operations*. I tabellen i pop op-"
"vinduet viser kolonnen :guilabel:`Quantity` den samlede mængde af produktet "
"inkluderet i leveringsordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:39
msgid ""
"If the full quantity will be shipped in the first package, enter "
"the :guilabel:`Demand` quantity in the :guilabel:`Quantity` column. If less "
"than the full quantity will be shipped in the first package, enter a smaller "
"value than the :guilabel:`Demand` quantity. Then specify "
"a :guilabel:`Destination Package` for the product."
msgstr ""
"Hvis den fulde mængde skal sendes i den første pakke, skal du indtaste "
"mængden :guilabel:`Demand` i kolonnen :guilabel:`Quantity`. Hvis mindre end "
"den fulde mængde skal sendes i den første pakke, skal du indtaste en mindre "
"værdi end mængden :guilabel:`Demand`. Angiv derefter "
"en :guilabel:`Destination Package` for produktet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:44
msgid "The Detailed Operations pop-up for a product in a delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Pop op-vinduet Detaljerede operationer for et produkt i en leveringsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:47
msgid ""
"If the product is to be split into multiple packages, click "
"the :guilabel:`Add a line` link and split the :guilabel:`Quantity` between "
"the different :guilabel:`Destination Package` options that are created."
msgstr ""
"Hvis produktet skal opdeles i flere pakker, skal du klikke på "
"linket :guilabel:`Add a line` og opdele :guilabel:`Quantity` mellem de "
"forskellige :guilabel:`Destination Package`-muligheder, der oprettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:51
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save` to confirm the packages and close the pop-up."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Save` for at bekræfte pakkerne og lukke pop op-vinduet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:53
msgid ""
"If packaging multiple products into the same package, repeat the same steps "
"for every product in the package. Be sure to specify the "
"same :guilabel:`Destination Package` in the *Detailed Operations* window."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du pakker flere produkter i samme pakke, skal du gentage de samme trin "
"for hvert produkt i pakken. Sørg for at angive den "
"samme :guilabel:`Destination Package` i vinduet *Detailed Operations*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:57
msgid ""
"For the next package, follow the same steps outlined above, marking "
"the :guilabel:`Quantity` and :guilabel:`Destination Package` for each item "
"to be included. Continue doing so until the full quantity of all products "
"has been added to packages."
msgstr ""
"For den næste pakke skal du følge de samme trin, der er beskrevet ovenfor, "
"og markere :guilabel:`Quantity` og :guilabel:`Destination Package` for hvert "
"produkt, der skal inkluderes. Fortsæt med at gøre det, indtil den fulde "
"mængde af alle produkter er blevet tilføjet til pakker."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:61
msgid ""
"Finally, after all packages have been shipped, click :guilabel:`Validate` to "
"confirm that the delivery order is complete."
msgstr ""
"Til sidst, efter alle pakker er blevet sendt, skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Validate` for at bekræfte, at leveringsordren er fuldført."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:65
msgid ""
"After one or more packages are created, a :icon:`fa-"
"cubes` :guilabel:`Packages` smart button appears above the delivery order. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`Packages` smart button to open the "
"*Packages* page for the delivery order, where each package can be selected "
"to view all its items."
msgstr ""
"Når en eller flere pakker er oprettet, vises en smart-knap :icon:`fa-"
"cubes` :guilabel:`Packages` over leveringsordren. Klik på smart-"
"knappen :icon:`fa-cubes` :guilabel:`Packages` for at åbne siden *Packages* "
"for leveringsordren, hvor hver pakke kan vælges for at se alle dens varer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:70
msgid "The Packages smart button on a delivery order."
msgstr "Smart-knappen Pakker på en leveringsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:76
msgid "Create a backorder for items to be shipped later"
msgstr "Opret en restordre for varer, der skal sendes senere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:78
msgid ""
"If some items will be shipped at a later date than others, there is no need "
"to put them in a package until they are ready to ship. Instead, create a "
"backorder for the items being shipped later."
msgstr ""
"Hvis nogle varer skal sendes på en senere dato end andre, er der ikke behov "
"for at lægge dem i en pakke, før de er klar til at blive sendt. Opret i "
"stedet en restordre for de varer, der sendes senere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:81
msgid ""
"Begin by shipping the items that will be shipped immediately. If they will "
"be shipped in multiple packages, follow the steps in :ref:`inventory/"
"shipping/multiple-packages` to package them as required. If they will be "
"shipped in a single package, mark the :guilabel:`Quantity` "
"and :guilabel:`Destination Package` for all of the products in that shipment."
msgstr ""
"Begynd med at sende de varer, der skal sendes med det samme. Hvis de skal "
"sendes i flere pakker, skal du følge trinene i :ref:`inventory/shipping/"
"multiple-packages` for at pakke dem efter behov. Hvis de skal sendes i en "
"enkelt pakke, skal du markere :guilabel:`Quantity` og :guilabel:`Destination "
"Package` for alle produkterne i den forsendelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:86
msgid ""
"After all quantities being shipped immediately are packaged, return to the "
"delivery order form. Change the :guilabel:`Quantity` for the backordered "
"items to `0` or the partial quantity that is being shipped. Then, click "
"the :guilabel:`Validate` button, and a *Create Backorder?* pop-up window "
"appears. Click the :guilabel:`Create Backorder` button. Doing so immediately "
"confirms the items being shipped and creates a new delivery order for the "
"items that will be shipped later."
msgstr ""
"Når alle mængder, der sendes med det samme, er pakket, skal du vende tilbage "
"til leveringsordreformularen. Ændre :guilabel:`Quantity` for de "
"restordrevarer til `0` eller den delvise mængde, der sendes. Klik derefter "
"på knappen :guilabel:`Validate`, og et pop op-vindue *Create Backorder?* "
"vises. Klik på knappen :guilabel:`Create Backorder`. Dette bekræfter straks "
"de varer, der sendes, og opretter en ny leveringsordre for de varer, der "
"skal sendes senere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:92
msgid "The Create Backorder pop-up window."
msgstr "Pop op-vinduet Create Backorder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:95
msgid ""
"The backorder delivery order will be listed in the chatter of the original "
"delivery order in a message that reads :guilabel:`The backorder WH/OUT/XXXXX "
"has been created`. Click on :guilabel:`WH/OUT/XXXXX` in the message to view "
"the backorder delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Restordreleveringsordren vil blive vist i chatteren for den oprindelige "
"leveringsordre i en besked, der lyder :guilabel:`The backorder WH/OUT/XXXXX "
"has been created`. Klik på :guilabel:`WH/OUT/XXXXX` i beskeden for at se "
"restordreleveringsordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:99
msgid ""
"The backorder delivery order listed in the chatter of the original delivery "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Restordreleveringsordren vist i chatten på den oprindelige leveringsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:102
msgid ""
"The backorder delivery order can also be accessed by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory`, clicking the :guilabel:`Back Orders #` link "
"on the *Delivery Orders* card, and selecting the delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Restordreleveringsordren kan også tilgås ved at navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Lager`, klikke på linket :guilabel:`Back Orders #` på "
"kortet *Delivery Orders* og vælge leveringsordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:106
msgid "The Back Orders button on the Delivery Orders card."
msgstr "Knappen Restordrer på kortet Leveringsordrer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:109
msgid ""
"When the remaining items are ready to be shipped, navigate to the backorder "
"delivery order. The items can be shipped in a single package by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Validate`, or shipped in multiple packages by following "
"the steps detailed in the section above."
msgstr ""
"Når de resterende varer er klar til at blive sendt, skal du navigere til "
"restordreleveringsordren. Varerne kan sendes i en enkelt pakke ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Validate`, eller sendes i flere pakker ved at følge trinene "
"beskrevet i afsnittet ovenfor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack.rst:113
msgid ""
"It is also possible to ship some of the items while creating a new backorder "
"for the rest. To do so, follow the same steps used to create the first "
"backorder."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at sende nogle af varerne, mens der oprettes en ny "
"restordre for resten. For at gøre dette skal du følge de samme trin, der "
"blev brugt til at oprette den første restordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:3
msgid "Add a new delivery method"
msgstr "Tilføj en ny leveringsmetode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Delivery Methods* setting adds the option of calculating the cost of "
"shipping on sales orders and e-commerce shopping carts. The shipping cost "
"can then be added to a sales order as a delivery product, and the shipping "
"details can be added to the delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Indstillingen *Leveringsmetoder* tilføjer muligheden for at beregne "
"forsendelsesomkostninger på salgsordrer og e-handels indkøbskurve. "
"Forsendelsesomkostningen kan derefter tilføjes til en salgsordre som et "
"leveringsprodukt, og forsendelsesdetaljerne kan tilføjes til leveringsordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:15
msgid ""
"To configure delivery methods, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Configuration --> Delivery Methods`."
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere leveringsmetoder skal du gå til :menuselection:`Lager --> "
"Konfiguration --> Leveringsmetoder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:19
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` option is not available from "
"the :guilabel:`Configuration` drop-down menu, verify whether the feature is "
"enabled by following these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Hvis indstillingen :guilabel:`Leveringsmetoder` ikke er tilgængelig fra "
"rullelisten :guilabel:`Konfiguration`, skal du kontrollere om funktionen er "
"aktiveret ved at følge disse trin:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:22
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr "Gå til :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:23
msgid ""
"Scroll to the :guilabel:`Shipping` section and enable "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` feature by checking the corresponding "
"checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Rul ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Forsendelse` og aktiver "
"funktionen :guilabel:`Leveringsmetoder` ved at markere det tilsvarende "
"afkrydsningsfelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:26
msgid "The Delivery Methods feature enabled in the settings."
msgstr "Funktionen leveringsmetoder aktiveret i indstillingerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:31
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` page, add a method by "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`. Doing so opens a form to provide details about the "
"shipping provider, including:"
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Leveringsmetoder` tilføjes en metode ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Ny`. Dette åbner en formular til at angive detaljer om "
"forsendelsesudbyderen, herunder:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Method` (*Required field*): the name of the delivery "
"method (e.g. `flat-rate shipping`, `same day delivery`, etc.)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leveringsmetode` (*Påkrævet felt*): navnet på leveringsmetoden "
"(f.eks. `forsendelse til fast pris`, `levering samme dag` osv.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Website`: configure shipping methods for an :doc:`e-commerce </"
"applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping>` page. Select the applicable "
"website from the drop-down menu, or leave it blank to apply the method to "
"all web pages. This field only appears when the **eCommerce** app is enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Hjemmeside`: konfigurer leveringsmetoder til en :doc:`webshop </"
"applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping>`-side. Vælg den relevante "
"hjemmeside fra rullemenuen, eller lad den stå tom for at anvende metoden på "
"alle websider. Dette felt vises kun, når **eCommerce**-appen er aktiveret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Provider` (*Required field*): choose the delivery service, like "
"FedEx, if using a :ref:`third-party carrier <inventory/shipping/"
"third_party>`. Ensure the integration with the shipping carrier is properly "
"installed and select the provider from the drop-down menu. For more details "
"on configuring custom shipping methods, such as :ref:`fixed price <inventory/"
"shipping/fixed>` or :ref:`based on rules <inventory/shipping/rules>` "
"options, refer to their respective sections below."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Udbyder` (*Påkrævet felt*): vælg leveringsservice, som FedEx, "
"hvis der bruges en :ref:`tredjepartsudbyder <inventory/shipping/"
"third_party>`. Sørg for at integrationen med forsendelsesudbyderen er "
"korrekt installeret, og vælg udbyderen fra rullelisten. For flere detaljer "
"om konfiguration af brugerdefinerede forsendelsesmetoder, såsom :ref:`fast "
"pris <inventory/shipping/fixed>` eller :ref:`baseret på regler <inventory/"
"shipping/rules>`, se deres respektive afsnit nedenfor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cash on Delivery`: allow customers to choose the :ref:`Cash on "
"Delivery <ecommerce/payments/cash-on-delivery>` payment method when "
"selecting this delivery option on the ecommerce website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Efterkrav`: giv kunder mulighed for at vælge "
"betalingsmetoden :ref:`Efterkrav <ecommerce/payments/cash-on-delivery>`, når "
"de vælger denne leveringsmulighed på webshoppen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: If the shipping method should apply to a specific "
"company, select it from the drop-down menu. Leave the field blank to apply "
"the method to all companies. This field only appears in multi-company "
"databases."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Virksomhed`: Hvis forsendelsesmetoden skal gælde for en bestemt "
"virksomhed, skal du vælge den fra rullemenuen. Lad feltet være tomt for at "
"anvende metoden på alle virksomheder. Dette felt vises kun i databaser med "
"flere virksomheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Routes`: select the applicable routes to define different "
"delivery methods, such as standard or express shipping, based on varying "
"lead times. This field only appears when you have enabled multi-step routes "
"in your inventory configuration settings. For more information, refer to "
"the :ref:`Set routes on shipping method <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"shipping-route>` section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ruter`: vælg de relevante ruter for at definere forskellige "
"leveringsmetoder, såsom standard- eller ekspreslevering, baseret på "
"varierende leveringstider. Dette felt vises kun, når du har aktiveret "
"flertrinsruter i dine lagerkonfigurationsindstillinger. For yderligere "
"information se afsnittet :ref:`Indstil ruter på forsendelsesmetode "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/shipping-route>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product` (*Required field*): the product listed on "
"the :ref:`sales order line <inventory/shipping/sales-order>` as the delivery "
"charge."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leveringsprodukt` (*Påkrævet felt*): produktet anført "
"på :ref:`salgsordrens linje <inventory/shipping/sales-order>` som "
"leveringsomkostning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tracking Link`: This option adds a link to the portal so the "
"customer can track their delivery. When a custom carrier is added in a "
"delivery order, the tracking button is enabled, and the link directs to the "
"tracking portal with that URL."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sporingslink`: Denne indstilling tilføjer et link til portalen, "
"så kunden kan spore deres levering. Når en brugerdefineret udbyder tilføjes "
"i en leveringsordre, aktiveres sporingsknappen, og linket fører til "
"sporingsportalen med den pågældende URL."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:65
msgid "To set up `$200` flate-rate shipping, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"For at opsætte `$200` fast-pris forsendelse skal du udfylde følgende felter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:67
msgid ":guilabel:`Delivery Method`: `Furniture Delivery (Manual)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Leveringsmetode`: `Furniture Delivery (Manual)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:68
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:111
msgid ":guilabel:`Provider`: :guilabel:`Fixed Price`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Udbyder`: :guilabel:`Fast pris`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:69
msgid ":guilabel:`Fixed Price`: `200`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fast pris`: `200`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:70
msgid ":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: :guilabel:`Furniture Delivery (manual)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Leveringsprodukt`: :guilabel:`Furniture Delivery (manual)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:72
msgid "Set up a delivery method with a fixed price of 200."
msgstr "Opsæt en leveringsmetode med en fast pris på 200."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:77
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Availability` tab to define conditions for the delivery "
"method based on the order's content or destination:"
msgstr ""
"Brug fanen :guilabel:`Tilgængelighed` til at definere betingelser for "
"leveringsmetoden baseret på ordrens indhold eller destination:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Countries`: Specify one or more countries where the method is "
"available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lande`: Angiv et eller flere lande, hvor metoden er tilgængelig."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Max Weight`: Set a maximum weight; the method is only available "
"for orders below this limit."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Maks. vægt`: Angiv en maksimal vægt; metoden er kun tilgængelig "
"for ordrer under denne grænse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Max Volume`: Set a maximum volume; the method is only available "
"for orders below this limit."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Maks. volumen`: Angiv et maksimalt volumen; metoden er kun "
"tilgængelig for ordrer under denne grænse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Must Have Tags`: The method is available only if at least one "
"product in the order has one of these tags."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Skal have mærkater`: Metoden er kun tilgængelig, hvis mindst ét "
"produkt i ordren har et af disse mærkater."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Excluded Tags`: The method is unavailable if at least one product "
"in the order has one of these tags."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ekskluderede mærkater`: Metoden er ikke tilgængelig, hvis mindst "
"ét produkt i ordren har et af disse mærkater."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:90
msgid ""
"For examples on how to configure specific shipping methods, refer to the "
"sections below."
msgstr ""
"For eksempler på hvordan du konfigurerer specifikke forsendelsesmetoder, se "
"afsnittene nedenfor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:95
msgid "Fixed price"
msgstr "Fast pris"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:97
msgid ""
"To configure a shipping price that is the same for all orders, go "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery Methods`. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, and on the shipping method form, set "
"the :guilabel:`Provider` to the :guilabel:`Fixed Price` option. Selecting "
"this option makes the :guilabel:`Fixed Price` field become available, which "
"is where the fixed rate shipping amount is defined."
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere en forsendelsespris, der er den samme for alle ordrer, "
"skal du gå til :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> "
"Leveringsmetoder`. Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Ny`, og indstil på "
"forsendelsesmetodeformularen :guilabel:`Udbyder` til "
"valgmuligheden :guilabel:`Fast pris`. Valg af denne mulighed gør, at "
"feltet :guilabel:`Fast pris` bliver tilgængeligt, hvilket er stedet, hvor "
"det faste forsendelsesbeløb defineres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:103
msgid ""
"To enable free shipping if the amount of the order exceeds a specified "
"amount, check the box :guilabel:`Free if order amount is above` and fill in "
"the amount."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere gratis forsendelse hvis ordrebeløbet overstiger et angivet "
"beløb, skal du markere boksen :guilabel:`Gratis hvis ordrebeløb er over` og "
"udfylde beløbet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:107
msgid ""
"To set up `$20` flat-rate shipping that becomes free if the customer spends "
"over `$100`, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"For at opsætte `$20` forsendelse til fast pris, der bliver gratis hvis "
"kunden bruger over `$100`, skal du udfylde følgende felter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:110
msgid ":guilabel:`Delivery Method`: `Flat-rate shipping`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Leveringsmetode`: `Forsendelse til fast pris`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:112
msgid ":guilabel:`Fixed Price`: `$20.00`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fast pris`: `$20.00`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:113
msgid ":guilabel:`Free if order amount is above`: `$100.00`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Gratis ved ordrebeløb over`: `$100.00`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:114
msgid ":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: `[SHIP] Flat`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Leveringsprodukt`: `[SHIP] Flat`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:116
msgid "Example of filling out a shipping method."
msgstr "Eksempel på udfyldning af en leveringsmetode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:122
msgid "Based on rules"
msgstr "Baseret på regler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:124
msgid ""
"To calculate the price of shipping based on pricing rules, set "
"the :guilabel:`Provider` field to the :guilabel:`Based on Rules` option. "
"Optionally, adjust :guilabel:`Margin on Rate` and :guilabel:`Additional "
"margin` to include additional shipping costs."
msgstr ""
"For at beregne fragtprisen baseret på prisregler skal "
"feltet :guilabel:`Udbyder` indstilles til :guilabel:`Baseret på regler`. "
"Juster eventuelt :guilabel:`Margin på takst` og :guilabel:`Ekstra margin` "
"for at inkludere yderligere fragtomkostninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:129
msgid "Create pricing rules"
msgstr "Opret prisregler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:131
msgid ""
"Navigate to the :guilabel:`Pricing` tab and click :guilabel:`Add a line`. "
"Doing so opens the :guilabel:`Create Pricing Rules` window, where "
"the :guilabel:`Condition` related to the product weight, volume, price, or "
"quantity is compared to a defined amount to calculate "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Cost`."
msgstr ""
"Naviger til fanen :guilabel:`Prissætning` og klik på :guilabel:`Tilføj en "
"linje`. Dette åbner vinduet :guilabel:`Opret prisregler`, "
"hvor :guilabel:`Betingelse` relateret til produktets vægt, volumen, pris "
"eller antal sammenlignes med et defineret beløb for at "
"beregne :guilabel:`Leveringsomkostninger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:136
msgid ""
"Once finished, click either :guilabel:`Save & New` to add another rule, "
"or :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr ""
"Når du er færdig, skal du klikke på enten :guilabel:`Gem & Ny` for at "
"tilføje en anden regel eller :guilabel:`Gem & Luk`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:139
msgid ""
"To charge customers $20 in shipping for orders with five or fewer products, "
"set the :guilabel:`Condition` to `Quantity <= 5.00`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Cost` to `$20`."
msgstr ""
"For at opkræve kunder $20 i fragt for ordrer med fem eller færre produkter "
"skal :guilabel:`Betingelse` indstilles til `Antal <= 5.00`, "
"og :guilabel:`Leveringsomkostninger` til `$20`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:142
msgid ""
"Display window to add a pricing rule. Set a condition and delivery cost."
msgstr ""
"Vis vindue til at tilføje en prisregel. Angiv en betingelse og "
"leveringsomkostninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method.rst:145
msgid ""
"To restrict shipping to specific destinations on the **eCommerce** website, "
"in the shipping method form, navigate to the :guilabel:`Destination "
