msgstr ":guilabel:`Adresse`: `My Company (San Francisco)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:60
msgid ""
"Notice how the inputs for the :guilabel:`Warehouse` field, for both the Odoo "
"configuration and the Sendcloud configuration, are the exact same."
msgstr ""
"Bemærk, hvordan indtastningerne i feltet :guilabel:`Lager` er nøjagtig de "
"samme for både Odoo-konfigurationen og Sendcloud-konfigurationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:64
msgid "Generate Sendcloud credentials"
msgstr "Generer Sendcloud-legitimationsoplysninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:66
msgid ""
"In the Sendcloud account, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Integrations` in the menu on the right. Next, search for :guilabel:`Odoo "
"Native`. Then, click on :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""
"I Sendcloud-kontoen skal du navigere til :menuselection:`Indstillinger --> "
"Integrationer` i menuen til højre. Søg derefter efter :guilabel:`Odoo "
"Native`. Klik herefter på :guilabel:`Tilslut`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:69
msgid ""
"After clicking on :guilabel:`Connect`, the page redirects to "
"the :guilabel:`Sendcloud API` settings page, where the :guilabel:`Public and "
"Secret Keys` are produced. The next step is to name "
"the :guilabel:`Integration`. The naming convention is as follows: `Odoo "
"CompanyName`, with the user's company name replacing `CompanyName` (e.g. "
"`Odoo Stealthy Wood`)."
msgstr ""
"Når du har klikket på :guilabel:`Forbind`, omdirigeres siden til "
"indstillingssiden for :guilabel:`Sendcloud API`, hvor :guilabel:`Offentlige "
"og hemmelige nøgler` oprettes. Det næste trin er at "
"navngive :guilabel:`Integration`. Navngivningskonventionen er som følger: "
"`Odoo CompanyName`, hvor brugerens virksomhedsnavn erstatter `CompanyName` "
"(f.eks. `Odoo Stealthy Wood`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:74
msgid ""
"Then, check the box next to :guilabel:`Service Points` and select the "
"shipping services for this integration. After saving, the :guilabel:`Public "
"and Secret Keys` are generated."
msgstr ""
"Marker derefter boksen ved siden af :guilabel:`servicepunkter`, og vælg "
"forsendelsestjenesterne til denne integration. Efter lagring "
"genereres :guilabel:`de offentlige og hemmelige nøgler`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:77
msgid "Configuring the Sendcloud integration and receiving the credentials."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguration af Sendcloud-integrationen og modtagelse af "
"legitimationsoplysningerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:83
msgid ""
"To ensure seamless Sendcloud integration with Odoo, :ref:`install <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/sendcloud-module>` and :ref:`link <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/link-sendcloud-module>` the Sendcloud shipping connector "
"to the Sendcloud account. Then, :ref:`configure Odoo fields <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/sendcloud-shipping-info>`, so Sendcloud can accurately "
"pull shipping data to generate labels."
msgstr ""
"For at sikre problemfri Sendcloud-integration med Odoo skal "
"du :ref:`installere <inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-module>` "
"og :ref:`linke <inventory/shipping_receiving/link-sendcloud-module>` "
"Sendcloud-forsendelsesconnectoren til Sendcloud-kontoen. Konfigurer "
"derefter :ref:`Odoo-felterne <inventory/shipping_receiving/sendcloud-"
"shipping-info>`, så Sendcloud præcist kan hente forsendelsesdata til at "
"generere etiketter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:91
msgid ""
":ref:`Enable pickup points on websites <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"sendcloud-pickups>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Aktiver afhentningspunkter på websteder <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"sendcloud-pickups>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:96
msgid "Install Sendcloud shipping module"
msgstr "Installer Sendcloud-forsendelsesmodulet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:98
msgid ""
"After the Sendcloud account is set up and configured, it's time to configure "
"the Odoo database. To get started, go to Odoo's :guilabel:`Apps` module, "
"search for the `Sendcloud Shipping`, and :ref:`install it <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Når Sendcloud-kontoen er sat op og konfigureret, er det tid til at "
"konfigurere Odoo-databasen. For at komme i gang skal du gå til Odoos "
"modul :guilabel:`Apps`, søge efter `Sendcloud Shipping` og :ref:`installere "
"det <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:102
msgid "Sendcloud Shipping module in the Odoo Apps module."
msgstr "Sendcloud Shipping-modul i Odoo Apps-modulet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:108
msgid "Sendcloud shipping connector configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration af Sendcloud-forsendelsesconnector"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:110
msgid ""
"Once installed, activate the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Shipping` module "
"in :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`. "
"The :guilabel:`Sendcloud Connector` setting is found under "
"the :guilabel:`Shipping Connectors` section."
msgstr ""
"Når modulet er installeret, skal du aktivere :guilabel:`Forsendelse med "
"Sendcloud`-modulet i :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> "
"Indstillinger`. Indstillingen :guilabel:`Sendcloud-connector` findes under "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Forsendelsesconnectorer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:114
msgid ""
"After activating the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Connector`, click on "
"the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Delivery Methods` link below the listed connector. "
"Once on the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` page, click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Efter aktivering af :guilabel:`Sendcloud Connector` skal du klikke på "
"linket :guilabel:`Sendcloud Delivery Methods` under den anførte connector. "
"Når du er på siden :guilabel:`Leveringsmetoder`, skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Ny`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Methods` can also be accessed by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery Methods`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leveringsmetoder` kan også tilgås ved at gå "
"til :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> Levering --> "
"Leveringsmetoder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:122
msgid ""
"Fill out the following fields in the :guilabel:`New Delivery Method` form:"
msgstr "Udfyld følgende felter i formularen :guilabel:`Ny leveringsmetode`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:124
msgid ":guilabel:`Delivery Method`: Type `Sendcloud DPD`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Leveringsmetode`: Skriv `Sendcloud DPD`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:125
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Provider`: Select :guilabel:`Sendcloud` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Udbyder`: vælg :guilabel:`Sendcloud` fra rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: Set the product that was configured for this "
"shipping method or create a new product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leveringsprodukt`: angiv det produkt, der blev konfigureret til "
"denne forsendelsesmetode, eller opret et nyt produkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:128
msgid ":guilabel:`Invoicing Policy`: Select one of the options."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Faktureringspolitik`: Vælg en af mulighederne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:129
msgid "In the :guilabel:`SendCloud Configuration` tab:"
msgstr "Under fanen :guilabel:`SendCloud-konfiguration`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:131
msgid "Enter the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Public Key`."
msgstr "Indtast :guilabel:`Sendcloud offentlig nøgle`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:132
msgid "Enter the :guilabel:`Sendcloud Secret Key`."
msgstr "Indtast :guilabel:`Sendcloud hemmelig nøgle`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:133
msgid "Enter the :guilabel:`Ship From` location."
msgstr "Indtast lokationen :guilabel:`Send fra`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:138
msgid "Pickup points"
msgstr "Afhentningssteder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:140
msgid ""
"Sendcloud's `service point delivery <https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/"
"articles/360026097951-FAQ-Service-Points>`_ lets customers choose a pickup "
"location (such as a nearby shop or locker) instead of entering a private "
"delivery address."
msgstr ""
"Sendclouds `service point delivery <https://support.sendcloud.com/hc/en-us/"
"articles/360026097951-FAQ-Service-Points>`_ lader kunder vælge et "
"afhentningssted (såsom en butik eller skab i nærheden) i stedet for at "
"indtaste en privat leveringsadresse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:145
msgid ""
"To enable the feature, go to the shipping method form, and under the "
"*Options* section in the *SendCloud Configuration* tab, "
"enable :guilabel:`Use Sendcloud Locations` feature."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere funktionen skal du gå til leveringsmetodeformularen og under "
"sektionen *Valgmuligheder* på fanen *SendCloud-konfiguration* aktivere "
"funktionen :guilabel:`Brug Sendcloud-lokationer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:148
msgid "Once enabled, the pickup point selection is available through:"
msgstr "Når det er aktiveret, er valg af afhentningssted tilgængeligt via:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:150
msgid ""
"The **Website** app on the *Delivery method* page during the online checkout "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Appen **Website** på siden *Leveringsmetode* under online betalingsprocessen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:152
msgid "The Delivery method page with Sendcloud option selected."
msgstr "Siden Leveringsmetode med Sendcloud-valgmuligheden valgt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:155
msgid ""
"The **Sales** app on the sales quotation using the *Add shipping* button or "
"the *Delivery* smart button."
msgstr ""
"Appen **Salg** på salgstilbuddet ved hjælp af knappen *Tilføj levering* "
"eller smart-knappen *Levering*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:158
msgid ""
"To add a :guilabel:`Pickup point` to a sales quote, :ref:`create a quotation "
"<sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>` and click the :guilabel:`Add "
"shipping` button. The *Add a delivery method* pop-up displays. "
"Select :guilabel:`Sendcloud MR` (Sendcloud Mondial Relay) for "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Method` and then click :guilabel:`Get Rate`."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje et :guilabel:`Afhentningssted` til et salgstilbud skal "
"du :ref:`oprette et tilbud <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>` og "
"klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Tilføj levering`. Pop op-vinduet *Tilføj en "
"leveringsmetode* vises. Vælg :guilabel:`Sendcloud MR` (Sendcloud Mondial "
"Relay) som :guilabel:`Leveringsmetode`, og klik derefter på :guilabel:`Hent "
"takst`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:163
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`pencil` icon next to "
"the :guilabel:`Pickup Point` field and the *Choose a pick-up point* pop-up "
"displays. Enter a zip code and select a location from the generated list. "
"Click :guilabel:`Choose this location` to save it and return to the *Add a "
"delivery method* pop-up, then click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`blyant` ud for "
"feltet :guilabel:`Afhentningssted`, hvorefter pop op-vinduet *Vælg et "
"afhentningssted* vises. Indtast et postnummer, og vælg en placering fra den "
"genererede liste. Klik på :guilabel:`Vælg denne placering` for at gemme den "
"og vende tilbage til pop op-vinduet *Tilføj en leveringsmetode*, og klik "
"derefter på :guilabel:`Tilføj`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:168
msgid ""
"Completed pop-up with the Sendcloud method selected and Pickup Point "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Udfyldt pop op-vindue med Sendcloud-metoden valgt og afhentningssted "
"konfigureret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:171
msgid ""
"To change a pickup point after a sales quotation is confirmed, ensure the "
"delivery order has not been validated. If the delivery order is validated:"
msgstr ""
"For at ændre et afhentningssted, efter et salgstilbud er bekræftet, skal du "
"sikre, at leveringsordren ikke er blevet valideret. Hvis leveringsordren er "
"valideret:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:174
msgid ""
"**Do not** attempt to change the pickup point on the sales order or delivery "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Forsøg **ikke** at ændre afhentningsstedet på salgsordren eller "
"leveringsordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:175
msgid "Cancel the existing sales order."
msgstr "Annuller den eksisterende salgsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:176
msgid "Create a new sales order with the correct pickup point."
msgstr "Opret en ny salgsordre med det korrekte afhentningssted."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:179
msgid ""
"The customer has already confirmed the sales order with their chosen pickup "
"point, however, now they want to change the pickup point location."
msgstr ""
"Kunden har allerede bekræftet salgsordren med sit valgte afhentningssted, "
"men ønsker nu at ændre placeringen af afhentningsstedet."

