msgstr "**Forsendelsesetiketter**, afhængigt af antallet af pakker."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:188
msgid "**Tracking numbers**, if the selected courier supports it."
msgstr "**Sporingsnumre**, hvis den valgte kurer understøtter det."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:190
msgid "After the delivery is validated, a label is generated."
msgstr "Efter at leveringen er valideret, genereres en etiket."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:194
msgid ""
"If the shipment is too heavy for the configured Shiprocket service, the "
"weight is split to simulate multiple packages. Products must be put in "
"different packages to validate the transfer and generate labels."
msgstr ""
"Hvis forsendelsen er for tung til den konfigurerede Shiprocket-service, "
"opdeles vægten for at simulere flere pakker. Produkter skal lægges i "
"forskellige pakker for at validere overførslen og generere etiketter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:199
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:250
msgid "Cancellations"
msgstr "Annulleringer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:201
msgid ""
"If a delivery order is canceled in Odoo, it is automatically archived in "
"Shiprocket. However, the cancellation will not be sent to the courier "
"directly, so make sure to log in to the courier's platform to handle it "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en leveringsordre annulleres i Odoo, arkiveres den automatisk i "
"Shiprocket. Annulleringen sendes dog ikke direkte til kureren, så sørg for "
"at logge ind på kurerens platform for at håndtere den manuelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:206
msgid "Turn on Shiprocket integration"
msgstr "Slå Shiprocket-integration til"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:208
msgid ""
"After the Shiprocket connection is set up, use the smart buttons at the top "
"of the form to publish, turn on production mode, or activate debug logging."
msgstr ""
"Når Shiprocket-forbindelsen er opsat, skal du bruge de smarte knapper øverst "
"i formularen til at publicere, slå produktionstilstand til eller aktivere "
"fejlfindingslogning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:211
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unpublished/Published`: Click this smart button to make this "
"shipping method available on the **eCommerce** website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ikke publiceret/publiceret`: Klik på denne smarte knap for at "
"gøre denne forsendelsesmetode tilgængelig på **e-handelshjemmesiden**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Test Environment/Production Environment`: Click this smart button "
"to specify whether labels are for testing only and are canceled immediately "
"(Test), or whether real shipping labels can be generated and charged to the "
"Shiprocket account (Production). In the Test environment, the amount of the "
"canceled shipment is refunded in 3 to 4 days."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Testmiljø/produktionsmiljø`: Klik på denne smarte knap for at "
"angive, om etiketter kun er til test og annulleres med det samme (test), "
"eller om rigtige forsendelsesetiketter kan genereres og opkræves på "
"Shiprocket-kontoen (produktion). I testmiljøet refunderes beløbet for den "
"annullerede forsendelse inden for 3 til 4 dage."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No Debug/Debug Requests`: Click this smart button to specify "
"whether API requests and responses are logged in Odoo (:doc:`turn on "
"developer mode <../../../../general/developer_mode>` and go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical --> Logging`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ingen fejlfinding/fejlfindingsanmodninger`: Klik på denne smarte "
"knap for at angive, om API-anmodninger og -svar logges i Odoo (:doc:`slå "
"udviklertilstand til <../../../../general/developer_mode>` og gå "
"til :menuselection:`Indstillinger app --> Teknisk --> Logning`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:3
msgid "ShipStation integration"
msgstr "ShipStation-integration"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:5
msgid ""
"ShipStation is an all-in-one shipping and fulfillment platform. Integrating "
"ShipStation with Odoo makes it possible to calculate shipping costs and "
"print shipping labels directly through Odoo."
msgstr ""
"ShipStation er en alt-i-en forsendelses- og distributionsplatform. Ved at "
"integrere ShipStation med Odoo bliver det muligt at beregne "
"forsendelsesomkostninger og udskrive forsendelsesetiketter direkte via Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:8
msgid ""
"ShipStation supports integration with carriers including UPS, USPS, FedEx, "
"and DHL. International carriers such as Mercado Libre and OnTrac are also "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"ShipStation understøtter integration med fragtfirmaer herunder UPS, USPS, "
"FedEx og DHL. Internationale fragtfirmaer som Mercado Libre og OnTrac "
"understøttes også."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:17
msgid ""
"To enable ShipStation as a delivery method in Odoo, :ref:`retrieve the API "
"key and set carrier preferences in ShipStation <inventory/shipstation/api-"
"key-carriers>`, then :ref:`create ShipStation delivery methods in Odoo "
"<inventory/shipstation/create-delivery-method>`."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere ShipStation som en leveringsmetode i Odoo, :ref:`hent API-"
"nøglen og indstil fragtfirma-præferencer i ShipStation <inventory/"
"shipstation/api-key-carriers>`, og :ref:`opret derefter ShipStation-"
"leveringsmetoder i Odoo <inventory/shipstation/create-delivery-method>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:24
msgid "Configuration in ShipStation"
msgstr "Konfiguration i ShipStation"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:26
msgid ""
"To configure carrier preferences in ShipStation, go to the `ShipStation "
"website <https://www.shipstation.com/start-a-free-trial/>`_ and sign in or "
"create a ShipStation account."
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere præferencer for fragtfirmaer i ShipStation skal du gå til "
"`ShipStations hjemmeside <https://www.shipstation.com/start-a-free-trial/>`_ "
"og logge ind eller oprette en ShipStation-konto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Obtain test and production API keys**: Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Account --> API Settings`, select :guilabel:`V2 API`, and "
"click :guilabel:`Generate API Key`."
msgstr ""
"**Hent test- og produktions-API-nøgler**: Gå til :menuselection:`Settings --"
"> Account --> API Settings`, vælg :guilabel:`V2 API`, og klik "
"på :guilabel:`Generate API Key`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:32
msgid "ShipStation API Settings page with Generate API Key button."
msgstr "ShipStation-siden API Settings med knappen Generate API Key."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:36
msgid ""
"For the integration to work in Odoo, the :guilabel:`V2 API` needs to be "
"selected from the version drop-down, as it is the only one supported."
msgstr ""
"For at integrationen kan fungere i Odoo, skal :guilabel:`V2 API` vælges i "
"version-rullemenuen, da det er den eneste, der understøttes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Copy the production key**: Keep the :guilabel:`Production Key` on hand "
"for :ref:`delivery method configuration in Odoo <inventory/shipstation/"
"create-delivery-method>`."
msgstr ""
"**Kopiér produktionsnøglen**: Hav :guilabel:`Production Key` ved hånden "
"til :ref:`konfiguration af leveringsmetode i Odoo <inventory/shipstation/"
"create-delivery-method>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shipstation.rst:42
