msgstr "Konfigurer en leveringsmetode med Starshipit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:106
msgid ""
"Once installed, activate the feature by going to :menuselection:`Inventory --"
"> Configuration --> Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Shipping Connectors` "
"section, activate the :guilabel:`Starshipit Connector` option."
msgstr ""
"Når modulet er installeret, skal du aktivere funktionen ved at gå "
"til :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`. Under "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Forsendelsesforbindelser` skal du aktivere "
"indstillingen :guilabel:`Starshipit-forbindelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:110
msgid ""
"After activating :guilabel:`Starshipit Connector`, click "
"the :guilabel:`Starshipit Shipping Methods` link below the listed connector. "
"Once on the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` page, click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"Efter aktivering af :guilabel:`Starshipit Connector` skal du klikke på "
"linket :guilabel:`Starshipit Shipping Methods` under den listede connector. "
"Når du er på siden :guilabel:`Leveringsmetoder`, skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Opret`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:115
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Methods` can also be accessed by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery --> Delivery "
"Methods`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leveringsmetoder` kan også tilgås ved at gå "
"til :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> Levering --> "
"Leveringsmetoder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:118
msgid ""
"Configure a Starshipit delivery method in Odoo by filling out the fields on "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Methods` form as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurer en leveringsmetode med Starshipit i Odoo ved at udfylde felterne "
"på formularen :guilabel:`Leveringsmetoder` som følger:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:121
msgid ":guilabel:`Delivery Method`: type `Starshipit`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Leveringsmetode`: skriv `Starshipit`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:122
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Provider`: select :guilabel:`Starshipit` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Udbyder`: vælg :guilabel:`Starshipit` fra rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:123
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: assign or create the delivery product that "
"will appear on the sales order line when the cost of shipping is computed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leveringsprodukt`: tildel eller opret det leveringsprodukt, der "
"vises på salgsordrelinjen, når forsendelsesomkostningen beregnes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:127
msgid ""
"The fields discussed in this section are specific to configuring Starshipit. "
"For more information about the other fields, refer to :doc:`../"
"setup_configuration`."
msgstr ""
"Felterne i dette afsnit er specifikke for konfiguration af Starshipit. For "
"flere oplysninger om de andre felter, se :doc:`../setup_configuration`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:130
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Starshipit Configuration` tab, fill out these fields:"
msgstr ""
"I fanen :guilabel:`Starshipit-konfiguration` skal du udfylde disse felter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit API Key`: enter the :abbr:`API (Application "
"Programming Interface)` key :ref:`obtained from Starshipit <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/star-api>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit API-nøgle`: indtast den :abbr:`API (Application "
"Programming Interface)`-nøgle :ref:`hentet fra Starshipit <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/star-api>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:134
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit Subscription Key`: enter the subscription key obtained "
"from the same place as the :ref:`API key <inventory/shipping_receiving/star-"
"api>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Starshipit-abonnementsnøgle`: indtast abonnementsnøglen hentet "
"fra samme sted som :ref:`API-nøglen <inventory/shipping_receiving/star-api>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Origin Address`: Enter the address where products are shipped "
"from. This field is crucial for calculating shipping rates "
"and :ref:`generating shipping labels <inventory/shipping_receiving/star-"
"label>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Oprindelsesadresse`: Indtast den adresse, hvorfra produkter "
"sendes. Dette felt er afgørende for at beregne forsendelsesrater "
"og :ref:`generere forsendelsesetiketter <inventory/shipping_receiving/star-"
"label>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Package Type`: Set a default package type to include the "
"weight of the empty package when automatically calculating shipping rates."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Standardpakketype`: Angiv en standardpakketype for at inkludere "
"vægten af den tomme pakke ved automatisk beregning af forsendelsesrater."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:143
msgid ""
"To set a default package type, the *Packages* feature **must** be enabled "
"in :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"For at angive en standardpakketype **skal** funktionen *Pakker* være "
"aktiveret i :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:146
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon at the "
"top of the page to save the changes."
msgstr ""
"Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(Gem manuelt)` øverst på "
"siden for at gemme ændringerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:148
msgid ""
"To load the newly configured shipping products, click :guilabel:`Select a "
"service linked to your starshipit account` at the bottom of "
"the :guilabel:`Starshipit Configuration` tab, and a :guilabel:`Choose "
"Starshipit Shipping Service` pop-up window appears. In "
"the :guilabel:`Delivery Service` field, select the desired shipping service "
"for deliveries and returns from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"For at indlæse de nyligt konfigurerede forsendelsesprodukter skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Vælg en service, der er knyttet til din starshipit-konto` "
"nederst på fanen :guilabel:`Starshipit-konfiguration`, hvorefter pop op-"
"vinduet :guilabel:`Vælg Starshipit-forsendelseservice` vises. I "
"feltet :guilabel:`Leveringsservice` skal du vælge den ønskede "
"forsendelseservice til leveringer og returvarer fra rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:154
msgid ""
"The list of services shown during initial configuration may be incomplete. "
"Starshipit determines service availability based on shipment details such as "
"the destination address and package weight, which are not yet available at "
"this stage. To select from the full list of services available for a "
"specific order, use the :guilabel:`Get more delivery methods` option "
"directly from the sales order. See :ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/star-"
"label` for details."
msgstr ""
"Listen over services, der vises under den indledende konfiguration, kan være "
"ufuldstændig. Starshipit bestemmer servicetilgængelighed baseret på "
"forsendelsesdetaljer som destinationsadresse og pakkevægt, som endnu ikke er "
"tilgængelige på dette tidspunkt. For at vælge fra den fulde liste over "
"tilgængelige services til en specifik ordre skal du bruge "
"muligheden :guilabel:`Få flere leveringsmetoder` direkte fra salgsordren. "
"Se :ref:`inventory/shipping_receiving/star-label` for detaljer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:160
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` and the selected delivery service populates in "
"the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` and :guilabel:`Starshipit Service Code` "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Bekræft`, hvorefter den valgte leveringsservice udfyldes "
"i felterne :guilabel:`Forsendelsesmetode` og :guilabel:`Starshipit-"
"servicekode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:163
msgid "Sample of a Starshipit shipping product configured in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"Eksempel på et Forsendelse med Starshipit-forsendelsesprdukt konfigureret i "
"Odoo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Sendle: Sendle drop off`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Sendle: Sendle drop off`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Shipping Product`: `Sendle Delivery`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Forsendelsesprodukt`: `Sendle Delivery`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Starshipit Service Code`: `STANDARD-DROPOFF`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Starshipit-servicekode`: `STANDARD-DROPOFF`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:174
msgid ""
"Starshipit does not provide test keys when a company tests the sending of a "
"package in Odoo. This means that if a package is created, the account may be "
"charged."
msgstr ""
"Starshipit leverer ikke testnøgler, når en virksomhed tester afsendelse af "
"en pakke i Odoo. Det betyder, at hvis en pakke oprettes, kan kontoen blive "
"opkrævet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:177
msgid ""
"Odoo has a built-in layer of protection against unwanted charges when using "
"test environments. Within a test environment, if a shipping method is used "
"to create labels, then those labels are immediately cancelled after creation "
"— this occurs automatically. Please note that depending on the shipping "
"provider being used, the account might be charged for printing label, unless "
"the order is cancelled manually on the couriers’s portal."
msgstr ""
"Odoo har et indbygget beskyttelseslag mod uønskede gebyrer ved brug af "
"testmiljøer. I et testmiljø, hvis en forsendelsesmetode bruges til at "
"oprette etiketter, annulleres disse etiketter automatisk efter oprettelse — "
"dette sker automatisk. Bemærk venligst, at afhængigt af den anvendte "
"forsendelsesleverandør kan kontoen blive opkrævet for udskrivning af etiket, "
"medmindre ordren annulleres manuelt på fragtmandens portal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:184
msgid ""
"Switch between the test and production environment by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Environment` smart button at the top of the shipping method "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Skift mellem test- og produktionsmiljø ved at klikke på "
"smartknappen :guilabel:`Miljø` øverst på forsendelsesmetodens formular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:190
msgid "Generate a label with Starshipit"
msgstr "Generer en etiket med Starshipit"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:192
msgid ""
"When creating a quotation in Odoo, add the Starshipit shipping method by "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Add shipping` button."
msgstr ""
"Når der oprettes et tilbud i Odoo, tilføjes Starshipit-forsendelsesmetoden "
"ved at klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Tilføj forsendelse`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:196
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Add a shipping method` pop-up window, select a Starshipit "
"shipping method in the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` field."
msgstr ""
"I pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Tilføj en forsendelsesmetode` skal du vælge en "
"Starshipit-forsendelsesmetode i feltet :guilabel:`Forsendelsesmetode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:199
msgid ""
"If the desired service is not available, click :guilabel:`Get more delivery "
"methods`. This sends the actual order details (including the destination "
"address, weight, and volume) to Starshipit, which returns the complete list "
"of services available for that specific shipment. A new Starshipit delivery "
"method is then created automatically and selected in the :guilabel:`Shipping "
"Method` field."
msgstr ""
"Hvis den ønskede service ikke er tilgængelig, skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Få flere leveringsmetoder`. Dette sender de faktiske "
"ordredetaljer (inklusive destinationsadresse, vægt og volumen) til "
"Starshipit, som returnerer den komplette liste over tilgængelige services "
"til den specifikke forsendelse. En ny Starshipit-leveringsmetode oprettes "
"derefter automatisk og vælges i feltet :guilabel:`Forsendelsesmetode`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:204
msgid ""
"Calculate the shipping rate by clicking :guilabel:`Get rate`. Finally, "
"click :guilabel:`Add` to include the cost of shipping to the sales order "
"line, labeled as the *delivery product*."
msgstr ""
"Beregn forsendelsesraten ved at klikke på :guilabel:`Hent rate`. Klik til "
"sidst på :guilabel:`Tilføj` for at inkludere forsendelsesomkostningerne i "
"salgsordrelinjen, mærket som *leveringsproduktet*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:209
msgid ""
"Automatically calculate shipping costs for Starshipit in **both** Odoo "
"*Sales* and *eCommerce* applications."
msgstr ""
"Beregn automatisk forsendelsesomkostninger for Starshipit i **både** Odoos "
"applikationer *Salg* og *Webshop*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:216
msgid ":guilabel:`Tracking number(s)` if the selected courier supports it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sporingsnummer`, hvis den valgte fragtmand understøtter det."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Return label(s)` if the Starshipit connector is configured for "
"returns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Returetiket(ter)`, hvis Starshipit-connectoren er konfigureret "
"til returneringer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:219
msgid "Example of a shipped order in Odoo."
msgstr "Eksempel på en afsendt ordre i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:224
msgid ""
"Package weight in Odoo is calculated by adding the weights of the products "
"plus the empty package saved in the database. Ensure the correct shipping "
"option is selected, as the package weight is not automatically verified."
msgstr ""
"Pakkevægt i Odoo beregnes ved at lægge vægten af produkterne sammen med den "
"tomme pakkes vægt, der er gemt i databasen. Sørg for, at den korrekte "
"forsendelsesmulighed er valgt, da pakkevægten ikke automatisk verificeres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:228
msgid ""
"Verify the destination address, as Starshipit checks it when the order is "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Verificér destinationsadressen, da Starshipit kontrollerer den, når ordren "
"oprettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:230
msgid ""
"Finally, some couriers may require other information, such as an email "
"address or phone number. Please ensure that all necessary information are "
"set upon sending a shipping order."
