msgid "A list of all scrapped products, and their quantities, is displayed."
msgstr "En liste over alle kasserede produkter og deres mængder vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:64
msgid "List of all scrapped products in Moves History report."
msgstr "Liste over alle kasserede produkter i rapporten Bevægelseshistorik."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:68
msgid "Scrap from an existing operation"
msgstr "Vyřadit z existující operace"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:70
msgid ""
"Scrap orders (SPs) can *also* be created from existing operations, such as "
"receipts, delivery orders, and internal transfers before they are entered "
"into or removed from stock for an operation."
msgstr ""
"Příkazy k vyřazení (SP) lze *také* vytvořit z existujících operací, jako "
"jsou příjemky, dodací příkazy a interní převody, než budou pro operaci "
"zapsány do skladu nebo ze skladu odebrány."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:74
msgid ""
"To scrap a product during an operation, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Inventory app`. From the :guilabel:`Inventory Overview`, "
"click the :guilabel:`# To Process` button on an operation's task card (for "
"example, click :guilabel:`5 to Receive` on the :guilabel:`Receipts` card)."
msgstr ""
"For at kassere et produkt under en operation skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-appen`. Fra :guilabel:`Lageroversigt` skal du "
"klikke på knappen :guilabel:`# Til behandling` på en operations opgavekort "
"(klik f.eks. på :guilabel:`5 til modtagelse` på "
"kortet :guilabel:`Modtagelser`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:78
msgid "# To Receive button on Receipts task card on Inventory Overview page."
msgstr ""
"# Knappen Til modtagelse på Modtagelser-opgavekortet på siden Lageroversigt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:81
msgid ""
"Then, select an operation to process from the resulting list of existing "
"orders. Doing so opens that operation's form."
msgstr ""
"Poté vyberte operaci ke zpracování ze seznamu existujících příkazů. Tím se "
"otevře formulář příslušné operace."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:84
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(cog)` icon, and "
"select :guilabel:`Scrap` from the resulting drop-down menu. This opens "
"a :guilabel:`Scrap Products` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(tandhjul)` og "
"vælg :guilabel:`Kassation` fra den resulterende rullemenu. Dette åbner et "
"pop op-vindue til :guilabel:`Kasser produkter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:87
msgid ""
"From this pop-up window, click the drop-down menu in the :guilabel:`Product` "
"field and select the product from the operation that should be scrapped. "
"Adjust the value in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field. If "
"the :guilabel:`Product` selected is tracked using a lot or serial number, "
"a :guilabel:`Lot/Serial` field appears. Specify the tracking number in that "
"field. The :guilabel:`Source Location` and :guilabel:`Scrap Location` can be "
"changed if needed."
msgstr ""
"Fra dette pop op-vindue skal du klikke på rullemenuen i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Produkt` og vælge det produkt fra operationen, der skal "
"kasseres. Tilpas værdien i feltet :guilabel:`Antal`. Hvis det "
"valgte :guilabel:`Produkt` spores ved hjælp af et parti- eller serienummer, "
"vises feltet :guilabel:`Parti/serienummer`. Angiv sporingsnummeret i dette "
"felt. :guilabel:`Kildelokation` og :guilabel:`Skrotlokation` kan ændres "
"efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:97
msgid ""
"If a replenishment rule is set up for the product being scrapped and the "
"product should be replenished, tick the checkbox for :guilabel:`Should "
"Replenish`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der er oprettet en genopfyldningsregel for produktet, der kasseres, og "
"produktet skal genopfyldes, skal du markere feltet :guilabel:`Skal "
"genopfyldes`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:102
msgid "Scrap Products pop-up window on operation form."
msgstr "Vyskakovací okno Vyřadit produkty ve formuláři operace."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:105
msgid ""
"A :icon:`oi-arrows-v` :guilabel:`Scraps` smart button appears at the top of "
"the operation form. Click this smart button to view the details of all scrap "
"orders created from this specific operation."
msgstr ""
"En :icon:`oi-arrows-v` :guilabel:`Kasseringer`-smartknap vises øverst på "
"operationsformularen. Klik på denne smartknap for at se detaljerne for alle "
"skrotordrer, der er oprettet ud fra denne specifikke handling."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:109
msgid "Scraps smart button showing all scrap orders from operation."
msgstr ""
"Smartknap til Kassationer, der viser alle kassationsordrer fra operation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/scrap_inventory.rst:113
