#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:5
msgid ""
"A *location* is a specific space within a warehouse. This can be a shelf, "
"room, aisle, etc."
msgstr ""
"En *lokation* er et specifikt område på et lager. Dette kan være en hylde, "
"et rum, en gang osv."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:12
msgid ""
"To create specific storage locations, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Configuration --> Settings` and enable the *Storage Locations* "
"feature. In the  *Warehouse* section, select the :guilabel:`Storage "
"Locations` checkbox, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette specifikke lagerlokationer, gå til :menuselection:`Lager-app "
"--> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger` og aktiver funktionen "
"*Lagerlokationer*. I afsnittet *Lager*, markér "
"afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Lagerlokationer`, og klik derefter "
"på :guilabel:`Gem`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:17
msgid ""
"Typically, the :guilabel:`Storage Locations` feature is used "
"with :doc:`Multi-Step Routes <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"use_routes>`, which controls how products move between locations."
msgstr ""
"Obvykle se funkce :guilabel:`Skladové lokace` používá společně "
"s :doc:`Vícekrokovými trasami <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"use_routes>`, které řídí, jak se produkty pohybují mezi lokacemi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:21
msgid "Show Storage Locations feature."
msgstr "Zobrazení funkce Skladové lokace."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:27
