msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Ny` på denne side. En tom *Lokation*-formular indlæses."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:37
msgid "New location form."
msgstr "Ny lokationsformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:40
msgid "To start, enter the following details:"
msgstr "Angiv følgende oplysninger for at starte:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:42
msgid ":guilabel:`Location Name`: A recognizable name for the location."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Lokationsnavn`: Et genkendeligt navn til lokationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Parent Location`: The new location's parent location, if "
"applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Overordnet lokation`: Den nye lokations overordnede lokation, "
"hvis det er relevant."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:46
msgid ""
"In `WH/Stock/Zone A/Refrigerator 1`, `Refrigerator 1` is the location name, "
"and `Zone A` is the parent location. Both the location and the parent "
"location are organized hierarchically within `WH/Stock`."
msgstr ""
"På lokationen `WH/Stock/Zone A/Refrigerator 1` er `Refrigerator 1` "
"lokationsnavnet, og `Zone A` er den overordnede lokation. Både lokationen og "
"den overordnede lokation er organiseret hierarkisk inden for `WH/Stock`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:51
msgid "Additional Information section"
msgstr "Sekce Doplňující informace"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:53
msgid ""
"In addition to the required fields above, configure the following location "
"fields to ensure the location serves its intended purpose in the database:"
msgstr ""
"Kromě výše uvedených povinných polí nakonfigurujte následující pole lokace, "
"aby lokace sloužila svému zamýšlenému účelu v databázi:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Location Type`: From the drop-down menu, "
"select :guilabel:`Vendor`, :guilabel:`Virtual`, :guilabel:`Internal`, :guilabel:`Customer`, :guilabel:`Inventory "
"Loss`, :guilabel:`Production`, or :guilabel:`Transit` to categorize the "
"location. For details on each location type, refer to the :ref:`Location "
"Types section <inventory/warehouses_storage/location-type>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lokationstype`: "
"Vælg :guilabel:`Leverandør`, :guilabel:`Virtuel`, :guilabel:`Intern`, :guilabel:`Kunde`, :guilabel:`Lagertab`, :guilabel:`Produktion` "
"eller :guilabel:`Transit` fra rullemenuen for at kategorisere lokationen. "
"Se :ref:`afsnittet Lokationstyper <inventory/warehouses_storage/location-"
"type>` for detaljer om hver lokationstype."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Storage Category`: Select the storage category. The :doc:`Storage "
"Categories <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/storage_category>` "
"feature **must** be enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Opbevaringskategori`: Vælg opbevaringskategorien. "
"Funktionen :doc:`Opbevaringskategorier <../../shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations/storage_category>` **skal** være aktiveret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:63
msgid ":guilabel:`Company`: The company of the location."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Virksomhed`: Lokationens virksomhed."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Barcode`: Enter the barcode to :ref:`identify actions <barcode/"
"setup/location>` at this location when scanned. The **Barcode** app **must** "
"be installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Stregkode`: Indtast stregkoden for at :ref:`identificere "
"handlinger <barcode/setup/location>` på denne lokation ved scanning. "
"**Stregkode**-appen **skal** være installeret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Replenishments`: Select this checkbox to set the location as a "
"destination for receiving products from *Buy*, *Manufacture*, or "
"other :doc:`configured routes <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"use_routes>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Genopfyldninger`: Markér dette afkrydsningsfelt for at angive "
"lokationen som destination for modtagelse af produkter fra *Køb*, *Fremstil* "
"eller andre :doc:`konfigurerede ruter <../../shipping_receiving/"
"daily_operations/use_routes>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:71
msgid "Cyclic Counting section"
msgstr "Sektionen Cyklisk optælling"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:73
msgid ""
"To schedule regular inventory counts at this location, set "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory Frequency` field to the desired interval. By "
"default, it is set to `0` (no scheduled counts)."
msgstr ""
"For at planlægge regelmæssige lageroptællinger på denne lokation skal du "
"angive feltet :guilabel:`Lageroptællingsfrekvens` til det ønskede interval. "
"Som standard er det sat til `0` (ingen planlagte optællinger)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:76
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Last Inventory` field displays the date of the last inventory "
"count at this location, and **cannot** be modified. If a count has never "
"been done, this field remains blank."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`Sidste lageroptælling` viser datoen for den seneste "
"lageroptælling på denne lokation og kan **ikke** ændres. Hvis der aldrig er "
"foretaget en optælling, forbliver dette felt tomt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:79
msgid ""
"After specifying an :guilabel:`Inventory Frequency`, the :guilabel:`Next "
"Expected` field automatically displays the date of the next inventory count."
msgstr ""
"Når feltet :guilabel:`Optællingsfrekvens` er angivet, viser "
"feltet :guilabel:`Næste forventede` automatisk datoen for den næste "
"lageroptælling."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:83
msgid ""
"With inventory counts scheduled to occur every `30` days, "
"the :guilabel:`Last Inventory` count occurred on November 13, and "
"the :guilabel:`Next Expected` count is December 13."
msgstr ""
"Med lageroptællinger planlagt til at finde sted hver `30.` dag fandt "
"den :guilabel:`Sidste lageroptælling` sted den 13. november, og "
"den :guilabel:`Næste forventede` optælling er den 13. december."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/use_locations.rst:86
msgid "Show Cyclic Count section of the locations form."
msgstr "Vis sektionen Cyklisk optælling i lokationsformularen."

