msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Intrastat-region`: :doc:`regionsnavn <../../../../finance/"
"accounting/reporting/intrastat>` påkrævet for virksomheder i Den Europæiske "
"Union."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses.rst:41
