#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:55
msgid "Replenishment strategies"
msgstr "Genforsyningsstrategier"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:58
msgid "Replenishment report and reordering rules"
msgstr "Genforsyningsrapport og genbestillingsregler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:60
msgid ""
"Reordering rules are rules that can be set up to maintain a minimum stock "
"level. They are often configured to support manufacturing or sales "
"requirements. When a product's stock falls at or below the minimum level, "
"Odoo generates (or suggests) a purchase or manufacturing order to replenish "
"stock to the maximum level."
msgstr ""
"Genbestillingsregler er regler, der kan oprettes for at opretholde et "
"minimumslagerniveau. De konfigureres ofte til at understøtte produktions- "
"eller salgsbehov. Når et produkts lager falder til eller under "
"minimumsniveauet, genererer Odoo (eller foreslår) en indkøbs- eller "
"produktionsordre for at genopfylde lageret til det maksimale niveau."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:65
msgid ""
"When using automatic reordering rules, Odoo generates a new order. When "
"using manual, Odoo suggests orders on the replenishment report. For detailed "
"guidance, refer to the :doc:`replenishment report <replenishment/report>` "
"and :doc:`reordering rules <replenishment/reordering_rules>`."
msgstr ""
"Ved brug af automatiske genbestillingsregler genererer Odoo en ny ordre. Ved "
"brug af manuel foreslår Odoo ordrer i genforsyningsrapporten. For detaljeret "
"vejledning, se :doc:`genforsyningsrapport <replenishment/report>` "
"og :doc:`genbestillingsregler <replenishment/reordering_rules>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:69
msgid "Key points include:"
msgstr "Nøglepunkter inkluderer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:71
msgid ""
":ref:`Automatic reordering rules <inventory/warehouses_storage/auto-rr>`: "
"Automatically create |POs| or |MOs| when stock falls below the minimum "
"level. While this is convenient, it is less flexible."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Automatiske genbestillingsregler <inventory/warehouses_storage/auto-"
"rr>`: Opret automatisk |POs| eller |MOs|, når lagerbeholdningen falder under "
"minimumsniveauet. Selvom dette er praktisk, er det mindre fleksibelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:74
msgid ""
":ref:`Manual reordering rules <inventory/warehouses_storage/manual-rr>`: "
"Generate suggestions in the replenishment report for user review, allowing "
"adjustments and batch orders while meeting deadlines."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Manuelle genbestillingsregler <inventory/warehouses_storage/manual-"
"rr>`: Generér forslag i genopfyldningsrapporten til brugergennemgang, "
"hvilket giver mulighed for justeringer og samleordrer, samtidig med at "
"deadlines overholdes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:77
msgid ""
":doc:`Just in time logic <replenishment/just_in_time>`: A strategy to "
"replenish only what is needed to prevent overstocking."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Just-in-time logik <replenishment/just_in_time>`: En strategi til kun "
"at genbestille det nødvendige for at undgå overlagring."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:81
msgid ":doc:`replenishment/reordering_rules`"
msgstr ":doc:`replenishment/reordering_rules`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:82
msgid ":doc:`replenishment/report`"
msgstr ":doc:`replenishment/report`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:87
msgid "Make to order"
msgstr "Fremstil på ordre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:89
msgid ""
"An |MTO| strategy means that procurement or production is triggered only "
"after a sales order has been confirmed. This strategy is recommended when "
"products are customizable, demand is unpredictable, there is limited storage "
"capacity, and when products are high in value and low in demand. In such "
"cases, it does not make sense to keep on-hand inventory."
msgstr ""
"En |MTO|-strategi betyder, at indkøb eller produktion kun udløses, efter at "
"en salgsordre er blevet bekræftet. Denne strategi anbefales, når produkter "
"kan tilpasses, efterspørgslen er uforudsigelig, der er begrænset "
"lagerkapacitet, og når produkter har høj værdi og lav efterspørgsel. I "
"sådanne tilfælde giver det ikke mening at have lagerbeholdning på lager."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:94
msgid ""
"Unlike products replenished using reordering rules, Odoo automatically links "
"the sales order to the |PO| or |MO| generated by the |MTO| route."
msgstr ""
"I modsætning til produkter, der genopfyldes ved hjælp af "
"genbestillingsregler, linker Odoo automatisk salgsordren til den |PO| eller |"
"MO|, der genereres af |MTO|-ruten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:97
msgid ""
"Another difference between reordering rules and |MTO| is, with |MTO|, Odoo "
"generates a draft |PO| or |MO| immediately after the |SO| is confirmed. With "
"reordering rules, Odoo generates a draft |PO| or |MO| when the product's "
"forecasted stock falls below the set minimum quantity."
msgstr ""
"En anden forskel mellem genbestillingsregler og |MTO| er, at Odoo med |MTO| "
"genererer en udkast |PO| eller |MO| umiddelbart efter, at |SO| er bekræftet. "
"Med genbestillingsregler genererer Odoo en udkast |PO| eller |MO|, når "
"produktets forventede lagerbeholdning falder under den angivne "
"minimumskvantitet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:101
msgid ""
"In addition, Odoo automatically adds quantities to the |PO| or |MO| as the "
"forecast changes, so long as the |PO| or |MO| is not confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Derudover tilføjer Odoo automatisk kvantiteter til |PO| eller |MO|, "
"efterhånden som prognosen ændres, så længe |PO| eller |MO| ikke er bekræftet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:104
msgid ""
"The |MTO| route is the best replenishment strategy for products that are "
"customized, and/or for products that have no stock kept on-hand."
msgstr ""
"|MTO|-ruten er den bedste genopfyldningsstrategi for produkter, der "
"tilpasses, og/eller for produkter, hvor der ikke holdes lagerbeholdning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:108
msgid ":doc:`replenishment/mto`"
msgstr ":doc:`replenishment/mto`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:111
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/use_mps.rst:3
msgid "Master production schedule"
msgstr "Produktionstidsplan"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:113
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`MPS (Master Production Schedule)` is a dashboard where products "
"and their forecasted quantities are entered. Based on confirmed "
"manufacturing and purchase orders, the dashboard recommends amounts to order "
"or produce."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`MPS (Master Production Schedule)` er et dashboard, hvor produkter og "
"deres forventede kvantiteter indtastes. Baseret på bekræftede produktions- "
"og indkøbsordrer anbefaler dashboardet mængder, der skal bestilles eller "
"produceres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:117
msgid ""
"This a useful **manual** tool for keeping track of quantities. "
"The :abbr:`MPS (Master Production Schedule)` **should absolutely not** be "
"used alongside reordering rules, as the automated workflow disrupts its "
"manual replenishment method."
msgstr ""
"Dette er et nyttigt **manuelt** værktøj til at holde styr på "
"kvantiteter. :abbr:`MPS (Master Production Schedule)` **bør absolut ikke** "
"bruges sammen med genbestillingsregler, da den automatiserede arbejdsgang "
"forstyrrer dens manuelle genopfyldningsmetode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment.rst:122
msgid ":doc:`../../manufacturing/workflows/use_mps`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../manufacturing/workflows/use_mps`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:3
msgid "Just-in-time logic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:8
msgid ""
"*Just-in-time logic* in Odoo minimizes storage costs by placing orders "
"precisely to meet deadlines. This is achieved using the :ref:`forecasted "
"date <inventory/warehouses_storage/forecasted-date>`, which determines when "
"replenishment is necessary to avoid overstocking. For example, for a product "
"with a 5-day total lead time and a sales order delivery date in 10 days, "
"Odoo waits 5 days to place the order, ensuring it arrives just in time for "
"delivery."
msgstr ""
"*Just-in-time logik* i Odoo minimerer lageromkostninger ved at placere "
"ordrer præcist for at overholde deadlines. Dette opnås ved hjælp af "
"den :ref:`forventede dato <inventory/warehouses_storage/forecasted-date>`, "
"som bestemmer hvornår genbestilling er nødvendig for at undgå overlagring. "
"For eksempel vil Odoo for et produkt med en samlet leveringstid på 5 dage og "
"en leveringsdato for salgsordren om 10 dage vente 5 dage med at placere "
"ordren, hvilket sikrer at den ankommer lige til tiden til levering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:14
msgid ""
"The forecasted date is the **earliest possible date** to receive a product "
"if the replenishment process starts immediately. It is calculated by summing "
"the lead times linked to the replenishment process, such as :ref:`vendor "
"lead times <inventory/warehouses_storage/purchase-vendor-lt>` for purchases "
"or :ref:`manufacturing lead times <inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"manufacturing-lt>` for production. This works with both automatic and manual "
"reordering rules."
msgstr ""
"Den forventede dato er den **tidligst mulige dato** for at modtage et "
"produkt, hvis genopfyldningsprocessen starter øjeblikkeligt. Den beregnes "
"ved at lægge leveringstiderne sammen, der er knyttet til "
"genopfyldningsprocessen, såsom :ref:`leverandørleveringstider <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/purchase-vendor-lt>` for indkøb "
"eller :ref:`produktionsleveringstider <inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"manufacturing-lt>` for produktion. Dette fungerer med både automatiske og "
"manuelle genbestillingsregler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:21
msgid ""
"If utilizing just-in-time logic feels risky, consider adding buffer time "
"or :doc:`adjusting lead times <lead_times>` for more flexibility. While lead "
"times and just-in-time logic provide additional control, reordering rules "
"work perfectly fine without them. Keeping delivery dates on |SOs| as their "
"*creation date* ensures purchases are immediately triggered when needed."
msgstr ""
"Hvis det føles risikabelt at bruge just-in-time logik, kan du overveje at "
"tilføje buffertid eller :doc:`justere leveringstider <lead_times>` for mere "
"fleksibilitet. Selvom leveringstider og just-in-time logik giver yderligere "
"kontrol, fungerer genbestillingsregler perfekt fint uden dem. At holde "
"leveringsdatoer på |SOs| som deres *oprettelsesdato* sikrer at indkøb "
"udløses øjeblikkeligt når det er nødvendigt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:29
msgid "Forecasted date and to order quantity"
msgstr "Forventet dato og antal at bestille"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:31
msgid ""
"The *forecasted date* is the earliest receipt date for a product, if it is "
"ordered right now. It is calculated by summing the lead times linked to the "
"product's replenishment process. The total of these lead times, added to the "
"current date, determines when Odoo checks for demanded stock."
msgstr ""
"Den *forventede dato* er den tidligste modtagelsesdato for et produkt, hvis "
"det bestilles lige nu. Den beregnes ved at summere leveringstiderne knyttet "
"til produktets genopfyldningsproces. Summen af disse leveringstider, lagt "
"til den aktuelle dato, bestemmer hvornår Odoo kontrollerer for efterspurgt "
"lager."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:35
msgid ""
"To view the forecasted date go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Operations --> Replenishment` to access the :doc:`replenishment report "
"<report>`, then click the :icon:`fa-info-circle` :guilabel:`(Replenishment "
"Information)` icon for the desired reordering rule. The *Replenishment "
"Information* pop-up window displays the :guilabel:`Forecasted Date` and "
"various lead times."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:40
msgid ""
"The just-in-time logic ensures replenishment occurs only when required to "
"meet forecasted demand, reducing the risk of overstocking."
msgstr ""
"Just-in-time logikken sikrer at genbestilling kun sker når det er nødvendigt "
"for at imødekomme forventet efterspørgsel, hvilket reducerer risikoen for "
"overlagring."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:44
msgid ""
"Just-in-time logic determines the exact timing of replenishment. If you want "
"to extend this logic to also consider near-future demand beyond the forecast "
"date, see :ref:`Horizon Days <inventory/warehouses_storage/horizon-days>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:48
msgid ""
"If the forecasted quantity falls below the minimum on the forecasted date, "
"replenishment is triggered immediately to prevent shortages. If the quantity "
"falls below the minimum after the forecasted date, replenishment is deferred."
msgstr ""
"Hvis det forventede antal falder under minimumsværdien på den forventede "
"dato, udløses genbestilling øjeblikkeligt for at undgå mangel. Hvis antallet "
"falder under minimumsværdien efter den forventede dato, udskydes "
"genbestillingen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:52
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`To Order` quantity is defined as the total demand on the "
"forecasted date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Til ordre` mængden er defineret som den samlede efterspørgsel på "
"den forventede dato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:54
msgid ""
"By scheduling purchase orders according to combined lead times, Odoo "
"minimizes inventory while ensuring that future demand is met on time."
msgstr ""
"Ved at planlægge indkøbsordrer i henhold til kombinerede leveringstider "
"minimerer Odoo lagerbeholdningen samtidig med at sikre at fremtidig "
"efterspørgsel imødekommes til tiden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:58
msgid ""
"A manual reordering rule is set up with no minimum or maximum quantities."
msgstr ""
"En manuel genbestillingsregel oprettes uden minimum- eller maksimummængder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:60
msgid "Vendor lead time is 15 days, and the days to purchase is 0 days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:61
msgid "The time horizon is 7 days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:62
msgid "Today's date is October 7."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:63
msgid "These add up to 22 days, making the forecasted date October 28."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:65
msgid ""
"A confirmed |SO| for 200 units has a delivery date of October 13 (6 days "
"from today). This demand will appear on the replenishment report today in "
"the :guilabel:`To Order` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:68
msgid ""
"However, if the delivery date were later than October 28, it would not yet "
"appear on the report. Odoo only displays quantities to replenish when they "
"fall within the forecasted date window, ensuring orders are placed precisely "
"when needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:72
msgid "Show forecasted date in Odoo."
msgstr "Vis forventet dato i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:76
msgid ""
"|SOs| scheduled after the :guilabel:`Forecasted Date` are not included in "
"the :guilabel:`Forecast` quantities of a reordering rule. However, they do "
"appear in the forecasted report, since it reflects the long-term forecasted "
"quantity. To access the forecasted report, click :icon:`fa-area-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(area chart)` icon on the replenishment report."
msgstr ""
"|SOs| planlagt efter :guilabel:`Forventet dato` er ikke inkluderet "
"i :guilabel:`Prognose` mængderne for en genbestillingsregel. De vises dog i "
"prognoserapporten, da den afspejler den langsigtede forventede mængde. For "
"at tilgå prognoserapporten klik på :icon:`fa-area-"
"chart` :guilabel:`(områdediagram)` ikonet på genbestillingsrapporten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:82
msgid ":doc:`Reordering Rules <reordering_rules>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Genbestillingsregler <reordering_rules>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:83
msgid ":doc:`Replenishment Report <report>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Genbestillingsrapport <report>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/just_in_time.rst:84
msgid ":doc:`Lead Times <lead_times>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Leveringstider <lead_times>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:3
msgid "Lead times"
msgstr "Leveringstider"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:13
msgid ""
"Accurate delivery date forecasting is essential for customer satisfaction. "
"The **Inventory** app provides comprehensive lead time configuration "
"settings to improve the coordination and planning of manufacturing orders, "
"deliveries, and receipts."
msgstr ""
"Nøjagtig prognose for leveringsdato er afgørende for kundetilfredshed. "
"**Lager**-appen giver omfattende konfigurationsindstillinger for "
"leveringstider til at forbedre koordinering og planlægning af "
"produktionsordrer, leveringer og modtagelser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:18
msgid "Types of lead times"
msgstr "Typer af leveringstider"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:20
msgid ""
"Different lead times for different operations can impact various stages of "
"the order fulfillment process. The following lead times can be configured in "
"Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"Forskellige leveringstider for forskellige operationer kan påvirke "
"forskellige stadier af ordreafviklingsprocessen. Følgende leveringstider kan "
"konfigureres i Odoo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:23
msgid ""
"A diagram breaking down the different types of lead times in the fulfillment "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Et diagram, der opdeler de forskellige typer af leveringstider i "
"opfyldelsesprocessen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:26
msgid ""
":ref:`Delivery time <inventory/warehouses_storage/sales-delivery-time-lt>`: "
"The number of days from the sales order (SO) confirmation date and the date "
"the order is shipped from the warehouse. This is the expected time frame for "
"customer order fulfillment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:30
msgid ""
":ref:`Sales security lead time <inventory/warehouses_storage/sales-security-"
"lt>`: Moves the *scheduled delivery date* forward by a specified number of "
"days. This serves as a buffer to account for potential delays in the "
"fulfillment process and ensures ample time to prepare the outgoing shipment."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Salgssikkerhedsleveringstid <inventory/warehouses_storage/sales-"
"security-lt>`: Flytter den *planlagte leveringsdato* fremad med et angivet "
"antal dage. Dette fungerer som en buffer til at tage højde for potentielle "
"forsinkelser i opfyldelsesprocessen og sikrer rigelig tid til at forberede "
"den udgående forsendelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:35
msgid ""
":ref:`Shipping policy lead time <inventory/warehouses_storage/sales-shipping-"
"policy-lt>`: The shipping policy lead time determines how the scheduled "
"delivery date is set for orders with multiple products, based on the lead "
"times of the products in the order. This provides flexibility to choose "
"between multiple shipments delivered as soon as products are ready, or one "
"consolidated shipment when all products are ready."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Forsendelsespolitik leveringstid <inventory/warehouses_storage/sales-"
"shipping-policy-lt>`: Forsendelsespolitikkens leveringstid bestemmer, "
"hvordan den planlagte leveringsdato sættes for ordrer med flere produkter, "
"baseret på leveringstiderne for produkterne i ordren. Dette giver "
"fleksibilitet til at vælge mellem flere forsendelser leveret, så snart "
"produkterne er klar, eller én konsolideret forsendelse, når alle produkter "
"er klar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:41
msgid ""
":ref:`Manufacturing lead time <inventory/warehouses_storage/manufacturing-"
"lt>`: The number of days needed to complete a manufacturing order (MO) from "
"the date of confirmation, including weekends (non-working hours in Odoo). "
"This is used to forecast an approximate production date for a finished good."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Produktionsleveringstid <inventory/warehouses_storage/manufacturing-"
"lt>`: Antallet af dage, der er nødvendige for at fuldføre en "
"produktionsordre (MO) fra bekræftelsesdatoen, inklusive weekender (ikke-"
"arbejdstimer i Odoo). Dette bruges til at forudsige en omtrentlig "
"produktionsdato for et færdigt produkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:46
msgid ""
":ref:`Days to prepare manufacturing order <inventory/warehouses_storage/days-"
"to-prepare-mo-lt>`: The number of days needed to replenish components, or "
"manufacture sub-assemblies of the product. Either set one directly on the "
"bill of materials (BoM), or click *Compute* to sum up purchase and "
"manufacturing lead times of components in the |BoM|."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Dage til forberedelse af produktionsordre <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/days-to-prepare-mo-lt>`: Antallet af dage, der er "
"nødvendige for at genopfylde komponenter eller producere undermontager af "
"produktet. Angiv enten én direkte på styklisten (BoM), eller klik på "
"*Beregn* for at summere indkøbs- og produktionsleveringstider for "
"komponenter i |BoM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:51
msgid ""
":ref:`Vendor lead time <inventory/warehouses_storage/purchase-vendor-lt>`: "
"The number of days from the confirmation of a purchase order (PO) to the "
"receipt of products. This provides insight on the time it takes for products "
"to arrive at the warehouse, facilitating effective scheduling and planning "
"of supplier deliveries."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Leverandørleveringstid <inventory/warehouses_storage/purchase-vendor-"
"lt>`: Antallet af dage fra bekræftelsen af en indkøbsordre (PO) til "
"modtagelsen af produkter. Dette giver indsigt i den tid, det tager for "
"produkter at ankomme til lageret, hvilket letter effektiv planlægning af "
"leverandørleverancer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:56
msgid ""
":ref:`Days to purchase <inventory/warehouses_storage/days-to-purchase-lt>`: "
"The number of days needed for the vendor to receive a request for quotation "
"(RFQ) and confirm it. This advances the deadline to schedule a |RFQ| by a "
"specified number of days."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Dage til indkøb <inventory/warehouses_storage/days-to-purchase-lt>`: "
"Antallet af dage, der er nødvendige for, at leverandøren modtager en "
"tilbudsanmodning (RFQ) og bekræfter den. Dette rykker deadline for at "
"planlægge en |RFQ| fremad med et angivet antal dage."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:61
msgid ""
"Lead times are calculated in the order provided above, working backward from "
"the delivery deadline using :doc:`just-in-time (JIT) logic <just_in_time>`."
msgstr ""
"Leveringstider beregnes i den rækkefølge, der er angivet ovenfor, og "
"arbejder baglæns fra leveringsdeadline ved hjælp af :doc:`just-in-time (JIT) "
"logik <just_in_time>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:64
msgid ""
"The manual replenishment timeline can be further extended by increasing the "
"forecasted date on the replenishment report. See :ref:`horizon days "
"<inventory/warehouses_storage/horizon-days>` to learn more."
msgstr ""
"Tidslinjen for manuel genopfyldning kan udvides yderligere ved at øge den "
"forventede dato i genopfyldningsrapporten. Se :ref:`horisontdage <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/horizon-days>` for at lære mere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:71
msgid "Sales lead times"
msgstr "Salgsleveringstider"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:73
msgid ""
"*Delivery times* and *sales security lead times* can be configured to "
"automatically compute an *expected delivery date* on a :abbr:`SO (Sales "
"Order)`. The expected delivery date ensures a realistic *delivery dates* "
"setting for shipments from the warehouse."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:77
msgid ""
"Odoo issues a warning message if the set delivery date is earlier than the "
"expected date, as it may not be feasible to fulfill the order by that time, "
"which would impact other warehouse operations."
msgstr ""
"Odoo udsteder en advarselsmeddelelse, hvis den angivne leveringsdato er "
"tidligere end den forventede dato, da det muligvis ikke er muligt at opfylde "
"ordren inden da, hvilket ville påvirke andre lageroperationer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:81
msgid ""
"A :abbr:`SO (sales order)` containing a `Coconut-scented candle` is "
"confirmed on March 4. The product has a delivery time of 14 days, and the "
"business uses a sales security lead time of 1 day. Based on the lead time "
"inputs, Odoo suggests a delivery date in 15 days, on March 19."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:85
msgid ""
"Set Delivery Date in a sales order. Enables delivery lead times feature."
msgstr ""
"Angiv leveringsdato i en salgsordre. Aktiverer funktionen leveringstider."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:91
msgid "Delivery time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:93
msgid ""
"The *delivery time* is manually assigned for each individual product. To set "
"the delivery time for a product, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Products --> Products`. Select the desired product, and switch to "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab. In the :guilabel:`Delivery Time` field, enter "
"the number of calendar days required to fulfill the delivery order from "
"start to finish."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:99
msgid ""
"Set a 14-day delivery time for the `Coconut-scented candle` by navigating to "
"its product form. Then, in the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab, type `14.00` days "
"into the :guilabel:`Delivery Time` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:103
msgid "Assign a Delivery Time in the product form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:109
msgid "Sales security lead time"
msgstr "Salgssikkerhedsleveringstid"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:111
msgid ""
"The *sales security lead time* applies to all sales orders for the company. "
"To set the sales security lead time, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`Advanced Scheduling` section near the end of the page. Check "
"the box for :guilabel:`Security Lead Time for Sales` to enable the feature."
msgstr ""
"Sikkerhedsleveringstiden for salg gælder for alle salgsordrer for "
"virksomheden. For at indstille sikkerhedsleveringstiden for salg skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger` og rulle "
"ned til afsnittet :guilabel:`Avanceret planlægning` nær slutningen af siden. "
"Markér feltet for :guilabel:`Sikkerhedsleveringstid for salg` for at "
"aktivere funktionen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:116
msgid ""
"Next, enter the desired number of calendar days. This security lead time is "
"a buffer notifying the team to prepare for outgoing shipments earlier than "
"the scheduled date."
msgstr ""
"Indtast derefter det ønskede antal kalenderdage. Denne "
"sikkerhedsleveringstid er en buffer, der underretter teamet om at forberede "
"udgående forsendelser tidligere end den planlagte dato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:120
msgid ""
"Setting the :guilabel:`Security Lead Time for Sales` to `1.00` day, pushes "
"the :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` of a delivery order (DO) forward by one day. "
"In that case, if a product is initially scheduled for delivery on April 6th, "
"but with a one-day security lead time, the new scheduled date for the "
"delivery order would be April 5th."
msgstr ""
"Nastavení :guilabel:`Bezpečnostní dodací lhůta pro prodej` na `1,00` den "
"posune :guilabel:`Plánované datum` dodací objednávky (DO) dopředu o jeden "
"den. V tomto případě, pokud je produkt původně naplánován k dodání 6. dubna, "
"ale s jednodenní bezpečnostní dodací lhůtou, bude nové plánované datum "
"dodací objednávky 5. dubna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:125
msgid ""
"View of the security lead time for sales configuration from the sales "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazení konfigurace bezpečnostní dodací lhůty pro prodej v nastavení "
"prodeje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:131
msgid "Shipping policy"
msgstr "Forsendelsespolitik"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:133
msgid ""
"For orders that include multiple products with different lead times, the "
"lead times can be configured directly from the quotation itself. On a "
"quotation, click the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab and set "
"the :guilabel:`Shipping Policy` field."
msgstr ""
"For ordrer, der inkluderer flere produkter med forskellige leveringstider, "
"kan leveringstiderne konfigureres direkte fra selve tilbuddet. På et tilbud "
"skal du klikke på fanen :guilabel:`Anden info` og indstille "
"feltet :guilabel:`Forsendelsespolitik`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`As soon as possible`: Deliver products as soon as they are ready. "
"The :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` of the :abbr:`DO (Delivery Order)` is "
"determined by adding today's date to the shortest lead time among the "
"products in the order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Så hurtigt som muligt`: Lever produkter, så snart de er klar. "
"Den :guilabel:`planlagte dato` for :abbr:`DO (leveringsordre)` bestemmes ved "
"at lægge dags dato til den korteste leveringstid blandt produkterne i ordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:141
msgid ""
":guilabel:`When all products are ready` to wait to fulfill the entire order "
"at once. The :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` of the :abbr:`DO (Delivery Order)` "
"is determined by adding today's date to the longest lead time among the "
"products in the order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Když jsou všechny produkty připraveny` čekat na splnění celé "
"objednávky najednou. :guilabel:`Plánované datum` :abbr:`DO (dodací "
"objednávky)` je určeno přičtením dnešního data k nejdelší dodací lhůtě mezi "
"produkty v objednávce."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:145
msgid "Show *Shipping Policy* field in the *Other Info* tab of a quotation."
msgstr "Zobrazení pole *Způsob dodání* na kartě *Další informace* v nabídce."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:149
msgid ""
"In a quotation containing 2 products, `Yoga mat` and `Resistance band,` the "
"products have a lead time of 8 days and 5 days, respectively. Today's date "
"is April 2nd."
msgstr ""
"V nabídce obsahující 2 produkty, `Podložka na jógu` a `Odporová guma,` mají "
"produkty dodací lhůtu 8 dní a 5 dní. Dnešní datum je 2. dubna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:152
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Shipping Policy` is set to :guilabel:`As soon as "
"possible`, the scheduled delivery date is 5 days from today: April 7th. On "
"the other hand, selecting :guilabel:`When all products are ready` configures "
"the scheduled date to be 8 days from today: April 10th."
msgstr ""
"Když je :guilabel:`Způsob dodání` nastaven na :guilabel:`Co nejdříve`, je "
"plánované datum dodání 5 dní od dneška: 7. dubna. Na druhou stranu, "
"výběr :guilabel:`Když jsou všechny produkty připraveny` konfiguruje "
"plánované datum na 8 dní od dneška: 10. dubna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:159
msgid "Manufacturing lead times"
msgstr "Produktionsleveringstider"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:161
msgid ""
"Lead times can help simplify the procurement process for consumable "
"materials and components used in manufactured products with bills of "
"materials (BoMs)."
msgstr ""
"Leveringstider kan hjælpe med at forenkle indkøbsprocessen for "
"forbrugsmaterialer og komponenter, der bruges i producerede produkter med "
"styklister."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:164
msgid ""
"The |MO| deadline, which is the deadline to begin the manufacturing process "
"to complete the product by the scheduled delivery date, can be determined by "
"configuring the manufacturing lead times and manufacturing security lead "
"times."
msgstr ""
"Fristen for |MO|, som er fristen for at begynde produktionsprocessen for at "
"færdiggøre produktet inden den planlagte leveringsdato, kan bestemmes ved at "
"konfigurere produktionsleveringstider og produktionssikkerhedsleveringstider."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:168
msgid ""
"Visualization of the determination of planned MO date manufacturing lead "
"times."
msgstr ""
"Visualisering af bestemmelsen af planlagt produktionsordredato "
"produktionsleveringstider."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:174
msgid "Manufacturing lead time"
msgstr "Produktionsleveringstid"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:176
msgid ""
"Manufacturing lead times for products are configured from a product's bill "
"of materials (BoM) form."
msgstr ""
"Produktionsleveringstider for produkter konfigureres fra et produkts "
"styklisteformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:178
msgid ""
"To add a lead time to a |BoM|, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app "
"--> Products --> Bills of Materials`, and select the desired |BoM| to edit."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje en leveringstid til en |BoM|, naviger "
"til :menuselection:`Produktion-app --> Produkter --> Styklister`, og vælg "
"den ønskede |BoM| til redigering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:181
msgid ""
"On the |BoM| form, click the :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` tab. Change the value "
"(in days) in the :guilabel:`Manuf. Lead Time` field to specify the calendar "
"days needed to manufacture the product."
msgstr ""
"På |BoM|-formularen, klik på fanen :guilabel:`Diverse`. Ændr værdien (i "
"dage) i feltet :guilabel:`Produktionsleveringstid` for at angive de "
"kalenderdage, der er nødvendige for at producere produktet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:184
msgid "Manuf. Lead Time value specified on a product's Bill of Material form."
msgstr ""
"Værdien for produktionsleveringstid angivet på et produkts styklisteformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:188
msgid ""
"If the selected |BoM| is a multi-level |BoM|, the manufacturing lead times "
"of the components are added."
msgstr ""
"Hvis den valgte |BoM| er en flerniveau |BoM|, lægges "
"produktionsleveringstiderne for komponenterne sammen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:191
msgid ""
"If the |BoM| product is subcontracted, the :guilabel:`Manuf. Lead Time` can "
"be used to determine the date at which components should be sent to the "
"subcontractor."
msgstr ""
"Hvis |BoM|-produktet er underleverandørarbejde, "
"kan :guilabel:`Produktionsleveringstid` bruges til at bestemme datoen, hvor "
"komponenter skal sendes til underleverandøren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:194
msgid ""
"Establish a |MO| deadline, based on the *expected delivery date*, indicated "
"in the :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` field of the :abbr:`DO (Delivery Order)`."
msgstr ""
"Fastlæg en |MO|-frist, baseret på den *forventede leveringsdato*, angivet i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Planlagt dato` på :abbr:`leveringsordre`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:197
msgid ""
"The |MO| deadline, which is the :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` field on the |"
"MO|, is calculated as the *expected delivery date* subtracted by the "
"manufacturing lead time."
msgstr ""
"|MO|-fristen, som er feltet :guilabel:`Planlagt dato` på |MO|, beregnes som "
"den *forventede leveringsdato* fratrukket produktionsleveringstiden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:200
msgid ""
"This ensures the manufacturing process begins on time, in order to meet the "
"delivery date."
msgstr ""
"Dette sikrer, at produktionsprocessen begynder til tiden for at overholde "
"leveringsdatoen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:202
msgid ""
"However, it is important to note that lead times are based on calendar days. "
"Lead times do **not** consider weekends, holidays, or *work center capacity* "
"(:dfn:`the number of operations that can be performed at the work center "
"simultaneously`)."
msgstr ""
"Det er dog vigtigt at bemærke, at leveringstider er baseret på kalenderdage. "
"Leveringstider tager **ikke** hensyn til weekender, helligdage eller "
"*arbejdscenterkapacitet* (:dfn:`antallet af operationer, der kan udføres på "
"arbejdscentret samtidig`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:207
msgid ""
":doc:`Manufacturing planning <../../../manufacturing/workflows/use_mps>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Produktionsplanlægning <../../../manufacturing/workflows/use_mps>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:208
msgid ":doc:`Schedule MOs with reordering rules <reordering_rules>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Planlæg produktionsordrer med genbestillingsregler <reordering_rules>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:211
msgid ""
"A product's scheduled shipment date on the :abbr:`DO (Delivery Order)` is "
"August 15th. The product requires 14 days to manufacture. So, the latest "
"date to start the :abbr:`MO (Manufacturing Order)` to meet the commitment "
"date is August 1st."
msgstr ""
"Et produkts planlagte forsendelsesdato på :abbr:`leveringsordren` er 15. "
"august. Produktet kræver 14 dage at producere. Så den seneste dato for at "
"starte :abbr:`produktionsordren` for at overholde forpligtelsesdatoen er 1. "
"august."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:218
msgid "Days to prepare manufacturing order"
msgstr "Dage til at forberede produktionsordre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:220
msgid ""
"Configuring the days required to gather the components for a manufactured "
"product ensures there is enough time to either replenish components or "
"manufacture semi-finished products. This can be used as an extra figure to "
"cross-check and confirm that the order can be completed within the delivery "
"time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:225
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Bills of Materials` "
"and select the desired |BoM|. In the :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` tab of the |"
"BoM|, specify the calendar days needed to obtain components of the product "
"in the :guilabel:`Days to prepare Manufacturing Order` field, or "
"click :guilabel:`Compute` next to the :guilabel:`Days to prepare "
"Manufacturing Order` field to automatically fill in the longest lead time "
"among all the components listed on the |BoM|."
msgstr ""
"Gå til :menuselection:`Produktion-app --> Produkter --> Styklister` og vælg "
"den ønskede |BoM|. I fanen :guilabel:`Diverse` på |BoM| skal du angive de "
"kalenderdage, der er nødvendige for at skaffe komponenterne til produktet i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Dage til forberedelse af produktionsordre`, eller klik "
"på :guilabel:`Beregn` ved siden af feltet :guilabel:`Dage til forberedelse "
"af produktionsordre` for automatisk at udfylde den længste leveringstid "
"blandt alle de komponenter, der er opført på |BoM|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:232
msgid ""
"A |BoM| has two components: one has a manufacturing lead time of two days, "
"and the other has a purchase lead time of four days. The :guilabel:`Days to "
"prepare Manufacturing Order` is four days."
msgstr ""
"En |BoM| har to komponenter: den ene har en produktionsleveringstid på to "
"dage, og den anden har en indkøbsleveringstid på fire dage. :guilabel:`Dage "
"til forberedelse af produktionsordre` er fire dage."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:239
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:264
msgid "Purchase lead times"
msgstr "Nákupní dodací lhůty"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:241
msgid ""
"Automatically scheduling supplier orders streamlines procurement by showing "
"users exactly when to confirm a request for quotation (RFQ) and when to "
"expect the goods."
msgstr ""
"Automatické plánování objednávek dodavatelů zjednodušuje nákup tím, že "
"uživatelům ukazuje přesně, kdy potvrdit poptávku (RFQ) a kdy očekávat zboží."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:244
msgid "Key dates on an RFQ / PO"
msgstr "Klíčová data na RFQ / PO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:248
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Felt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:250
msgid "Order Deadline"
msgstr "Deadline for bestilling"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:251
msgid "Last calendar day to confirm the |RFQ| and convert it to a |PO|"
msgstr "Poslední kalendářní den pro potvrzení |RFQ| a převedení na |PO|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:252
msgid "Expected Arrival"
msgstr "Forventet leveringsdato"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:253
msgid ""
"Arrival date of the products. Calculated by *Order Deadline* + *Vendor Lead "
"Time*"
msgstr ""
"Datum příjezdu produktů. Vypočítá se jako *Termín objednávky* + *Dodací "
"lhůta dodavatele*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:256
msgid ""
"A |PO| is marked late if the *Expected Arrival* date has passed. Late |POs| "
"appear in the *Late* box on the **Purchase** app's dashboard."
msgstr ""
"En |PO| er markeret som forsinket, hvis datoen for *forventet ankomst* er "
"overskredet. Forsinkede |POs| vises i boksen *Forsinket* på dashboardet i "
"**Indkøb**-appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:259
msgid ""
"In addition, Odoo has purchase lead times, which act as buffers to widen "
"the :doc:`just-in-time <just_in_time>` (JIT) forecast window. These lead "
"times affect replenishment methods that use :doc:`pull rules <../../"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes>`—for "
"example :doc:`reordering rules <reordering_rules>` or :doc:`make to order "
"(MTO) <mto>`."
msgstr ""
"Derudover har Odoo indkøbsleveringstider, som fungerer som buffere til at "
"udvide :doc:`just-in-time <just_in_time>` (JIT) prognosevinduet. Disse "
"leveringstider påvirker genopfyldningsmetoder, der bruger :doc:`pull-regler "
"<../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes>`—for "
"eksempel :doc:`genbestillingsregler <reordering_rules>` eller :doc:`fremstil "
"til ordre (MTO) <mto>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:268
msgid "Buffer"
msgstr "Buffer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:270
msgid "Impact on dates"
msgstr "Dopad na data"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:271
msgid ""
":ref:`Days to purchase <inventory/warehouses_storage/days-to-purchase-lt>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Dage til indkøb <inventory/warehouses_storage/days-to-purchase-lt>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:272
msgid "Days the vendor needs to review an |RFQ| after it is sent."
msgstr "Dny, které dodavatel potřebuje ke kontrole |RFQ| po jeho odeslání."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:273
msgid ""
"No effect on the |RFQ|/|PO|; adds buffer days in the :ref:`JIT forecast "
"window <inventory/warehouses_storage/forecasted-date>`."
msgstr ""
"Ingen effekt på |RFQ|/|PO|; tilføjer bufferdage i :ref:`JIT-prognosevinduet "
"<inventory/warehouses_storage/forecasted-date>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:275
msgid ""
":ref:`Vendor lead time <inventory/warehouses_storage/purchase-vendor-lt>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Leverandørens leveringstid <inventory/warehouses_storage/purchase-"
"vendor-lt>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:276
msgid ""
"Days from the confirmation of a purchase order (PO) to the receipt of "
"products."
msgstr ""
"Dage fra bekræftelsen af en indkøbsordre (PO) til modtagelsen af produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:277
msgid ""
"Affects the |RFQ|/|PO|, adds buffer days in the :ref:`JIT forecast window "
"<inventory/warehouses_storage/forecasted-date>`."
msgstr ""
"Påvirker |RFQ|/|PO|, tilføjer bufferdage i :ref:`JIT-prognosevinduet "
"<inventory/warehouses_storage/forecasted-date>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:280
msgid ""
"Timeline of days to purchase and vendor lead time between the PO deadline "
"and receipt date."
msgstr ""
"Tidslinje over dage til indkøb og leverandørens leveringstid mellem "
"indkøbsordredeadline og modtagelsesdato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:284
msgid "To tie the purchase dates and lead times together, consider this:"
msgstr "For at forbinde indkøbsdatoer og leveringstider, overvej følgende:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:286
msgid "*Today's date*: April 21"
msgstr "*Dags dato*: 21. april"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:287
msgid ":guilabel:`Vendor Lead Time`: 1 day"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Dodací lhůta dodavatele`: 1 den"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:288
msgid ":guilabel:`Days to Purchase`: 2 days"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Dny do nákupu`: 2 dny"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:290
msgid "Days from today = 1 + 2 = 3"
msgstr "Dage fra i dag = 1 + 2 = 3"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:292
msgid "Forecasted date = April 24"
msgstr "Forventet dato = 24. april"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:295
msgid "If an |RFQ| is created today, the following fields show:"
msgstr "Pokud je |RFQ| vytvořena dnes, následující pole zobrazují:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:297
msgid ":guilabel:`Order Deadline`: April 23 (:math:`\\text{Today} + 2`)"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Termín objednávky`: 23. dubna (:math:`\\text{Dnes} + 2`)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:298
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Arrival`: April 24 (:math:`\\text{Order Deadline} + 1`)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Očekávaný příjezd`: 24. dubna (:math:`\\text{Termín objednávky} + "
"1`)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:303
msgid "Vendor lead time"
msgstr "Dodací lhůta dodavatele"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:305
msgid ""
"To set a vendor lead time for orders arriving in the warehouse from a vendor "
"location, navigate to :menuselection:`Purchase app --> Products --> "
"Products`. Select the desired product, and switch to "
"the :guilabel:`Purchase` tab. In the editable vendor :guilabel:`Purchase` "
"tab to add a pricelist. Click the :guilabel:`Add a line` button to add "
"vendor details, such as the :guilabel:`Vendor` name, :guilabel:`Unit Price` "
"offered for the product, and lastly, the :guilabel:`Lead Time`."
msgstr ""
"For at indstille en leverandørers leveringstid for ordrer, der ankommer til "
"lageret fra en leverandørlokation, naviger til :menuselection:`Indkøb-app --"
"> Produkter --> Produkter`. Vælg det ønskede produkt og skift til "
"fanen :guilabel:`Indkøb`. I den redigerbare "
"leverandørfane :guilabel:`Indkøb` tilføjes en prisliste. Klik på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Tilføj en linje` for at tilføje leverandøroplysninger, "
"såsom :guilabel:`Leverandør`navn, :guilabel:`Enhedspris` tilbudt for "
"produktet, og endelig :guilabel:`Leveringstid`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:312
msgid ""
"Multiple vendors and lead times can be added to the vendor pricelist. The "
"default vendor and lead time selected is the entry at the top of the list."
msgstr ""
"Do ceníku dodavatele lze přidat více dodavatelů a dodacích lhůt. Výchozí "
"dodavatel a dodací lhůta vybraná je položka v horní části seznamu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:316
msgid ""
"On the vendor pricelist of the product form, the :guilabel:`Lead Time` for "
"the selected vendor is set to `10 days.`"
msgstr ""
"På leverandørprislisten på produktformularen er :guilabel:`Leveringstid` for "
"den valgte leverandør indstillet til `10 dage.`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:319
msgid "Add lead times in the Purchase tab of a product form."
msgstr "Tilføj leveringstider i fanen Indkøb på en produktformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:325
msgid "Days to purchase"
msgstr "Dage til indkøb"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:327
msgid ""
"*Days to purchase* affects **only** replenishment methods that "
"use :doc:`pull rules <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes>`—"
"for example :doc:`reordering rules <reordering_rules>` or :doc:`make to "
"order (MTO) <mto>`. It does not change the interval between *Order Deadline* "
"and *Expected Arrival*."
msgstr ""
"*Dage til indkøb* påvirker **kun** genopfyldningsmetoder, der "
"bruger :doc:`pull-regler <../../shipping_receiving/daily_operations/"
"use_routes>`—for eksempel :doc:`genbestillingsregler <reordering_rules>` "
"eller :doc:`fremstil til ordre (MTO) <mto>`. Det ændrer ikke intervallet "
"mellem *Ordredeadline* og *Forventet ankomst*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:332
msgid ""
"To set it up, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Advanced Scheduling` section, in "
"the :guilabel:`Days to Purchase` field, specify the number of days required "
"for the vendor to confirm a |RFQ| after receiving it from the company."
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere det, gå til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Konfiguration --"
"> Indstillinger`. Under afsnittet :guilabel:`Avanceret planlægning`, i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Dage til indkøb`, angiv antallet af dage, der kræves for, "
"at leverandøren kan bekræfte en |RFQ|, efter at have modtaget den fra "
"virksomheden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:339
msgid "Global example"
msgstr "Globalt eksempel"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:341
msgid ""
"See the following example to understand how all the lead times work together "
"to ensure timely order fulfillment:"
msgstr ""
"Se følgende eksempel for at forstå, hvordan alle leveringstider arbejder "
"sammen for at sikre rettidig ordreeksekvering:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:344
msgid "**Sales security lead time**: 1 day"
msgstr "**Salgssikkerhedsledetid**: 1 dag"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:345
msgid "**Manufacturing lead time**: 3 days"
msgstr "**Produktionsledetid**: 3 dage"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:346
msgid "**Vendor lead time**: 4 days"
msgstr "**Leverandørens leveringstid**: 4 dage"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:347
msgid "**Days to purchase**: 1 day"
msgstr "**Dage til indkøb**: 1 dag"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:349
msgid ""
"The customer places an order for a manufactured product on August 1, and the "
"scheduled delivery date from the warehouse is on August 11. Odoo uses lead "
"times and automated reordering rules to schedule the necessary operations, "
"based on the outgoing shipment delivery date of August 11:"
msgstr ""
"Kunden afgiver en ordre på et fremstillet produkt den 1. august, og den "
"planlagte leveringsdato fra lageret er den 11. august. Odoo bruger "
"leveringstider og automatiske genbestillingsregler til at planlægge de "
"nødvendige operationer baseret på leveringsdatoen for udgående forsendelse "
"den 11. august:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:353
msgid ""
"Show timeline of how lead times work together to schedule warehouse "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"Vis tidslinje over, hvordan leveringstider arbejder sammen for at planlægge "
"lageroperationer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:356
msgid "**August 1**: Sales order created, confirmed by salesperson."
msgstr "**1. august**: Salgsordre oprettet, bekræftet af sælger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:358
msgid ""
"**August 2**: Deadline to order components to ensure they arrive in time "
"when manufacturing begins (4-day supplier lead time)."
msgstr ""
"**2. august**: Deadline for at bestille komponenter for at sikre, at de "
"ankommer i tide, når produktionen begynder (4 dages leverandørers "
"leveringstid)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:361
msgid "**August 7**: Scheduled date of receipt for components."
msgstr "**7. august**: Planlagt modtagelsesdato for komponenter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:363
msgid ""
"**August 7**: Deadline to begin manufacturing. Calculated by subtracting the "
"manufacturing lead time of 3 days from the expected delivery date of August "
"10."
msgstr ""
"**7. august**: Deadline for at påbegynde produktion. Beregnet ved at trække "
"produktionens leveringstid på 3 dage fra den forventede leveringsdato den "
"10. august."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:366
msgid ""
"**August 10**: :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` on the delivery order form "
"indicates the updated expected delivery date. Originally set as August 11, "
"but the sales security lead time pushes the date forward by a day."
msgstr ""
"**10. august**: :guilabel:`Planlagt dato` på leveringsordreformularen "
"angiver den opdaterede forventede leveringsdato. Oprindeligt sat til 11. "
"august, men salgsikkerhedsleveringstiden rykker datoen frem med en dag."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/lead_times.rst:370
msgid ""
"Odoo's replenishment planning maps a business' order fulfillment process, "
"setting pre-determined deadlines and raw material order dates, including "
"buffer days for potential delays. This ensures products are delivered on "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Odoos genopfyldningsplanlægning kortlægger en virksomheds "
"ordreeksekveringsproces ved at fastsætte forudbestemte deadlines og "
"bestillingsdatoer for råvarer, inklusive bufferdage for potentielle "
"forsinkelser. Dette sikrer, at produkter leveres til tiden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:3
msgid "Replenish on order (MTO)"
msgstr "Genopfyld ved bestilling (MTO)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:13
msgid ""
"*Replenish on order*, also known as *MTO* (make to order), is a "
"replenishment strategy that automatically triggers a purchase order (PO) or "
"a manufacturing order (MO) for a product only when a sales order (SO) is "
"confirmed."
msgstr ""
"*Genbestil ved ordre*, også kendt som *MTO* (make to order), er en "
"genbestillingsstrategi, der automatisk udløser en indkøbsordre (IO) eller en "
"produktionsordre (PO), når en salgsordre (SO) bekræftes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:17
msgid ""
"For :doc:`purchased products <../../../purchase/manage_deals/rfq>`, Odoo "
"creates an |RFQ|."
msgstr ""
"For :doc:`købte produkter <../../../purchase/manage_deals/rfq>` opretter "
"Odoo en |RFQ|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:18
msgid ""
"For :doc:`manufactured products <../../../manufacturing/basic_setup/"
"configure_manufacturing_product>`, it creates an |MO|."
msgstr ""
"For :doc:`fremstillede produkter <../../../manufacturing/basic_setup/"
"configure_manufacturing_product>` opretter den en |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:21
msgid ""
"The |RFQ| or |MO| is then linked to the source |SO| and accessible through a "
"smart button, allowing users to directly trace the replenishment order back "
"to the original customer demand."
msgstr ""
"|RFQ| eller |MO| er derefter linket til kilde-|SO| og tilgængelig via en "
"smart-knap, hvilket gør det muligt for brugerne direkte at spore "
"genbestillingsordren tilbage til det oprindelige kundebehov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:25
msgid ""
"The |RFQ| or |MO| generated by |MTO| is designed to fulfill the source |SO|. "
"This document should normally be confirmed or adjusted rather than canceled. "
"If the |RFQ| or |MO| is canceled, Odoo does not automatically generate a "
"replacement. A new replenishment document may be created manually, but it "
"**cannot** be linked back to the original |SO| through the smart button. "
"Instead, if the demand changes, update the document instead of canceling it."
msgstr ""
"|RFQ| eller |MO| genereret af |MTO| er designet til at opfylde kilde-|SO|. "
"Dette dokument skal normalt bekræftes eller justeres i stedet for at blive "
"annulleret. Hvis |RFQ| eller |MO| annulleres, genererer Odoo ikke automatisk "
"en erstatning. Et nyt genbestillingsdokument kan oprettes manuelt, men det "
"**kan ikke** linkes tilbage til den oprindelige |SO| via smart-knappen. Hvis "
"behovet ændres, skal du i stedet opdatere dokumentet i stedet for at "
"annullere det."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:39
msgid "Enable the MTO route"
msgstr "Aktivér MTO-ruten"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:41
msgid ""
"In order to use the |MTO| route, the :guilabel:`Replenish on Order (MTO)` "
"setting must be enabled. To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`. Go to the :guilabel:`Logistics` section at "
"the end of the page, and select the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Replenish on "
"Order (MTO)`. Click :guilabel:`Save` to confirm the setting."
msgstr ""
"For at bruge |MTO|-ruten skal indstillingen :guilabel:`Genbestil ved ordre "
"(MTO)` være aktiveret. For at gøre dette skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-appen --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`. Gå til "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`Logistik` nederst på siden, og markér "
"afkrydsningsfeltet ved siden af :guilabel:`Genbestil ved ordre (MTO)`. Klik "
"på :guilabel:`Gem` for at bekræfte indstillingen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:46
msgid "Select the Replenish on Order (MTO) checkbox."
msgstr "Markér afkrydsningsfeltet Genbestil ved ordre (MTO)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:52
msgid "Configure a product for MTO"
msgstr "Konfigurer et produkt til MTO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:54
msgid ""
"With the |MTO| route enabled, products can now be configured to replenish on "
"order. To do so, begin by going to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> "
"Products --> Products`. Then, select an existing product, or "
"click :guilabel:`New` to configure a new product."
msgstr ""
"Med |MTO|-ruten aktiveret kan produkter nu konfigureres til at genbestille "
"ved ordre. For at gøre dette skal du begynde med at gå "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-appen --> Produkter --> Produkter`. Vælg derefter "
"et eksisterende produkt, eller klik på :guilabel:`Ny` for at konfigurere et "
"nyt produkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:58
msgid ""
"In the product form, go to the *Inventory* tab. Under the *Operations* "
"section, select the checkbox next to the :guilabel:`Replenish on Order "
"(MTO)` option in the :guilabel:`Routes` field."
msgstr ""
"I produktformularen skal du gå til fanen *Lager*. Under afsnittet "
"*Operationer* skal du markere afkrydsningsfeltet ved siden af "
"indstillingen :guilabel:`Genbestil ved ordre (MTO)` i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Ruter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:61
msgid "Select the MTO route on the Inventory tab."
msgstr "Vælg MTO-ruten på fanen Lager."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:64
msgid ""
"After enabling the |MTO| route, additional configurations should be made "
"depending on whether the product is :ref:`purchased <inventory/mto/configure-"
"mto-product/purchased>` or :ref:`manufactured <inventory/mto/configure-mto-"
"product/manufactured>`."
msgstr ""
"Efter aktivering af |MTO|-ruten skal der foretages yderligere "
"konfigurationer afhængigt af, om produktet er :ref:`indkøbt <inventory/mto/"
"configure-mto-product/purchased>` eller :ref:`produceret <inventory/mto/"
"configure-mto-product/manufactured>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:69
msgid ""
"As of Odoo 19.0, the *Buy* and *Manufacture* routes are hidden from "
"the :guilabel:`Routes` field under the *Operations* tab by default. They are "
"automatically applied on purchased and manufactured products depending on "
"their respective configurations provided below in this section."
msgstr ""
"Fra og med Odoo 19.0 er ruterne *Køb* og *Produktion* som standard skjult "
"fra feltet :guilabel:`Ruter` under fanen *Operationer*. De anvendes "
"automatisk på indkøbte og producerede produkter afhængigt af deres "
"respektive konfigurationer beskrevet nedenfor i dette afsnit."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:74
msgid ""
"To manually enable these routes on product forms, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings` and ensure "
"that :guilabel:`Multi-Step Routes` is enabled. Then, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Routes` and select the desired route. "
"On the route page, click the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Products` under the "
"*Applicable On* section."
msgstr ""
"For manuelt at aktivere disse ruter på produktformularer skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Lager-appen --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger` og "
"sikre dig, at :guilabel:`Flertrinruter` er aktiveret. Navigér derefter "
"til :menuselection:`Konfiguration --> Ruter` og vælg den ønskede rute. På "
"rutesiden skal du klikke på afkrydsningsfeltet ved siden "
"af :guilabel:`Produkter` under afsnittet *Gælder for*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:82
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:150
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/allocation_report.rst:223
msgid "For purchased products"
msgstr "For indkøbte produkter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:84
msgid ""
"If the product is purchased from a vendor to fulfill |SOs|, ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Purchase` checkbox is enabled under the product name. This "
"displays the *Purchase* tab below."
msgstr ""
"Hvis produktet er indkøbt fra en leverandør for at opfylde |SOs|, skal du "
"sikre dig, at afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Indkøb` er aktiveret under "
"produktnavnet. Dette viser fanen *Indkøb* nedenfor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:87
msgid ""
"Then, click the *Purchase* tab and specify a :guilabel:`Vendor` and "
"a :guilabel:`Unit Price` for the product."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på fanen *Indkøb* og angiv en :guilabel:`Leverandør` og "
"en :guilabel:`Enhedspris` for produktet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:91
msgid ""
"For purchased products, users **must** specify a vendor or have at least one "
"confirmed |PO| for the product in order for Odoo to properly generate an |"
"RFQ|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:97
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:164
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/allocation_report.rst:230
msgid "For manufactured products"
msgstr "For producerede produkter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:99
msgid ""
"If the product is manufactured, ensure it has a :doc:`bill of materials "
"<../../../manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration>` (BoM) configured. "
"To do so, click the :icon:`fa-flask` :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart "
"button at the top of the form. Then, click :guilabel:`New` on "
"the :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` page to configure a new |BOM| for the "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Hvis produktet er produceret, skal du sikre dig, at det har "
"en :doc:`stykliste <../../../manufacturing/basic_setup/bill_configuration>` "
"(BoM) konfigureret. For at gøre dette skal du klikke på smart-"
"knappen :icon:`fa-flask` :guilabel:`Stykliste` øverst i formularen. Klik "
"derefter på :guilabel:`Ny` på siden :guilabel:`Stykliste` for at konfigurere "
"en ny |BOM| til produktet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:105
msgid ""
"For manufactured products, users **must** specify a |BOM| in order for Odoo "
"to properly generate an |MO|."
msgstr ""
"For producerede produkter **skal** brugerne angive en |BOM|, for at Odoo kan "
"generere en |MO| korrekt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:111
msgid "Replenishment workflow using MTO"
msgstr "Genbestillingsworkflow ved brug af MTO"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:113
msgid ""
"After configuring a product to use the |MTO| route, a replenishment order is "
"created whenever an |SO| including the product is confirmed. This "
"replenishment order is either a |PO| if the product is purchased or an |MO| "
"if manufactured."
msgstr ""
"Efter konfiguration af et produkt til at bruge |MTO|-ruten oprettes en "
"genbestillingsordre, når en |SO|, der inkluderer produktet, bekræftes. Denne "
"genbestillingsordre er enten en |PO|, hvis produktet er indkøbt, eller en |"
"MO|, hvis det er produceret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:118
msgid ""
"A replenishment order is **always** created upon confirming an |SO|, even if "
"there is enough stock to fulfill the order."
msgstr ""
"En genbestillingsordre oprettes **altid** ved bekræftelse af en |SO|, selv "
"hvis der er nok på lager til at opfylde ordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:124
msgid "Create a customer |SO|"
msgstr "Opret en kunde-|SO|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:126
msgid ""
"To initiate a replenishment-on-order, navigate to the **Sales** app, then "
"click :guilabel:`New` to open a new quotation form."
msgstr ""
"For at igangsætte en genbestilling-på-ordre skal du navigere til appen "
"**Salg** og derefter klikke på :guilabel:`Ny` for at åbne en ny "
"tilbudsformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:129
msgid ""
"On the form, add a :guilabel:`Customer`. Then, click :guilabel:`Add a "
"product` under the *Order Lines* tab, and enter a product configured for |"
"MTO|. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to turn the quotation into an |SO|."
msgstr ""
"I formularen tilføjes en :guilabel:`Kunde`. Klik derefter "
"på :guilabel:`Tilføj et produkt` under fanen *Ordrelinjer*, og indtast et "
"produkt konfigureret til |MTO|. Klik på :guilabel:`Bekræft` for at gøre "
"tilbuddet om til en |SO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:136
msgid "Validate replenishment order"
msgstr "Godkend genbestillingsordre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:138
msgid ""
"Upon confirming the |SO|, two smart buttons appear at the top of the form:"
msgstr "Ved bekræftelse af |SO| vises to smarte knapper øverst på formularen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:140
msgid ""
"A :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Delivery` order the user eventually validates "
"when the product is ready to be delivered to the customer."
msgstr ""
"En :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Levering`-ordre, som brugeren til sidst "
"validerer, når produktet er klar til at blive leveret til kunden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:142
msgid ""
"A :icon:`fa-credit-card` :guilabel:`Purchase` order if the product on the |"
"SO| is :ref:`purchased <inventory/mto/replenish-mto-product/validate-order/"
"purchased>` **or** a :icon:`fa-wrench` :guilabel:`Manufacturing` order "
"if :ref:`manufactured <inventory/mto/replenish-mto-product/validate-order/"
"manufactured>`."
msgstr ""
"En :icon:`fa-credit-card` :guilabel:`Indkøb`-ordre, hvis produktet på |SO| "
"er :ref:`indkøbt <inventory/mto/replenish-mto-product/validate-order/"
"purchased>` **eller** en :icon:`fa-wrench` :guilabel:`Produktion`-ordre, "
"hvis :ref:`fremstillet <inventory/mto/replenish-mto-product/validate-order/"
"manufactured>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:152
msgid ""
"If the product is purchased, a :icon:`fa-credit-card` :guilabel:`Purchase` "
"smart button appears at the top of the page. Click it to open the |RFQ| "
"associated with the |SO|."
msgstr ""
"Hvis produktet indkøbes, vises en :icon:`fa-credit-card` :guilabel:`Indkøb`-"
"smart-knap øverst på siden. Klik på den for at åbne |RFQ|, der er tilknyttet "
"|SO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:155
msgid ""
"After verifying that the vendor can meet the demand by "
"the :guilabel:`Expected Date`, click :guilabel:`Confirm Order` to turn the |"
"RFQ| into a confirmed |PO|."
msgstr ""
"Efter at have bekræftet, at leverandøren kan opfylde efterspørgslen "
"inden :guilabel:`Forventet dato`, klikkes på :guilabel:`Bekræft ordre` for "
"at gøre |RFQ| om til en bekræftet |PO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:158
msgid ""
"Once the products are received, click :guilabel:`Receive` to open the "
"receipt, and click :guilabel:`Validate` to enter the products into inventory."
msgstr ""
"Når produkterne er modtaget, klikkes på :guilabel:`Modtag` for at åbne "
"kvitteringen og klik på :guilabel:`Valider` for at føre produkterne ind i "
"lageret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:166
msgid ""
"If the product is manufactured, a :icon:`fa-"
"wrench` :guilabel:`Manufacturing` smart button appears at the top of the "
"page. Click it to open the |MO| associated with the |SO|. By default, the |"
"MO| is confirmed immediately upon confirming the |SO|."
msgstr ""
"Hvis produktet fremstilles, vises en :icon:`fa-"
"wrench` :guilabel:`Produktion`-smart-knap øverst på siden. Klik på den for "
"at åbne |MO|, der er tilknyttet |SO|. Som standard bekræftes |MO| "
"umiddelbart ved bekræftelse af |SO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:170
msgid ""
"Continue by completing any work orders in the *Work Orders* tab. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Produce All` to mark the |MO| as done. The product is now "
"registered into inventory."
msgstr ""
"Fortsæt ved at gennemføre eventuelle arbejdsordrer i fanen *Arbejdsordrer*. "
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Producér alle` for at markere |MO| som udført. "
"Produktet er nu registreret i lageret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:174
msgid "Fulfill customer |SO|"
msgstr "Opfyld kunde-|SO|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:176
msgid ""
"Return to the |SO| via the breadcrumbs at the top, or by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Orders` and selecting the |SO|."
msgstr ""
"Returner til |SO| via brødkrummerne øverst, eller ved at navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Salg-app --> Ordrer --> Ordrer` og vælge |SO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:179
msgid ""
"Finally, click the :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button at the "
"top of the order to open the delivery order. Once the products have been "
"shipped to the customer, click :guilabel:`Validate` to confirm the delivery."
msgstr ""
"Klik til sidst på :icon:`fa-truck` :guilabel:`Levering`-smart-knappen øverst "
"på ordren for at åbne leveringsordren. Når produkterne er sendt til kunden, "
"klikkes på :guilabel:`Valider` for at bekræfte leveringen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:186
msgid "Cancel an MTO sales order"
msgstr "Annuller en MTO-salgsordre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/mto.rst:188
msgid ""
"When an |SO| that had created an |RFQ| or |MO| is canceled, the related "
"delivery order is canceled automatically. However, the |RFQ| or |MO| "
"themselves are **not** canceled. Instead, a warning appears in their chatter "
"noting the |SO| cancellation. These documents remain active, so the user can "
"either cancel them manually or reuse the replenishment for another order."
msgstr ""
"Når en |SO|, der havde oprettet en |RFQ| eller |MO|, annulleres, annulleres "
"den relaterede leveringsordre automatisk. Dog annulleres |RFQ| eller |MO| "
"selv **ikke**. I stedet vises en advarsel i deres chatter, der noterer |SO|-"
"annulleringen. Disse dokumenter forbliver aktive, så brugeren enten kan "
"annullere dem manuelt eller genbruge genbestillingen til en anden ordre."

