#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:101
msgid "Specify how many products are being produced."
msgstr "Angiv, hvor mange produkter der produceres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:104
msgid "The registered units can move on to the next work order."
msgstr "De registrerede enheder kan gå videre til den næste arbejdsseddel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:107
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Eksempel"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:109
msgid "A company produces `20 fl. oz Soda` using three work orders:"
msgstr ""
"En virksomhed producerer `20 fl. oz Soda` ved hjælp af tre arbejdssedler:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:111
msgid "Mixing"
msgstr "Blanding"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:112
msgid "Bottling and sealing"
msgstr "Aftapning og forsegling"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:113
msgid "Pasteurization"
msgstr "Pasteurisering"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:115
msgid "Four components make up each completed soda:"
msgstr "Fire komponenter udgør hver færdig sodavand:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:117
msgid ""
"`16.7` `fluid ounces` of `Carbonated Water` (consumed during the mixing "
"stage)"
msgstr ""
"`16.7` `fluid ounces` af `Carbonated Water` (forbruges under blandingsfasen)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:118
msgid "`3.3` `fluid ounces` of `Soda Syrup` (consumed during the mixing stage)"
msgstr "`3.3` `fluid ounces` af `Soda Syrup` (forbruges under blandingsfasen)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:119
msgid ""
"`1` `unit` of `Soda Bottle` (consumed during the bottling and sealing stage)"
msgstr ""
"`1` `enhed` af `sodavandsflaske` (forbrugt under aftapnings- og "
"forseglingsfasen)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:120
msgid ""
"`1` `unit` of `Soda Bottle Cap` (consumed during the bottling and sealing "
"work order)"
msgstr ""
"`1` `enhed` af `kapsel til sodavandsflaske` (forbrugt under arbejdsordren "
"for aftapning og forsegling)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:122
msgid "The production facility aims to make 20,000 bottles of soda per day."
msgstr ""
"Produktionsanlægget har som mål at fremstille 20.000 flasker sodavand om "
"dagen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:124
msgid "Most components are available to manufacture the brackets."
msgstr "De fleste komponenter er tilgængelige til at fremstille beslagene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:127
msgid ""
"The company's five soda mixing machines can only contain 200 liters of water "
"and syrup. They are producing close to 12,000 liters per day. They need to "
"be able to continuously produce soda to meet the daily quota, so they "
"have :ref:`enabled continuous production <manufacturing/"
"continuous_production/enable-cp>` on their soda |BOM| to allow soda to be "
"bottled and sealed as soon as it's mixed, then pasteurized."
msgstr ""
"Virksomhedens fem sodavandsblandemaskiner kan kun rumme 200 liter vand og "
"sirup. De producerer tæt på 12.000 liter om dagen. De har brug for "
"kontinuerligt at kunne producere sodavand for at opfylde den daglige kvote, "
"så de har :ref:`aktiveret kontinuerlig produktion <manufacturing/"
"continuous_production/enable-cp>` på deres sodavands-|BOM| for at tillade, "
"at sodavand aftappes og forsegles, så snart det er blandet, og derefter "
"pasteuriseres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:133
msgid ""
"Arthur is responsible for the first work order, mixing. He oversees the "
"addition of the proper amounts of carbonated water and soda syrup to each of "
"the mixing machines. After five minutes, mixing is complete, and Arthur "
"registers production of each 200-liter batch in *Shop Floor*, using a "
"conversion from liters to fluid ounces."
msgstr ""
"Arthur er ansvarlig for den første arbejdsordre, blanding. Han overvåger "
"tilsætningen af de korrekte mængder kulsyreholdigt vand og sodavandssirup "
"til hver af blandemaskinerne. Efter fem minutter er blandingen færdig, og "
"Arthur registrerer produktionen af hver batch på 200 liter i *Shop Floor* "
"ved hjælp af en omregning fra liter til fluid ounces."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:138
msgid ""
"He sends the mixed soda to the bottling machines. Marvin monitors the "
"filling machine to ensure sodas are bottled safely and accurately. Soda is "
"pumped into bottles, which are then immediately capped tightly as the sodas "
"leave the machine. Marvin uses *Shop Floor* to register production for every "
"250 bottles made."
msgstr ""
"Han sender den blandede sodavand til aftapningsmaskinerne. Marvin overvåger "
"påfyldningsmaskinen for at sikre, at sodavand aftappes sikkert og præcist. "
"Sodavand pumpes ind i flasker, som derefter straks forsegles tæt med "
"kapsler, når sodavandene forlader maskinen. Marvin bruger *Shop Floor* til "
"at registrere produktion for hver 250 fremstillede flasker."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:143
msgid ""
"Enter 250 as the Quantity Produced and click Validate in the Register "
"Production window."
msgstr ""
"Indtast 250 som Produceret antal, og klik på Valider i vinduet Registrer "
"produktion."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:146
msgid ""
"The sodas leave via conveyor belt to enter the tunnel pasteurization "
"machine. The bottles are slowly heated to pasteurization temperature, then "
"gradually cooled as they work their way through the machine. Using *Shop "
"Floor*, Bart registers production for every 250 bottles as they exit the "
"machine."
msgstr ""
"Sodavandene føres via et transportbånd ind i tunnelpasteuriseringsmaskinen. "
"Flaskerne opvarmes langsomt til pasteuriseringstemperatur og afkøles "
"derefter gradvist, mens de bevæger sig gennem maskinen. Ved hjælp af *Shop "
"Floor* registrerer Bart produktionen for hver 250 flasker, efterhånden som "
"de forlader maskinen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:151
msgid "250 bottles are registered in the Shop Floor app."
msgstr "250 flasker registreres i appen Shop Floor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/continuous_production.rst:154
msgid "From there, the bottles can move on to packaging and then shipment."
msgstr "Derfra kan flaskerne gå videre til pakning og derefter forsendelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:3
msgid "Dismantle products into components"
msgstr "Adskil produkter i komponenter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:8
msgid ""
"Some companies may take in products from external sources and retain "
"components of those products for future use. For example, a car junkyard may "
"take in cars that are no longer functional and break them down into their "
"components, selling the functional parts to mechanics, who can make use of "
"those parts."
msgstr ""
"Nogle virksomheder modtager måske produkter fra eksterne kilder og beholder "
"komponenter fra disse produkter til fremtidig brug. For eksempel kan en "
"autoophugger tage imod biler, der ikke længere fungerer, og adskille dem i "
"deres enkeltdele og sælge de funktionelle dele til mekanikere, som kan gøre "
"brug af dem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:13
msgid ""
"While :doc:`unbuild orders <unbuild_orders>` apply to products that are "
"manufactured, purchased products being disassembled rely on a bill of "
"material's (BoM) :doc:`by-products <byproducts>` to split the item into "
"components and add those parts to inventory."
msgstr ""
"Mens :doc:`adskillelsesordrer <unbuild_orders>` gælder for produkter, der "
"fremstilles, er indkøbte produkter, der adskilles, afhængige af en "
"styklistes (BOM) :doc:`biprodukter <byproducts>` til at opdele varen i "
"komponenter og tilføje disse dele til lageret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:17
msgid ""
"Creating by-products ensures that the components for each product can be "
"entered into inventory, complete with serial numbers (if they are used)."
msgstr ""
"Oprettelse af biprodukter sikrer, at komponenterne for hvert produkt kan "
"registreres på lageret, komplet med serienumre (hvis sådanne anvendes)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:20
msgid "Typically, the process is as follows:"
msgstr "Processen er typisk som følger:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:22
msgid ""
":ref:`Create a bill of materials for the product to dismantle <manufacturing/"
"dismantle_products/create-bom>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Opret en stykliste for produktet, der skal adskilles <manufacturing/"
"dismantle_products/create-bom>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:24
msgid "Create a manufacturing order (MO) for the product."
msgstr "Opret en produktionsordre (MO) for produktet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:25
msgid ""
":ref:`Break down the product into its by-product components <manufacturing/"
"dismantle_products/dismantle>` and enter any tracking numbers (like lots or "
"serial numbers) for the component parts."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Adskil produktet i dets biproduktkomponenter <manufacturing/"
"dismantle_products/dismantle>` og indtast eventuelle sporingsnumre (som "
"f.eks. parti- eller serienumre) for komponentdelene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:28
msgid ""
":ref:`Enter parts into inventory <manufacturing/dismantle_products/"
"inventory>` by clicking :guilabel:`Produce All` on the manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Registrer dele på lager <manufacturing/dismantle_products/inventory>` "
"ved at klikke på :guilabel:`Producer alle` på produktionsordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:36
msgid ""
"To set up Odoo to dismantle products into by-products, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the "
"*Operations* section, select the :guilabel:`By-Products` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere Odoo til at adskille produkter i biprodukter skal du "
"navigere til :menuselection:`Produktion-appen --> Konfiguration --> "
"Indstillinger`. I afsnittet *Operationer* skal du markere "
"afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Biprodukter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:40
msgid "Enable By-Products in the Manufacturing configuration settings."
msgstr "Aktivér biprodukter i konfigurationsindstillingerne for Produktion."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:46
msgid "Create bill of materials"
msgstr "Opret stykliste"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:48
msgid "First, create a new |BoM| for the product that will be dismantled."
msgstr "Opret først en ny |BoM| for det produkt, der skal adskilles."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:50
msgid ""
"Set up a :ref:`new BoM <manufacturing/basic_setup/bom-setup>`. Be sure to "
"name the product in a way that differentiates it from the product being "
"disassembled."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurer en :ref:`ny stykliste <manufacturing/basic_setup/bom-setup>`. "
"Sørg for at navngive produktet på en måde, der adskiller det fra det "
"produkt, der adskilles."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:53
msgid ""
"Add the product being disassembled to the |BoM| as a component. Doing this "
"will ensure that the on-hand quantity of the product being disassembled will "
"decrease by `1` every time an |MO| is completed."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj det produkt, der adskilles, til |BoM| som en komponent. Dette vil "
"sikre, at den faktiske beholdning af det produkt, der adskilles, reduceres "
"med `1`, hver gang en |MO| fuldføres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:57
msgid ""
":ref:`Add by-products <manufacturing/byproducts/add-to-bom>` to the |BoM| "
"that define the components that will be entered into inventory as a result "
"of an |MO|."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Tilføj biprodukter <manufacturing/byproducts/add-to-bom>` til |BoM|, "
"der definerer de komponenter, som registreres på lageret som et resultat af "
"en |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:60
msgid "A Car bill of materials with parts listed as by-products."
msgstr "En stykliste for en bil med dele angivet som biprodukter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:63
msgid ""
"If necessary, add work orders and operations to the |BoM| to track "
"disassembly."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj om nødvendigt arbejdsordrer og operationer til |BoM| for at spore "
"adskillelsen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:65
msgid "After the |BoM| is created, create an |MO| and confirm it."
msgstr "Efter |BoM| er oprettet, skal du oprette en |MO| og bekræfte den."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:68
msgid ":doc:`../basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing`"
msgstr ":doc:`../basic_setup/one_step_manufacturing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:69
msgid ":doc:`../basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing`"
msgstr ":doc:`../basic_setup/two_step_manufacturing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:70
msgid ":doc:`../basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing`"
msgstr ":doc:`../basic_setup/three_step_manufacturing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:75
msgid "Dismantle product"
msgstr "Adskil produkt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:77
msgid ""
"After the |MO| is confirmed, the product can be broken down into its "
"component parts."
msgstr "Efter |MO| er bekræftet, kan produktet adskilles i dets enkeltdele."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:79
msgid "Retrieve the parts, or by-products, from the product."
msgstr "Hent delene eller biprodukterne fra produktet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:81
msgid ""
"If the by-products are tracked by lot or serial number, open the *By-"
"Products* tab of the |MO|. Click the :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`(Show "
"Details)` icon to open the *Move Byproduct* window. Enter the :guilabel:`Lot/"
"Serial Number` for each by-product, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis biprodukterne spores via parti- eller serienummer, skal du åbne fanen "
"*Biprodukter* i |MO|. Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-list` :guilabel:`(Vis "
"detaljer)` for at åbne vinduet *Flyt biprodukt*. Angiv :guilabel:`Parti-/"
"serienummer` for hvert biprodukt, og klik derefter på :guilabel:`Gem`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:85
msgid "Two axle by-products are assigned serial numbers."
msgstr "To akselbiprodukter tildeles serienumre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:91
msgid "Enter by-products into inventory"
msgstr "Registrer biprodukter på lager"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:93
msgid ""
"To enter the by-products into inventory, click the :guilabel:`Produce All` "
"button on the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"For at registrere biprodukterne på lageret skal du klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Producer alt` på |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:95
msgid ""
"To confirm that the products have been entered into inventory, click "
"the :icon:`oi-arrow-up` :guilabel:`Traceability` smart button. A "
"*Traceability Report* opens, showing the manufacturing order responsible for "
"creating the by-products in the :guilabel:`Reference` column, "
"the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial #` associated with the by-products, where it is "
"moving :guilabel:`From` and :guilabel:`To`, and the :guilabel:`Quantity`."
msgstr ""
"For at bekræfte, at produkterne er blevet registreret på lageret, skal du "
"klikke på den intelligente knap :icon:`oi-arrow-up` :guilabel:`Sporbarhed`. "
"En *Sporbarhedsrapport* åbnes og viser den produktionsordre, der er "
"ansvarlig for oprettelsen af biprodukterne i kolonnen :guilabel:`Reference`, "
"det :guilabel:`Parti-/serienr.`, der er tilknyttet biprodukterne, hvor det "
"flyttes :guilabel:`Fra` og :guilabel:`Til`, samt :guilabel:`Antal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:101
msgid "A traceability report for a car and its by-products."
msgstr "En sporbarhedsrapport for en bil og dens biprodukter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:104
msgid ""
"Similar information can be found on the :icon:`fa-"
"exchange` :guilabel:`Product Moves` smart button of the manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"Lignende oplysninger kan findes på den intelligente knap :icon:`fa-"
"exchange` :guilabel:`Produktbevægelser` på produktionsordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/dismantle_products.rst:107
msgid "An Inventory Moves report for a car and its by-products."
msgstr "En rapport over lagerbevægelser for en bil og dens biprodukter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:3
msgid "Manufacture with lots and serial numbers"
msgstr "Produktion med lot- og serienumre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:8
msgid ""
"In Odoo, *lot numbers* and *serial numbers* are used to identify and track "
"products in Odoo. Serial numbers are used to assign unique numbers to "
"individual products, while lot numbers are used to assign a single number to "
"multiple units of a specific product."
msgstr ""
"I Odoo bruges *lotnumre* og *serienumre* til at identificere og spore "
"produkter i Odoo. Serienumre bruges til at tildele unikke numre til "
"individuelle produkter, mens lotnumre bruges til at tildele et enkelt nummer "
"til flere enheder af et specifikt produkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:12
msgid ""
"When manufacturing products tracked using lots or serial numbers, Odoo "
"requires the lot or serial number to be assigned to each product before "
"manufacturing can be completed. This ensures that each product is properly "
"tracked from the moment it enters inventory."
msgstr ""
"Ved produktion af produkter sporet ved hjælp af lot- eller serienumre kræver "
"Odoo, at lot- eller serienummeret tildeles hvert produkt, før produktionen "
"kan afsluttes. Dette sikrer, at hvert produkt spores korrekt fra det "
"øjeblik, det kommer på lager."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:22
msgid ""
"To track a product using lots or serial numbers, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings`, then scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Traceability` section, and tick the :guilabel:`Lots & "
"Serial Numbers` checkbox. Finally, click :guilabel:`Save` to save the change."
msgstr ""
"For at spore et produkt ved hjælp af lot- eller serienumre skal du starte "
"med at navigere til :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> "
"Indstillinger`, derefter rulle ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Sporbarhed` og "
"markere afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Lot- og serienumre`. Til sidst klikkes "
"på :guilabel:`Gem` for at gemme ændringen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:26
msgid ""
"Next, click on :menuselection:`Manufacturing app --> Products --> Products`, "
"and open a product to track. In the :guilabel:`Tracking` field, "
"select :guilabel:`By Lots` to track the product using lot numbers, "
"or :guilabel:`By Unique Serial Number` to track the product using serial "
"numbers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:31
msgid ":doc:`Lots <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking/lots>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Partier <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking/lots>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:32
msgid ""
":doc:`Serial numbers <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking/"
"serial_numbers>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Serienumre <../../inventory/product_management/product_tracking/"
"serial_numbers>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:37
msgid ""
"To manufacture a product tracked with lots, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new manufacturing order (MO)."
msgstr ""
"For at producere et produkt sporet med partier skal du starte med at "
"navigere til :menuselection:`Produktion --> Operationer --> "
"Produktionsordrer`. Klik på :guilabel:`Ny` for at oprette en ny "
"produktionsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:41
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Product` field, select a product tracked using lots, and "
"enter the desired :guilabel:`Quantity`. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm "
"the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"I feltet :guilabel:`Produkt` skal du vælge et produkt sporet ved hjælp af "
"partier og indtaste det ønskede :guilabel:`Antal`. Klik "
"på :guilabel:`Bekræft` for at bekræfte |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:44
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:72
msgid ""
"Once the |MO| is confirmed, a :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field appears in "
"the top section of the |MO| form. By default, this field is empty."
msgstr ""
"Når |MO| er bekræftet, vises et felt :guilabel:`Parti-/serienummer` i den "
"øverste del af |MO|-formularen. Som standard er dette felt tomt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:47
msgid ""
"To populate the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field with a lot number, click "
"the :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon to the right of the "
"field. Doing so automatically generates a lot, using the next available "
"number, and enters it in the field."
msgstr ""
"For at udfylde feltet :guilabel:`Parti-/serienummer` med et partinummer skal "
"du klikke på :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)`-ikonet til højre "
"for feltet. Dette genererer automatisk et parti ved hjælp af det næste "
"tilgængelige nummer og indtaster det i feltet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:51
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click on the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field and select "
"an existing lot number, or manually enter a new lot number and "
"click :guilabel:`Create \"#\"` in the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Alternativt kan du klikke på feltet :guilabel:`Parti-/serienummer` og vælge "
"et eksisterende partinummer eller manuelt indtaste et nyt partinummer og "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Opret \"#\"` i rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:89
msgid "The \"Lot/Serial Number\" field on an MO."
msgstr "Feltet \"Parti-/serienummer\" på en produktionsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:57
msgid ""
"Either of these methods assign the products in the |MO| a lot number before "
"production is finished. It is also possible to complete production and close "
"the |MO| by clicking :guilabel:`Produce`, without assigning a lot number. "
"Doing so automatically generates and assigns a lot, using the next available "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Begge disse metoder tildeler produkterne i |MO| et partinummer, før "
"produktionen er afsluttet. Det er også muligt at fuldføre produktionen og "
"lukke |MO| ved at klikke på :guilabel:`Producer` uden at tildele et "
"partinummer. Gør man det, genereres og tildeles automatisk et parti ved "
"hjælp af det næste tilgængelige nummer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:65
msgid ""
"To manufacture a product tracked with serial numbers, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new |MO|."
msgstr ""
"For at producere et produkt sporet med serienumre skal du starte med at "
"navigere til :menuselection:`Produktion --> Operationer --> "
"Produktionsordrer`. Klik på :guilabel:`Ny` for at oprette en ny |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:69
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Product` field, select a product tracked using serial "
"numbers, and enter the desired :guilabel:`Quantity`. "
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm the |MO|."
msgstr ""
"I feltet :guilabel:`Produkt` skal du vælge et produkt sporet ved hjælp af "
"serienumre og indtaste det ønskede :guilabel:`Antal`. Klik "
"på :guilabel:`Bekræft` for at bekræfte |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:75
msgid ""
"The rest of the manufacturing process depends on how many units the |MO| "
"contains."
msgstr ""
"Resten af produktionsprocessenafhænger af, hvor mange enheder |MO| "
"indeholder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:78
msgid "Manufacture single unit"
msgstr "Producér enkelt enhed"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:80
msgid ""
"If a single unit of the product is being manufactured, "
"clicking :guilabel:`Produce` closes the |MO|, and automatically generates "
"and assigns the next available serial number, which appears in "
"the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en enkelt enhed af produktet produceres, lukker klik "
"på :guilabel:`Producér alle` |MO| og genererer og tildeler automatisk det "
"næste tilgængelige serienummer, som vises i feltet :guilabel:`Parti-/"
"serienummer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:84
msgid ""
"To assign a serial number without closing the |MO|, enter a number manually "
"in the :guilabel:`Lot/Serial Number` field, and click :guilabel:`Create "
"\"#\"`, or click the :icon:`fa-plus-square-o` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon to the "
"right of the field to auto-fill it with the next available number."
msgstr ""
"For at tildele et serienummer uden at lukke |MO| skal du indtaste et nummer "
"manuelt i feltet :guilabel:`Parti-/serienummer` og klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Opret \"#\"`, eller klikke på :icon:`fa-plus-square-"
"o` :guilabel:`(plus)`-ikonet til højre for feltet for automatisk at udfylde "
"det med det næste tilgængelige nummer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:93
msgid "Manufacture multiple units"
msgstr "Producér flere enheder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:96
msgid ""
"When manufacturing a product tracked using serial numbers, an |MO| can be "
"created for multiple units. However, when serial numbers are assigned to "
"each unit, either at the end of production or before, the |MO| is split into "
"multiple |MOs|, each containing one unit of the product."
msgstr ""
"Når der produceres et produkt sporet ved hjælp af serienumre, kan en |MO| "
"oprettes for flere enheder. Når der dog tildeles serienumre til hver enhed, "
"enten ved afslutningen af produktionen eller før, opdeles |MO| i flere |"
"MOs|, der hver indeholder én enhed af produktet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:100
msgid ""
"Each of the split |MOs| is identified by a numerical tag added to the end of "
"the original |MO| number."
msgstr ""
"Hver af de delte |MOs| identificeres med et numerisk tag tilføjet i "
"slutningen af det originale |MO|-nummer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:104
msgid ""
"|MO| `WH/MO/00109` contains two units of a `Chair`, a product tracked using "
"serial numbers. A serial number is assigned to each unit of the chair. This "
"causes the |MO| to be split into two |MOs|, each containing one unit of the "
"chair. The |MOs| are titled `WH/MO/00109-001` and `WH/MO/00109-002`."
msgstr ""
"|MO| `WH/MO/00109` indeholder to enheder af en `Chair`, et produkt sporet "
"ved hjælp af serienumre. Et serienummer tildeles til hver enhed af stolen. "
"Dette får |MO| til at blive delt i to |MOs|, der hver indeholder én enhed af "
"stolen. |MOs| har titlerne `WH/MO/00109-001` og `WH/MO/00109-002`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:109
msgid ""
"To assign serial numbers to each unit of an |MO|, click :guilabel:`Produce` "
"to open the *Batch Production* pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:112
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`First Lot/SN` field of the pop-up window is auto-filled with "
"the next available serial number. The :guilabel:`Number of SN` field "
"defaults to the number of units being manufactured. The values of either "
"field can be changed manually."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`Første lot/SN` i pop op-vinduet udfyldes automatisk med "
"det næste tilgængelige serienummer. Feltet :guilabel:`Antal SN` "
"standardindstilles til antallet af enheder, der produceres. Værdierne i "
"begge felter kan ændres manuelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:116
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Generate` to generate the specified number of serial "
"numbers, beginning with the number entered in the :guilabel:`First Lot/SN` "
"field. The serial numbers are displayed in the text box at the bottom of the "
"pop-up window, and can be manually changed after generation."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Generer` for at generere det angivne antal serienumre, "
"startende med det nummer, der er indtastet i feltet :guilabel:`Første lot/"
"SN`. Serienumrene vises i tekstfeltet nederst i pop op-vinduet og kan ændres "
"manuelt efter generering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:120
msgid ""
"To assign serial numbers without completing production, click "
"the :guilabel:`Prepare MO` button. Doing so splits the |MO| into individual |"
"MOs|, one for each unit in the original |MO|. Each |MO| is left open, and "
"can be closed individually."
msgstr ""
"For at tildele serienumre uden at fuldføre produktionen, klik på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Forbered MO`. Dette deler |MO| i individuelle |MOs|, én "
"for hver enhed i den originale |MO|. Hver |MO| forbliver åben og kan lukkes "
"individuelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:124
msgid ""
"To assign serial numbers and complete production, click "
"the :guilabel:`Produce` button. Doing so splits the |MO| into individual |"
"MOs|, one for each unit in the original |MO|. All of the |MOs| are closed, "
"since production is complete."
msgstr ""
"For at tildele serienumre og fuldføre produktionen, klik på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Producer`. Dette deler |MO| i individuelle |MOs|, én for "
"hver enhed i den originale |MO|. Alle |MOs| lukkes, da produktionen er "
"fuldført."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:128
msgid ""
"The \"Batch Production\" pop-up window, from which serial numbers can be "
"assigned."
msgstr "Pop op-vinduet \"Batchproduktion\", hvorfra serienumre kan tildeles."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacture_lots_serials.rst:131
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Prepare MO` or :guilabel:`Produce`, "
"the :menuselection:`Manufacturing` app automatically shows the first of the "
"split |MOs| (ex. `WH/MO/00109-001`). To view and access the rest the split |"
"MOs|, click the :guilabel:`Backorders` smart button at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Efter at have klikket på :guilabel:`Forbered MO` eller :guilabel:`Producer`, "
"viser appen :menuselection:`Produktion` automatisk den første af de delte |"
"MOs| (f.eks. `WH/MO/00109-001`). For at se og få adgang til resten af de "
"delte |MOs|, klik på den smarte knap :guilabel:`Restordrer` øverst på "
"skærmen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:5
msgid "Manufacturing backorders"
msgstr "Produktionsrestordrer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:7
msgid ""
"In some cases, the full quantity of a manufacturing order cannot be produced "
"immediately. When this happens, the *Manufacturing* app can manufacture "
"partial quantities of the order and create a *backorder* for the remaining "
"amount. To manufacture the full quantity of a manufacturing order, "
"see :ref:`Create a manufacturing order <manufacturing/manufacturing-orders/"
"create-mo>`."
msgstr ""
"I nogle tilfælde kan den fulde mængde på en produktionsordre ikke "
"fremstilles med det samme. Når det sker, kan appen *Produktion* fremstille "
"delmængder af ordren og oprette en *restordre* for det resterende antal. For "
"at fremstille den fulde mængde af en produktionsordre, se :ref:`Opret en "
"produktionsordre <manufacturing/manufacturing-orders/create-mo>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:12
msgid ""
"Creating a backorder splits the original manufacturing order into two "
"orders. The reference tag for each order is the tag used for the original "
"order, followed by a hyphen and then an additional number to indicate that "
"it is a backorder. Backorders can be created :ref:`in the Manufacturing app "
"<manufacturing/manufacturing-backorders/create-backorder-manufacturing-app>` "
"or :ref:`from the Shop Floor module <manufacturing/manufacturing-backorders/"
"create-backorder-shop-floor>`."
msgstr ""
"Oprettelse af en restordre opdeler den oprindelige produktionsordre i to "
"ordrer. Referencen for hver ordre er det tag, der blev brugt til den "
"oprindelige ordre, efterfulgt af en bindestreg og derefter et ekstra tal for "
"at angive, at det er en restordre. Restordrer kan oprettes :ref:`i appen "
"Produktion <manufacturing/manufacturing-backorders/create-backorder-"
"manufacturing-app>` eller :ref:`fra modulet Værksted <manufacturing/"
"manufacturing-backorders/create-backorder-shop-floor>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:19
msgid ""
"A company creates a manufacturing order with the reference tag *WH/MO/"
"00175*, for 10 units of *Product X*. After starting work on the "
"manufacturing order, the employee working the production line realizes there "
"are only enough components in stock to produce five units of the product."
msgstr ""
"En virksomhed opretter en produktionsordre med referencetaget *WH/MO/00175* "
"for 10 enheder af *Produkt X*. Efter at have påbegyndt arbejdet med "
"produktionsordren indser medarbejderen, der arbejder på produktionslinjen, "
"at der kun er nok komponenter på lager til at producere fem enheder af "
"produktet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:23
msgid ""
"Instead of waiting for additional stock of the components, they manufacture "
"five units and create a backorder for the remaining five. This splits the "
"manufacturing order into two separate orders: *WH/MO/00175-001* and *WH/MO/"
"00175-002*."
msgstr ""
"I stedet for at vente på yderligere lager af komponenterne, fremstiller de "
"fem enheder og opretter en restordre for de resterende fem. Dette deler "
"produktionsordren i to separate ordrer: *WH/MO/00175-001* og *WH/MO/"
"00175-002*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:27
msgid ""
"Order *001* contains the five units that have been manufactured, and is "
"immediately marked as :guilabel:`Done`. Order *002* contains the five units "
"that still need to be manufactured and is marked as :guilabel:`In Progress`. "
"Once the remaining components are available, the employee returns to order "
"*002* and manufactures the remaining units before closing the order."
msgstr ""
"Ordre *001* indeholder de fem enheder, der er blevet fremstillet, og "
"markeres straks som :guilabel:`Udført`. Ordre *002* indeholder de fem "
"enheder, der stadig skal fremstilles, og markeres som :guilabel:`I gang`. "
"Når de resterende komponenter er tilgængelige, vender medarbejderen tilbage "
"til ordre *002* og fremstiller de resterende enheder, før ordren lukkes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:35
msgid "Create a backorder in Manufacturing app"
msgstr "Opret en restordre i appen Produktion"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:37
msgid ""
"To create a backorder for part of a manufacturing order, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Select a manufacturing order with a quantity of two or more or create one by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en restordre for en del af en produktionsordre, start med at "
"navigere til :menuselection:`Produktion --> Operationer --> "
"Produktionsordrer`. Vælg en produktionsordre med et antal på to eller flere, "
"eller opret en ved at klikke på :guilabel:`Opret`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:41
msgid ""
"If a new manufacturing order is created, select a product from "
"the :guilabel:`Product` drop-down menu and enter a quantity of two or more "
"in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field, then click :guilabel:`Confirm` to confirm "
"the order."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der oprettes en ny produktionsordre, vælg et produkt fra "
"rullemenuen :guilabel:`Produkt` og indtast et antal på to eller flere i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Antal`, og klik derefter på :guilabel:`Bekræft` for at "
"bekræfte ordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:45
msgid ""
"After manufacturing the quantity that is being produced immediately, enter "
"that number in the :guilabel:`Quantity` field at the top of the "
"manufacturing order."
msgstr ""
"Efter fremstilling af den mængde, der produceres med det samme, indtast "
"dette nummer i feltet :guilabel:`Antal` øverst i produktionsordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:48
msgid "The quantity field on a manufacturing order."
msgstr "Antal-feltet på en produktionsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:51
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Produce`. If the quantity of consumed materials does "
"not match the quantity of products produced, a :guilabel:`Consumption "
"Warning` pop-up window appears. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to keep the "
"existing quantity of consumed materials, or click :guilabel:`Update "
"Quantities & Validate` to match the consumed quantities to the quantity of "
"products produced. A :guilabel:`You produced less than the initial demand` "
"pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Producer`. Hvis mængden af forbrugte materialer "
"ikke stemmer overens med mængden af producerede produkter, vises pop op-"
"vinduet :guilabel:`Forbrugsadvarsel`. Klik på :guilabel:`Bekræft` for at "
"beholde den eksisterende mængde forbrugte materialer, eller klik "
"på :guilabel:`Opdater mængder og valider` for at tilpasse de forbrugte "
"mængder til mængden af producerede produkter. Pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Du "
"producerede mindre end det oprindelige behov` vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:57
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Create Backorder` to split the manufacturing order into two "
"separate orders, with the reference tags *WH/MO/XXXXX-001* and *WH/MO/"
"XXXXX-002*."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Opret restordre` for at opdele produktionsordren i to "
"separate ordrer med referencetags *WH/MO/XXXXX-001* og *WH/MO/XXXXX-002*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:60
msgid ""
"Create Backorder button on the \"You produced less than the initial demand\" "
"pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Tlačítko Create Backorder ve vyskakovacím okně \"You produced less than "
"initial demand\"."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:63
msgid ""
"Order *001* contains the items that have been manufactured, and is closed "
"immediately. Order *002* is the backorder that contains the items that have "
"yet to be manufactured, and remains open, to be completed at a later date."
msgstr ""
"Zakázka *001* obsahuje vyrobené položky a je okamžitě uzavřena. Zakázka "
"*002* je nedodávka obsahující položky, které mají být ještě vyrobeny, a "
"zůstává otevřená k dokončení později."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:67
msgid ""
"Once the remaining units can be manufactured, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`, "
"and then select the backorder manufacturing order. If all of the remaining "
"units are manufactured immediately, click :guilabel:`Produce` to close the "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Når de resterende enheder kan fremstilles, skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Produktion --> Operationer --> Produktionsordrer` og "
"derefter vælge restordre-produktionsordren. Hvis alle de resterende enheder "
"fremstilles med det samme, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Producer` for at "
"lukke ordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:71
msgid ""
"If only some of the remaining units are manufactured immediately, create "
"another backorder for the remainder by following the steps detailed in this "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je okamžitě vyrobena pouze část zbývajících jednotek, vytvořte další "
"nedodávku pro zbytek podle kroků popsaných v této části."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:77
msgid "Create a backorder in Shop Floor"
msgstr "Vytvoření nedodávky ve værkstedu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:79
msgid ""
"Backorders for manufacturing orders can also be created from the *Shop "
"Floor* module."
msgstr "Nedodávky pro výrobní zakázky lze také vytvářet z modulu *Værksted*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:82
msgid ""
"In order to use the *Shop Floor* module, the *Work Orders* setting must be "
"enabled. To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, enable the :guilabel:`Work Orders` checkbox, "
"and then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Aby bylo možné používat modul *Værksted*, musí být aktivováno nastavení "
"*Work Orders*. Přejděte do :menuselection:`Produktion --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, zaškrtněte políčko :guilabel:`Work Orders` a klikněte "
"na :guilabel:`Save`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:86
msgid ""
"To create a backorder from the *Shop Floor* module, begin by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Select an |MO| for multiple units of a product, for which a backorder needs "
"to be created."
msgstr ""
"Chcete-li vytvořit nedodávku z modulu *Værksted*, přejděte "
"do :menuselection:`Produktion --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders`. "
"Vyberte |MO| pro více jednotek produktu, pro který je potřeba vytvořit "
"nedodávku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:90
msgid ""
"On the |MO|, select the *Work Orders* tab, and then click the work order to "
"be processed. On the resulting :guilabel:`Work Orders` pop-up window, click "
"the :guilabel:`Open Shop Floor` button to open the *Shop Floor* module."
msgstr ""
"På |MO| skal du vælge fanen *Arbejdsordrer* og derefter klikke på den "
"arbejdsordre, der skal behandles. I det resulterende pop op-"
"vindue :guilabel:`Arbejdsordrer` skal du klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Åbn "
"Shop Floor` for at åbne modulet *Shop Floor*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:94
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_check_types/instructions_check.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_check_types/pass_fail_check.rst:126
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/quality/quality_management/quality_checks.rst:155
msgid ""
"When accessed from a specific work order, the *Shop Floor* module opens to "
"the page for the work center where the order is configured to be processed, "
"and isolates the work order's card so that no other cards are shown."
msgstr ""
"Při přístupu z konkrétní pracovní zakázky se modul *Værksted* otevře na "
"stránce pro arbejdscenter, kde je zakázka nakonfigurována ke zpracování, a "
"izoluje kartu pracovní zakázky tak, aby nebyly zobrazeny žádné jiné karty."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:98
msgid ""
"Complete the steps on the work order's card, then click :guilabel:`Produce`. "
"If the quantity of consumed materials does not match the quantity of "
"products produced, a :guilabel:`Consumption Warning` pop-up window appears. "
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` to keep the existing quantity of consumed "
"materials, or click :guilabel:`Update Quantities & Validate` to match the "
"consumed quantities to the quantity of products produced. A :guilabel:`You "
"produced less than the initial demand` pop-up window appears."
msgstr ""
"Gennemfør trinnene på arbejdsordrens kort, og klik derefter "
"på :guilabel:`Producer`. Hvis mængden af forbrugte materialer ikke stemmer "
"overens med mængden af producerede produkter, vises pop op-"
"vinduet :guilabel:`Forbrugsadvarsel`. Klik på :guilabel:`Bekræft` for at "
"beholde den eksisterende mængde forbrugte materialer, eller klik "
"på :guilabel:`Opdater mængder og valider` for at tilpasse de forbrugte "
"mængder til mængden af producerede produkter. Pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Du "
"producerede mindre end det oprindelige behov` vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:105
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Create Backorder` to split the manufacturing order into two "
"separate orders."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Opret restordre` for at opdele produktionsordren i to "
"separate ordrer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:107
msgid "The Produce button in the Shop Floor module."
msgstr "Knappen Producer i Shop Floor-modulet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:110
msgid ""
"If the original |MO| has remaining work orders that must be completed before "
"it can be closed, cards for these work orders appear on the *Shop Floor* "
"pages for the work centers where they are configured to be carried out. They "
"can be processed as normal, and additional backorders can be created from "
"their work order cards using the instructions detailed in this section."
msgstr ""
"Pokud má původní |MO| zbývající pracovní zakázky, které musí být dokončeny "
"před uzavřením, zobrazí se karty pro tyto pracovní zakázky na stránkách "
"modulu *Værksted* pro arbejdscentre, kde mají být provedeny. Lze je "
"zpracovat běžným způsobem a z jejich karet pracovních zakázek lze vytvořit "
"další nedodávky podle pokynů uvedených v této části."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:115
msgid ""
"Once the current work order for the backorder |MO| is ready to be processed, "
"this can also be completed as normal, and an additional backorder can be "
"created from its work order card by following the instructions detailed in "
"this section."
msgstr ""
"Jakmile je aktuální pracovní příkaz pro nedodávku |MO| připraven ke "
"zpracování, lze jej také dokončit běžným způsobem a z jeho karty pracovního "
"příkazu lze vytvořit další nedodávku podle pokynů uvedených v této části."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/manufacturing_backorders.rst:119
msgid ""
"After the final work order for the backorder |MO| has been completed, the |"
"MO| can be closed by clicking the :guilabel:`Close Production` button at the "
"bottom of the work order's card."
msgstr ""
"Po dokončení posledního pracovního příkazu pro nedodávku |MO| lze |MO| "
"zavřít kliknutím na tlačítko :guilabel:`Zavřít výrobu` ve spodní části karty "
"pracovního příkazu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:3
msgid "Scrap during manufacturing"
msgstr "Odpad během výroby"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:7
msgid ""
"During the manufacturing process, scrapping components or finished products "
"may be necessary when items are damaged, defective, or no longer usable."
msgstr ""
"Během výrobního procesu může být nutné odepsat komponenty nebo hotové "
"výrobky, když jsou položky poškozené, vadné nebo již nepoužitelné."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:10
msgid ""
"Tracking scrapped materials helps manufacturers monitor waste, identify "
"process issues, and account for production costs."
msgstr ""
"Sledování odepsaných materiálů pomáhá výrobcům monitorovat odpad, "
"identifikovat problémy v procesu a účtovat výrobní náklady."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Odoo, scrapped items are removed from physical inventory and moved to a "
"virtual location called *Virtual Locations/Scrap*. This location is not a "
"physical space—it is a way to log and track losses without affecting real "
"stock levels."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo jsou odepsané položky odstraněny z fyzického skladu a přesunuty do "
"virtuálního umístění nazvaného *Virtuální umístění/Odpad*. Toto umístění "
"není fyzický prostor – je to způsob, jak zaznamenávat a sledovat ztráty, "
"aniž by to ovlivnilo skutečné skladové stavy."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:18
msgid ""
":doc:`Location types <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"inventory_management>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Typy umístění <../../inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"inventory_management>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:21
msgid ""
"Scrap orders can be viewed by navigating to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Operations --> Scrap`. Each scrap order shows the date and time the order "
"was created, along with the product and quantity that was scrapped."
msgstr ""
"Příkazy k odpisu lze zobrazit přechodem do :menuselection:`Lager --> Operace "
"--> Odpad`. Každý příkaz k odpisu zobrazuje datum a čas vytvoření příkazu "
"spolu s produktem a množstvím, které bylo odepsáno."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:25
msgid ""
"To view the total quantity of each item scrapped, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Locations`, then remove "
"the :guilabel:`Internal` filter from the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to "
"display all virtual locations. From the list, select the :guilabel:`Virtual "
"Locations/Scrap` location."
msgstr ""
"Chcete-li zobrazit celkové množství každé odepsané položky, přejděte "
"do :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfigurace --> Umístění`, poté odeberte "
"filtr :guilabel:`Interní` z vyhledávacího pole :guilabel:`Hledat...`, abyste "
"zobrazili všechna virtuální umístění. Ze seznamu vyberte "
"umístění :guilabel:`Virtuální umístění/Odpad`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:33
msgid "Navigate to the scrap window"
msgstr "Přechod do okna odpisu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:35
msgid ""
"Scrapping can be done in either the **Manufacturing** app or the **Shop "
"Floor** module, depending on the task."
msgstr ""
"Odpisování lze provádět buď v aplikaci **Produktion**, nebo v modulu "
"**Værksted**, v závislosti na úkolu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:38
msgid "**Manufacturing** app allows:"
msgstr "Aplikace **Produktion** umožňuje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:40
msgid "Scrapping finished products (only if the |MO| is in the *Done* stage)."
msgstr "Odpisování hotových výrobků (pouze pokud je |MO| ve fázi *Hotovo*)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:41
msgid ""
"Scrapping components (while the |MO| is in the *Draft* or *Confirmed* stage)."
msgstr ""
"Odpisování komponent (zatímco je |MO| ve fázi *Koncept* nebo *Potvrzeno*)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:43
msgid "**Shop Floor** allows:"
msgstr "**Værksted** umožňuje:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:45
msgid "Scrapping only components."
msgstr "Odpisování pouze komponent."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:48
msgid "Manufacturing app"
msgstr "Aplikace Produktion"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:50
msgid ""
"To scrap a product from the **Manufacturing** app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Manufacturing --> Operations --> Manufacturing Orders` "
"and select the desired |MO|."
msgstr ""
"Chcete-li odepsat produkt z aplikace **Produktion**, přejděte "
"do :menuselection:`Produktion --> Operace --> Výrobní příkazy` a vyberte "
"požadovaný |MO|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:53
msgid ""
"On the |MO|, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then "
"choose :guilabel:`Scrap` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Na |MO| klikněte na ikonu :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Akce)`, poté z "
"rozevírací nabídky vyberte :guilabel:`Odpad`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/workflows/scrap_manufacturing.rst:56
msgid "MO with the cog's drop-down menu revealed, to show the Scrap option."
msgstr ""
"Výrobní příkaz s rozevírací nabídkou ozubeného kola zobrazující možnost "
