#~ msgid ""
#~ "The available rules trigger various actions. If Odoo offers *Push* and "
#~ "*Pull* rules, others are also available. Each rule has "
#~ "an :guilabel:`Action`:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "De tilgængelige regler udløser forskellige handlinger. Hvis Odoo tilbyder "
#~ "*Push*- og *Pull*-regler, er der også andre tilgængelige. Hver regel har "
#~ "en :guilabel:`Handling`:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Pull From`: this rule is triggered by a need for the product "
#~ "in a specific location. The need can come from a sales order being "
#~ "validated or from a manufacturing order requiring a specific component. "
#~ "When the need appears in the destination location, Odoo generates a "
#~ "picking to fulfill this need."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Træk Fra`: denne regel udløses af et behov for produktet på en "
#~ "bestemt placering. Behovet kan komme fra en salgsordre, der er ved at "
#~ "blive valideret, eller fra en produktionsordre, der kræver en specifik "
#~ "komponent. Når behovet opstår på destinationsplaceringen, genererer Odoo "
#~ "en plukning for at opfylde dette behov."

#~ msgid ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Push To`: this rule is triggered by the arrival of some "
#~ "products in the defined source location. In the case of the user moving "
#~ "products to the source location, Odoo generates a picking to move those "
#~ "products to the destination location."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Skub Til`: denne regel udløses af ankomsten af nogle produkter "
#~ "på den definerede kildeplaceringen. I tilfælde af at brugeren flytter "
#~ "produkter til kildeplaceringen, genererer Odoo en plukning for at flytte "
#~ "disse produkter til destinationsplaceringen."

#~ msgid ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Pull & Push`: this rule allows the generation of pickings in "
#~ "the two situations explained above. This means that when products are "
#~ "required at a specific location, a transfer is created from the previous "
#~ "location to fulfill that need. This creates a need in the previous "
#~ "location and a rule is triggered to fulfill it. Once the second need is "
#~ "fulfilled, the products are pushed to the destination location and all "
#~ "the needs are fulfilled."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Træk & Skub`: denne regel gør det muligt at generere "
#~ "plukninger i de to situationer, der er forklaret ovenfor. Det betyder, at "
#~ "når produkter er påkrævet på en bestemt placering, oprettes en overførsel "
#~ "fra den forrige placering for at opfylde dette behov. Dette skaber et "
#~ "behov på den forrige placering, og en regel udløses for at opfylde det. "
#~ "Når det andet behov er opfyldt, skubbes produkterne til "
#~ "destinationsplaceringen, og alle behov er opfyldt."

#~ msgid ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Buy`: when products are needed at the destination location, a "
#~ "request for quotation is created to fulfill the need."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Køb`: når produkter er nødvendige på destinationsplaceringen, "
#~ "oprettes en anmodning om tilbud for at opfylde behovet."

#~ msgid ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Manufacture`: when products are needed in the source location, "
#~ "a manufacturing order is created to fulfill the need."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Fremstil`: når produkter er nødvendige på kildeplaceringen, "
#~ "oprettes en produktionsordre for at opfylde behovet."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Overview of a \"Pull From\" rule that creates a transfer between the "
#~ "stock and the packing\n"
#~ "zone."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Overblik over en \"Træk Fra\"-regel, der opretter en overførsel mellem "
#~ "lageret og pakkezonen."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The :guilabel:`Operation Type` must also be defined on the rule. This "
#~ "defines which kind of picking is created from the rule."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Operationstype` skal også defineres på reglen. Dette "
#~ "definerer, hvilken type plukning der oprettes fra reglen."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If the rule's :guilabel:`Action` is set to :guilabel:`Pull From` "
#~ "or :guilabel:`Pull & Push`, a :guilabel:`Supply Method` must be set. "
#~ "The :guilabel:`Supply Method` defines what happens at the source location:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Pokud je :guilabel:`Akce` pravidla nastavena na :guilabel:`Táhnout z` "
#~ "nebo :guilabel:`Táhnout a tlačit`, musí být nastavena :guilabel:`Metoda "
#~ "dodání`. :guilabel:`Metoda dodání` určuje, co se stane ve zdrojové lokaci:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Take From Stock`: the products are taken from the available "
#~ "stock of the source location."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Vzít ze skladu`: produkty jsou odebrány z dostupných zásob "
#~ "zdrojové lokace."

#~ msgid ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Trigger Another Rule`: the system tries to find a stock rule "
#~ "to bring the products to the source location. The available stock is "
#~ "ignored."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Spustit jiné pravidlo`: systém se pokusí najít skladové "
#~ "pravidlo, aby přinesl produkty do zdrojové lokace. Dostupné zásoby jsou "
#~ "ignorovány."

#~ msgid ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Take From Stock, if Unavailable, Trigger Another Rule`: the "
#~ "products are taken from the available stock of the source location. If "
#~ "there is no stock available, the system tries to find a rule to bring the "
#~ "products to the source location."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ ":guilabel:`Vzít ze skladu, pokud není k dispozici, spustit jiné "
#~ "pravidlo`: produkty jsou odebrány z dostupných zásob zdrojové lokace. "
#~ "Pokud nejsou k dispozici žádné zásoby, systém se pokusí najít pravidlo, "
#~ "aby přinesl produkty do zdrojové lokace."

